<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱</para>
  <para style="toc3">U.Wl</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wila̱</para>
  <para style="toc1">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱</para>
  <para style="mt2">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa Aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱ ugeru u tsuɓari tsa ɗa a na Musa cayi aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, uba̱ta̱ u na e isawain o ukosu wu mmalu ma alanga n le ma̱ a̱tsumona ele a zama a uwwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana a usa yi wo o'wo za le. Ili i na a la'a yuwain adanshi e le a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada'a ele ɗa, Musa cuwan ta̱ ni ili i na i farai a̱ca̱pa̱ a'wan amunga. U pati ta̱ ama'a a cuwan cine A̱sula̱ o rono nle aɗanga a̱tsumona, reve waru a yuwaan A̱sula̱ tsutoni waru a ca yi tsugbain. Musa ka̱mbisa̱ ta̱ Wila̱ Kupa reve u a̱vu u ca ucira o urevu u Wila̱ wu ufaru, adansaa ama'a a yuwan A̱sulazuva goon a̱ga̱nda̱. Reve waru u ka̱mbisa̱ wila̱ ro na vaa kamba aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na a yuwaan nle nzuwulai. Musa cuwaan ta̱ ama urevu wa akucunu a̱ A̱sula̱ ne ele, reve u damma le a ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu e itoni ya̱ yi. A zuwa ta̱ Josuwa wo o'wo zagbain ve elime va ama a̱ A̱sula̱. Ana u canai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u zuwaa gundo va Isra'ila aba'un, Musa kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, asana nu Uɗolu wa̱ Jeriko. Aciyadanshi a gbain va Aatagada'a a̱yi ɗa, A̱sula̱ a wawa ta̱ reve u zuwaa ama a̱ yi a na u ɗangwai aba'un aza a na u cigai, ama a̱ yi waru a cuwan ni ili i nda, reve a ciga waru a yuwaan yi tsutoni adama a̱ tsura̱ wuma waru na aba'un a̱ 'ya̱wa̱. Guzu vu ucira va Aatagada'a a̱ ta̱ na adanshi a na Yesu ɗeyi wila̱ u na u la'ai gbain suru suru, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ta̱, na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru, nu ucira u ɗu suru 6:4-6. Ili i na i ri pe a Aatagada'a Adanshi o ufaru a Musa 1:1-4:49 Adanshi e ire a Musa 5:1-26:19 a. Wila̱ kupa 5:1-10:22 b. Wila̱, ili i na aa yuwan na̱ morono ma atsuvu 11:1-2619 Uritosu cine aa uwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana 27:1-28:68 A dammisai akucunu'u 29:1-30:20 Adanshi o ukosu wa Musa 31:1-33:29 Ukwa̱ wa Musa 34:1-12.</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa Aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱ ugeru u tsuɓari tsa ɗa a na Musa cayi aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, uba̱ta̱ u na e isawain o ukosu wu mmalu ma alanga n le ma̱ a̱tsumona ele a zama a uwwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana a usa yi wo o'wo za le. Ili i na a la'a yuwain adanshi e le a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada'a ele ɗa: (1) Musa cuwan ta̱ ni ili i na i farai a̱ca̱pa̱ a'wan amunga. U pati ta̱ ama'a a cuwan cine A̱sula̱ o rono nle aɗanga a̱tsumona, reve waru a yuwaan A̱sula̱ tsutoni waru a ca yi tsugbain. (2) Musa ka̱mbisa̱ ta̱ Wila̱ Kupa reve u a̱vu u ca ucira o urevu u Wila̱ wu ufaru, adansaa ama'a a yuwan A̱sulazuva goon a̱ga̱nda̱. Reve waru u ka̱mbisa̱ wila̱ ro na vaa kamba aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na a yuwaan nle nzuwulai. Musa cuwaan ta̱ ama urevu wa akucunu a̱ A̱sula̱ ne ele, reve u damma le a ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu e itoni ya̱ yi. A zuwa ta̱ Josuwa wo o'wo zagbain ve elime va ama a̱ A̱sula̱. Ana u canai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u zuwaa gundo va Isra'ila aba'un, Musa kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, asana nu Uɗolu wa̱ Jeriko. Aciyadanshi a gbain va Aatagada'a a̱yi ɗa, A̱sula̱ a wawa ta̱ reve u zuwaa ama a̱ yi a na u ɗanwa̱i aba'un aza a na u cigai, ama a̱ yi waru a cuwan ni ili i nda, reve a ciga waru a yuwaan yi tsutoni adama a̱ tsura̱ wuma waru na aba'un a̱ 'ya̱wa̱. Guzu vu ucira va Aatagada'a a̱ ta̱ na adanshi a na Yesu ɗeyi wila̱ u na u la'ai gbain suru suru, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ta̱, na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru, nu ucira u ɗu suru 6:4-6. Ili i na i ri pe a Aatagada'a Adanshi o ufaru a Musa 1:1-4:49 Adanshi e ire a Musa 5:1-26:19 a. Wila̱ kupa 5:1-10:22 b. Wila̱, ili i na aa yuwan na̱ morono ma atsuvu 11:1-2619 Uritosu cine aa uwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana 27:1-28:68 A dammisai akucunu'u 29:1-30:20 Adanshi o ukosu wa Musa 31:1-33:29 Ukwa̱ wa Musa 34:1-12.</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa Aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Uka̱mbisa̱ u Wila̱ ugeru u tsuɓari tsa ɗa a na Musa cayi aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, uba̱ta̱ u na e isawain o ukosu wu mmalu ma alanga n le ma̱ a̱tsumona ele a zama a uwwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana a usa yi wo o'wo za le. Ili i na a la'a yuwain adanshi e le a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada'a ele ɗa: (1) Musa cuwan ta̱ ni ili i na i farai a̱ca̱pa̱ a'wan amunga. U pati ta̱ ama'a a cuwan cine A̱sula̱ o rono nle aɗanga a̱tsumona, reve waru a yuwaan A̱sula̱ tsutoni waru a ca yi tsugbain. (2) Musa ka̱mbisa̱ ta̱ Wila̱ Kupa reve u ca ucira o urevu u Wila̱ wu ufaru, adansaa ama'a a yuwan A̱sulazuva goon a̱ga̱nda̱. Reve waru u ka̱mbisa̱ wila̱ ro na vaa kamba aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na a yuwaan nle nzuwulai. Musa cuwaan ta̱ ama urevu wa akucunu a̱ A̱sula̱ ne ele, reve u damma le a ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu e itoni ya̱ yi. (4) A zuwa ta̱ Josuwa wo o'wo zagbain ve elime va ama a̱ A̱sula̱. Ana u canai ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u zuwaa gundo va Isra'ila aba'un, Musa kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa, asana nu Uɗolu wa̱ Jeriko. Aciyadanshi a gbain va Aatagada'a a̱yi ɗa, A̱sula̱ a wawa ta̱ reve u zuwaa ama a̱ yi a na u ɗangwai aba'un aza a na u cigai, ama a̱ yi waru a cuwan ni ili i nda, reve a ciga waru a yuwaan yi tsutoni adama a̱ tsura̱ wuma waru na aba'un a̱ 'ya̱wa̱. Guzu vu ucira va Aatagada'a a̱ ta̱ na adanshi a na Yesu ɗeyi wila̱ u na u la'ai gbain suru suru, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ta̱, na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru, nu ucira u ɗu suru 6:4-6.</para>
  <para style="is">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io">Adanshi o ufaru a Musa 1:1-4:49</para>
  <para style="io">Adanshi e ire a Musa 5:1-26:19</para>
  <para style="io">Wila̱ kupa 5:1-10:22 b.</para>
  <para style="io">Wila̱ ni ili i na aa yuwan na̱ morono ma atsuvu 11:1-2619</para>
  <para style="io">Uritosu cine aa uwa e iɗa ya Ka'ana 27:1-28:68</para>
  <para style="io">A dammisa akucunu'u 29:1-30:20</para>
  <para style="io">Adanshi o ukosu wa Musa 31:1-33:29</para>
  <para style="io">Ukwa̱ wa Musa 34:1-12.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">A zuwa ta̱ a lyawa Horeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Ele nda ele ɗa adanshi a na Musa yuwayin aza a Isra'ila suru upasalai wa asana wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱ a̱tsumona a Araba za na ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Suf, e memere ma Faran na̱ Tofe na̱ Laban na̱ Hazero na̱ Dizaha. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Mmalu mu rana kupa na̱ za ta̱ ɗa diga Horeb a̱ tyo Kadesh Baniya nu ure u Masasan ma̱ Seyi.<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />O urana wu ufaru u woto wa kupa na̱ za ta̱ wa aa'wan amunga a na aza a Isra'ila o uta̱i Masar, reve Musa damma aza a Isra'ila ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma niyi suru adama e le. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />A mantsa'a gba cina a lyuwa Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya ɗa, za na yuwain tsugono a Heshibon na̱ Og mogono ma Bashan za na da̱nuyi Ashitaro na̱ Edirai.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Asana a̱ Urudu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ Mowa ɗa Musa temei a cuɗuwusa wila̱ u nda, u damma:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a damma tsu ta̱ a Horeb a na, &lt;I jima ta̱ na̱ nden a masasan ma nda. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />'Yoyin i reme ure a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi ya aza a Amoriya, i tyo uba̱ta̱ wu nron mu nden n le suru upasu wa Araba, e iɗa ya agaɗi ne e iɗa i mugaɗi na̱ Nege nu upasu wu nge'en m mala, a̱ tyo e iɗa ya aza a Ka'ana waru a̱ tyo Lebanon, hali a̱ tyo o Uɗolu u gbain wa̱ Yufiriti. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nlo, n ca nɗu iɗa i nda. Uwai pe i ushi iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a kucinai na waa ca nkaya n ɗu, Ibrahim ni Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu waru a̱ tyo a limatan va̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzuwusa wa azagbain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 18:13-27">Mta̱ 18:13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ndolo, n damma ɗu ta̱, &lt;Maa gura tara ume u ɗu a̱mu a̱ nde'en shi. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ da̱shi ɗu ta̱ a̱bunda̱, hali a̱ɗu ɗa nda ana'an a̱bunda̱ tsi italyo'o ya zuva. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n ɗu a̱ da̱shi doɓonu ɗu a̱bunda̱ ukpakukupa kupa, a̱vu u zuwaa ɗu aba'un cine u yuwain nzuwulai! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Amma a̱mu a̱ nde'en cine maa gura tara ili i na yaa damatosun ɗu nu ume u ɗu na̱ nronuloi n ɗu? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Ɗangulai ama a̱ ta̱ ta̱ diga o ugundo suru, a̱za̱ o ugbozu nu urevu, aza a na aa casu tsugbain, n ta zuwa le tsugbain a aci a̱ ɗu.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Reve i usu mu, &lt;Ili i na vu foɓoi u lobono ta̱.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa n tarai azagbain o gundo ɗu, a̱za̱ o ugbozu aza a na aa casu tsugbain, reve n zuwa le tsugbain tsa̱ ɗu, azagbain o ukpakukupa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ o ukpaku ukpaku na aza a kupoton uton na aza a kupa kupa, o o'wo azagbain o gundo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Reve n rono a̱za̱ o uge'etosu a̱ ɗu atsuvu a mantsa'a n damma, &lt;Yu uwwa nronuloi ma na a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu aa yuwusan, a̱vu i ge'eto mejege, ko na adanshi'i za vu za va Isra'ila na̱ za va Isra'ila ɗa ko uba̱ta̱ wu za va Isra'ila na̱ mocin ɗa. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />She i roco aɗangulu a̱tsuma̱ o uge'etosu wan. I polo atsuvu yu uwwa vuma ke'en na̱ zagbain suru una̱ta̱. She yu uwwa wovon wu za wan, adama a na uge'etosu za va̱ A̱sula̱ a ɗa. I ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na adanshi a na a la'a nɗu ucira, mu uwwa yi.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />A mantsa mo ndolo n damma ɗu ta̱ ili i na yaa yuwan suru.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ lyungu ta̱ aza a matawa mo utyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 13:1-33">Mkc 13:1-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />&lt;&lt;Reve cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a zuwa ntsu, tsu 'yon diga Horeb reve tsu kuru a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi ya aza a Amoriya na̱ a̱tsumona a gbain o wovon o ndolo a na ye enei. Reve tsu rawa Kadesh Baniya. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Reve n damma ɗu, &lt;I rawa ta̱ iɗa ya agaɗi ya aza a Amoriya, za na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu aa casu tsu. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca ɗu ta̱ iɗa'a. 'Ya̱wa̱i i usa yi cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n ɗu a damma nɗu. She yu uwwa wovon wan, waru she okolo a̱ ɗu a kuɗa wan.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />&lt;&lt;Reve suru nɗu i ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ a̱vu i damma, &lt;Lyawa tsu lyunguyi ama elime a̱ tsu a tawaa tsu utyo wi iɗa'a, reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ a damma tsu ure u na tsa̱a̱ kuruwa̱a̱ ni ilyuci i na tsaa uwa.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Reve me ene a̱sa̱la̱'a̱ o lobono mu ta̱. Ɗaɗa n ɗangwai ama kupa ne ejere, ugundo suru vuma ta̱. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Reve a̱ 'yon a gawan a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi, reve a rawa o uka̱ri wa Eshikol a̱vu a tawa iɗa'a utyo. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Reve a tara umatsun wu ɗanga vi iɗa'a e ekere e le a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu, reve a damma, &lt;Iɗa i sa'ani i ɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu aa casu tsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a̱ 'ya̱sa̱yin A̱sulazuva aci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />&lt;&lt;Agba i shi a zama i gawan ɗe shi. I 'yuwan a yuwaan adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu tsutoni. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />I yuwan ta̱ adanshawuya o ogodo a̱ ɗu i damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva a 'yuwan tsu ta̱, ɗaɗa i zuwai wu uta̱a̱ ntsu e iɗa ya Masar, adama u zuwa tsu e ekere a aza a Amoriya tsa̱ra̱ o kototo tsu. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Te tsee tyo? A̱za̱ a̱ tsu a na tsu lyunguyi a zuwa ta̱ okolo a̱ tsu a kuɗa. A damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ama'a a la'a tsu ta̱ ucira nu uga'an. Ilyuci'i a̱ ta̱ gbagbain na̱ kari hali she zuva. Hali gba tse ene ta̱ aza a Anaku ɗe.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />&lt;&lt;Reve n damma ɗu, &lt;She okolo a̱ 'yon ɗu ko yu uwwa wovon u le wan. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu zane ri elime a̱ ɗu u ta yuwan uvon adama a̱ ɗu, cine u yuwaan nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar e esu a̱ ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />na̱ a̱ a̱tsumona waru. Uba̱ta̱ u na ye enei cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a tanu nɗu, cine dada tsu tanu mawun ma̱ yi, a̱tsuma̱ a mmalu n ɗu suru hali i rawa pa.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />&lt;&lt;Suru na̱ ne, i 'yuwan ta̱ a zuwaa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu ucira, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />za na walai elime a̱ ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a mmalu n ɗu, na akina na ayin, waru ne eleshe nu urana, adama u zamiya ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na ya̱a̱ va̱la̱, reve waru u roco ɗu ure u na ya̱a̱ kuru.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ aza a Isra'ila oforo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 14:20-45">Mkc 14:20-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />&lt;&lt;Ana A̱sulazuva a uwwai ili i na i dammai, u yuwan ta̱ upan lon. Reve u kucina, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />&lt;Ko vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama a nda va mantsa ma wuya ma nda wee ene iɗa i sa'ani i na n kucinai na maa ca nkaya n ɗu shi, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />she Keleb ulobo wa Jefune. U te ene yi, waru n ta ca yi na̱ muwun mu ugundo ma̱ yi iɗa i na u dasai na anana a̱ yi, adama a na u kuru ta̱ A̱sulazuva no okolo a̱ ta̱.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />&lt;&lt;Adama a̱ ɗu a ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain upan na̱ a̱mu, a̱vu u damma, &lt;A̱vu fo vaa uwa pe shi. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Amma Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, za na aa kambusa wu, u ta uwa. Vu da̱shi yi okolo ugbamu, adama a na a̱yi ɗa woo rono aza a Isra'ila aɗanga o o'wo ni iɗa'a. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Waru muwun n ɗu aza a na i dammai e te reme le o uvon, aza a na koto e revei isa'ani ni iwuya shi, a ta uwa e iɗa'a. N ta ca le a̱yi, reve a tara yi wo o'wo za le. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Amma a̱ɗu gba, i vadala i ka̱mba̱ a̱ tyo a̱tsumona nu ure u Mala ma̱ Shili.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />&lt;&lt;Reve i usu, &lt;Tsu yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva unusu. Tsu ta gawan tsu yuwain uvon cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a zuwa ntsu.&gt; Ɗaɗa za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu tarai itana yu uvon ya̱ yi, a majiyan ili yu usa̱n i ɗa shi i gawan a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />&lt;&lt;Amma A̱sulazuva a damma mu ta̱, &lt;Damma le, she i gawan i 'ya̱wa̱ uvon wan adama a na ma̱a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu shi. Na̱ ne ɗa shi, n'yuwatan n ɗu n ta lyuwa ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />&lt;&lt;Ne ɗa gba n damma nɗu, agba yu uwwa shi. A̱vu i yuwaan adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva aciyogbamu, reve a̱tsuma̱ a aciyogbamu a̱ ɗu i ka̱ra̱ a gawan a uwa e iɗa ya agaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Reve gba aza a Amoriya a na a̱ ri nden e iɗa ya agaɗi o ndolo o uta̱ adama a̱ ɗu. Reve a saɓa ɗu na̱ a̱bunda̱ tsi ishiki, a̱vu e reme ma̱dukwa̱ ma̱ ɗu diga Seyi hali a̱ tyo Homa. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ana i ka̱mba̱i a̱vu i shon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, agba wu uwwa mesun ma̱ ɗu shi ko u poloo ɗu atsuva shi. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai i yuwain rana a̱bunda̱ Kadesh, cine i yuwain ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Agara a̱ A̱tsumona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Reve tsu vadala tsu reme ure a̱ tyo a̱tsumona nu ure u Mala ma̱ Shili, cine A̱sulazuva a damma numu. Reve tsu yuwan rana va̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwusa̱ iɗa ya agaɗi ya Seyi.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />&lt;&lt;I jima ta̱ a̱ka̱nda̱riya̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi i nda. Vadalai a̱ tyo upasu wu ugana. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Vu damma ama adanshi a nda: &lt;I ta azama yu utula̱i ni iɗa yi mmaci n ɗu, umatsun wa Isuwa aza a na a̱ ri nden a Seyi. A ta uwwa wovon u ɗu, amma i yuwan ugbozu. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />She i zami le nla̱ngi wan, adama a na maa ca ɗu ko iɗa i ta̱ i le shi, ko i na i rawai na yaa dasa anana a̱ ɗu shi. N ca ta̱ ɗe Isuwa upasu wa agaɗi wa Seyi wo o'wo za va̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />I ta tsula ilyalya i na yaa lyuwa na̱ mini ma na yoo sowo ya̱'a̱ le na̱ azurufa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa ta̱ ulinga we ekere a̱ ɗu suru aba'un. U reve ta̱ na̱ mmalu n ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsumona a gbain a nda. A'wan amunga a nda A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu, waru i lamba ko ili shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Ɗaɗa tsu ka̱ra̱i tsu kanzu'wai a̱za̱ a̱ tsu ugundo wa Isuwa, aza a na a̱ ri nden Seyi. Tsu vadala ta̱ diga o ure wa Araba nu ure wa Ela na̱ Eziyon Geba. Reve tsu saɓa a̱ tyo a̱ a̱tsumona a̱ Mowa.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;She i damaton a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa wan agba she i zami le uvon wan, adama a na maa ca ɗu ko upasu u ro wi iɗa i le shi. N ca ta̱ ɗe ugundo wa̱ Lutu iɗa ya Ar wo o'wo za le.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />&lt;&lt;Aza a Emim a ɗa a̱ shi nden ɗe, ama o ucira na̱ a̱bunda̱, uga'an she damma aza a Anaku. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Tsa ama a Anaku, ele fo a tara le ta̱ aza a Refaya, amma a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a̱ tsu ɗe le ta̱ aza a Emim. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Aza a Horiya a ɗa a̱ shi nden a Seyi. Amma ugundo wa Isuwa u gba̱ra̱ le ta̱. O una ta̱ aza a Horiya a na a fara da̱nuwa̱ nle lo, reve a̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱ u le cine Isra'ila yuwain ni iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a ca nle wo o'wo za le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;Gogo 'yoyin i pasa Uka̱ri wa Zere.&gt; Ɗaɗa tsu pasai uka̱ri'i. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />A yuwan ta̱ a'wan mata'atsu na̱ kunla̱ diga a mantsa ma na tsu lyawai Kadesh Baniya a̱ tyo mantsa ma na tsu pasai Uka̱ri wa Zere. Hali she na aza a na a rawai uvon suru a̱ kuwa̱i o uva̱la̱ta̱ cine A̱sulazuva a kucinaa nle. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u shi ta̱ a̱ nla̱ngi ne ele, hali she na u kototo nle suru suru diga o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />&lt;&lt;Reve ana aza a na a rawai uvo'on a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ kuwa̱i suru, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />a̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma mu, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />&lt;Ana'an i ta pasa nu utyo wa̱ Mowa nu ure wa Ar. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />A mantsa ma na i rawai uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Amon, she i damaton le ko i zami le uvon wan, adama a na maa ca ɗu ko upasu u ro wi iɗa wa aza a Amon shi. N ca ta̱ ugundo wa̱ Lutu a̱yi woo o'wo za le.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />&lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱'a̱ waru a̱ shi ta̱ a tara yi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Refaya u ɗa, aza a na a̱ shi nden lo. Amma aza a Amon a̱ tsu ɗe le ta̱ aza a Zamzumi. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Ele ama o ucira a ɗa a̱ shi na̱ a̱bunda̱, waru nu uga'an tsa aza a Anaku. A̱sulazuva o kototo le ta̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Amon, aza a na a̱ gba̱ra̱ nle reve a̱ da̱nu lo. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Ne ɗa waru A̱sulazuva a yuwayin ugundo wa Isuwa aza a na a̱ shi na̱ nden a Seyi, ana u kototoi aza a Horiya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me ele. Reve a̱ gba̱ra̱ le a̱vu a̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱'a̱ hali na ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Amma aza a Aviya, aza a na a̱ shi na̱ nden a̱ mulyuci ma Gaza, ele aza a Karita a na o uta̱i Kafato, a̱vu o kototo le reve a̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱'a̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">A lyuwa ta̱ Sihon mogono ma Heshibon nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Mkc 21:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;'Yoyin i reme ure i pasa Uɗolu wa Anon. A̱yi ɗa ndolo n ca nɗu Sihon za va Amoriya mogono ma Heshibon ni iɗa ya̱ yi e ekere a̱ ɗu. Farai a̱ ka̱mba̱tosu yi za ɗu i reme uvon na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Diga ana'an n ta fara a zuwusa meje'en ma̱ lipu na̱ wovon u ɗu e iɗa suru a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. Nna a uwwa alabari a̱ ɗu e te je'en lipu reve a da'wan.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />&lt;&lt;Reve n lyungu nlingata diga a̱ a̱tsumona a Kedemo a̱ tyo ya Sihon mogono ma Heshibon e izami yi nden ma alafiya, n damma, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />&lt;Lyawa tsu, tsu utula̱i ni iɗa ya̱ wu. Tsu ta̱ kuru o ure mejege, tsaa ɓatsa usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Ilyalya i na tsaa lyuwa na̱ mini mo oso tsu ta tsupa na̱ azurufa. Vu lyawa tsu tsu dasa o utula̱i ni iɗa ya̱ wu goon, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />cine ugundo wa Isuwa aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden Seyi na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a na a̱ ri nden a Ar a yuwaan ntsu, hali tsu pasa Urudu a̱ tyo e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu aa casu tsu.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Amma a̱vu Sihon mogono ma Heshibon ma putsa tsu o utula̱i. Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa yi ta̱ aciyogbamu no okolo o ugbawu adama u ca ɗu a̱yi e ekere a̱ ɗu, cine u yuwain gogo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;A̱yi ɗa nda, n fara ta̱ a casu ɗu Sihon ni iɗa ya̱ yi, farai a lyuwusa iɗa ya̱ yi wo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />&lt;&lt;Reve ana Sihon uta̱i na ama a̱ yi adama u yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu a Jaha, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />a̱vu gba A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ca tsu a̱yi, reve tsu lyuwa yi no olobo a̱ yi oɓolo na ama a̱ yi suru. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />A mantsa'a reve tsu usa ilyuci ya̱ yi suru, reve tsu kototo le suru suru, ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun. Tsu lyawa ko za la'a shi. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Amma iliyamunga nu utsuru wi ilyuci i na tsu lyuwai, ele ɗa goon tsu pura̱yi aciya̱tsu. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Diga Arowa za na ri a̱ nge'en mu Uɗolu wa Anon, na̱ diga a̱ lyuci na ri o uɗolu'u waru, hali a̱ tyo Giliyadu, ko lyuci ta̱ la'a ucira u tsu shi. A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ca tsu ta̱ ele suru. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />She iɗa ya ama a Amon ɗa goon tsu rawai zuzu shi, ni iɗa i na i ri a̱ nge'en mu uɗolu wa Jabo ni ilyuci yi iɗa ya agaɗi, na̱ ba̱ta̱ na suru A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a putsa ntsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a lyuwai Og mogono ma Bashan nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Mkc 21:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Reve tsu vadala tsu ka̱ra̱ a gawan a̱ tyo upasu wa Bashan. A̱vu Og mogono ma Bashan na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi suru o uta̱ adama a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu a̱ lyuci va Edirai. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;She vu uwwa wovon wa̱ yi wan, n ca wu a̱yi ta̱ ɗe e ekere a̱ wu na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi suru ni iɗa ya̱ yi. Vu yuwan na̱ a̱yi cine vu yuwain na̱ Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya, za na yuwain tsugono tsa Heshibon.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />&lt;&lt;Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ca ntsu fo Og mogono ma Bashan na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi suru e ekere a̱ tsu. Reve tsu kototo le tsu lyawa ko vuma ta̱ la'a shi. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />A mantsa'a reve tsu lyuwa ilyuci i gbagbain ya̱ yi suru. Ko lyuci ta̱ tsu lyawa babu usa e ekere e le shi, ilyuci kupota̱li, nu upasu wi iɗa wa Argo suru uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tsa Og mogono a̱tsuma̱ a Bashan. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Ilyuci i nda suru a̱ shi ta̱ na̱ kari vu uga'an na̱ na̱ntsu vu ɗanga memere waru a̱ shi ta̱ na̱ mulyuci ma̱ a̱bunda̱ n na n ri na̱ kari shi. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Tsu kototo le ta̱ suru suru cine tsu yuwain na̱ Sihon mogono ma Heshibon. Tsu kototo ta̱ lyuci gbain suru, na ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci oɓolo na̱ muwun. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Amma iliyamunga nu utsuru wi ilyuci i na tsu lyuwai suru tso o'woto le ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ tsu.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa'a ne ɗa tsu usai iɗa e ekere o ngono n re ma aza a Amoriya iɗa i na i ri asana a̱ Urudu, diga o Uɗolu wa Anon hali a̱ tyo a Masasan ma Hamon. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />Aza a Sidon a̱ tsu ɗe ta̱ Hamon Siriyon, amma aza a Amoriya a̱ tsu ɗe yi ta̱ Seni. <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Tsu lyuwa ta̱ ilyuci yu upasu wa agaɗi suru, nu upasu wa Giliyadu suru, nu upasu wa Bashan suru hali a̱ tyo Saleka na̱ Edirai, aza a na a̱ ri upasu u tsugono tso mogono Og a̱tsuma̱ a Bashan. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />Og mogono ma Bashan ma ɗa goon ma la'ai o ugundo wa aza a Refaya. A̱ga̱da̱ a̱ yi a yuwan yi ta̱ ni irumu waru uga'an wa̱ yi u la'a ta̱ ana kupa na aza a ta'atsu, washin wa̱ yi ana a̱ ta̱li. U ta̱ ɗe a̱tsuma̱ a Raba va aza a Amon hali na ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Une'esun wi iɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 32:1-42">Mkc 32:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na tsu usai iɗa'a n ca ta̱ ugundo wa̱ Roben na̱ Gadu upasu wu ugana wa Arowa za na ri a̱ nge'en mu Uɗolu wa Anon, oɓolo nu uɓatsulai wi iɗa ya agaɗi wa Giliyadu ni ilyuci ya̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Akapi e iɗa ya Giliyadu oɓolo na̱ Bashan suru, uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tso Og, upasu wi iɗa ya Argo suru, n ca ta̱ uɓatsulai wu ugundo wa Manase a̱yi. Upasu wa Argo u ndolo suru a̱tsuma̱ a Bashan a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ tsu ɗe yi iɗa ya aza a Refaya. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Jayi, za vu ugundo wa Manase u tara ta̱ upasu wa Argo suru diga o utyo wa aza a Geshu na aza a Ma'aka, a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ tsu ɗe yi na ala a̱ yi. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai hali na ana'an nda a̱ tsu ɗe Bashan, Havot Jayi. <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Reve n ca Maki Giliyadu. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Reve n ca ugundo wa̱ Roben na̱ Gadu upasu u na u tarai diga Giliyadu a̱ cipa̱ a̱ tyo o uɗolu wa Anon, memere mo uka̱ri'i a̱yi ɗa utyo hali o utula̱i nu Uɗolu wa Jabo utyo wa aza a Amon. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Waru n ca le ta̱ Araba, Urudu a̱yi ɗa utyo wa̱ yi diga a Mala ma̱ Ga̱lili hali a̱ tyo a Mala ma Araba, Mala ma Akpaɗi, za̱la̱ vu uzuru wa Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />&lt;&lt;Reve n damma ɗu a mantsa'a, a na, &lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca ɗu ta̱ iɗa i nda wo o'wo za ɗu. Ama a̱ ɗu a na a rawai uvon suru, o to foɓo a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu. A ta uwa elime a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu aza a Isra'ila, a kamba le. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Amma a̱ma̱ci a̱ ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu ni iliyamunga i ɗu n reve ta̱ i ta̱ ni iliyamunga a̱bunda̱ i lyawa le e ilyuci i gbagbain i na n ca nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Hali she na̱ A̱sulazuva a ca a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu wivuwun cine u ca nɗu, reve na a usa iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a casu le mavada ma̱ Urudu, za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu gba u ta gura ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u na n ca nɗu wo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A putsa ta̱ Musa a pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa'a n damma ta̱ Josuwa, &lt;Ve ene ta̱ ne esu a̱ wu ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwain na̱ ngono n re nda suru. Ne ɗa waa yuwan na̱ ngono mu uba̱ta̱ u na yaa pasa a̱ tyo suru. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />She yu uwwa wovon u le wan; A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu na aciya̱yi u ta yuwan uvon adama a̱ ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa'a reve m pati A̱sulazuva n damma: <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />&lt;A̱sulazuva Zagbain, vu fara ta̱ o rocosu aagbashi a̱ wu tsugbain tsa̱ wu nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ wu. Ma̱sula̱ ma̱ ne ma ɗa ma̱ ri lo zuva ko o uvaɗi na waa gura yuwan cu'un vi ili nda na̱ linga vu ucira tsa̱ wu? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Yuwan ankuri lyawa mu m pasa me ene iɗa i sa'ani i na i ri mavada ma̱ Urudu'u, iɗa ya agaɗi i sa'ani i ndolo na̱ Lebanon.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />&lt;&lt;Agba adama a̱ ɗu A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ upan na̱ a̱mu, u poloo mu atsuvu shi. Reve u damma mu, &lt;Wu ntsa ta̱ ne. She vu da̱shi yuwaan mu adanshi adama e ili i nda wan. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kumba zuva vu ncilecile m masasan ma Pisiga, reve vu ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱ tyo a̱livu nu ugana nu uyagi na asana. Vu ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa'a ne esu a̱ wu ulobonu adama a na vaa pasa Urudu nda shi. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Amma vu yuwaan Josuwa adanshi, reve vu gbamato yi asuvu vu ca yi ucira, adama a na a̱yi ɗa waa wala elime a ama a nda a pasa. Waru a̱yi ɗa waa zuwa le a usa iɗa i na vee ene'e wo o'wo za le.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Ɗaɗa tsi isawain o uka̱ri'i a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Bet Peyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Musa zuwa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila a yuwan tsutoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai gogo a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila, ili i na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ u na ma zama n roco ɗu. I kuru le adama i da̱nu wuma, reve waru i uwa pe i usa iɗa i na A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a nkaya n ɗu aa casu ɗu wo o'wo za ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />She i jebe ko i da̱shi e ili i na n damma nɗu wan. Amma i kuru wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a na maa casu ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />&lt;&lt;Ye ene ta̱ ne esu a̱ ɗu ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain a Ba'al Peyo. A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o kototo ta̱ za na suru kuruyi a̱ma̱li a Ba'al va Peyo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Amma akapi a̱ ɗu suru a na i guza̱i A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu ulobonu i ta̱ wuma hali na ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Uwwai nda, n rito ɗu ta̱ ili i na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ mejege cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a zuwa numu n yuwan, adama i kuru le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yaa zama i uwa i tara wo o'wo za ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />I kuru le waru i yuwan le, adama a na o to o'wo ɗu uguru nu urevu e ekere a akapi a nɗa, aza a na aa uwwa adama e ili i nda reve a damma, &lt;Amayun ele nda ama a gbain a ɗa a̱za̱ o uguru nu urevu.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Adama a na babu iɗa i gbain i ro i na i ri na̱ ma̱sula̱ zuzu na̱ a̱yi cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a̱ ri zuzu na̱ a̱tsu mantsa ma na tsu ɗe niyi suru. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Waru babu iɗa i na i ri lo mgbain na wa̱a̱ tsura̱ ili i na aa yuwan na̱ wila̱ wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ tsa za na maa zuwusa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu ana'an.<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />&lt;&lt;I yuwan ugbozu, i goloɓo aciya̱ɗu ulobonu ta̱wa̱ yi icina ni ili i na ye enei ne esu a̱ ɗu wan, waru adama o uta̱ o okolo a̱ ɗu a mantsa ma wuma u ɗu wan. I rito muwun n ɗu ele na̱ muwun n tsukaya n ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />I cuwan cine yi isawain a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a Horeb, ana u damma numu,&lt;Ɓolotowo mu ama adama a uwwa adanshi a̱ va̱, adama o rito cine a uwwa wovon u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ nden n le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. Reve adama waru o rito muwun n le.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Reve i ta̱wa̱ zuzu yi isawan e ikyun i masasan, a̱yi a madala na akina a gawusan zuva, ne eleshe a̱ lima̱ da̱n ni irumbu pici. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱ɗu diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina'a. Yu uwwa ta̱ uɗyo a adanshi amma ye ene oroci e ili i ro shi, uɗyo u ɗa goon yu uwwai. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Reve u revetyo ɗu akucunu a̱ yi, wila̱ kupa a na u zuwa nɗu i kuru'u. Reve u ɗana le a aɓaci a atali e re. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Reve a mantsa'a A̱sulazuva a zuwa mu n rito ɗu ili i na aa yuwan na̱ wila̱ u na ya̱a̱ kuru e iɗa i na yaa pasa Urudu adama wo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">A putsa ta̱ ni itoni ya̱ a̱ma̱li</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Ye ene oroci e ili i ro shi o urana u na A̱sulazuva a yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱ɗu a Horeb diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina. Adama o ndolo i goloɓo aciya̱ɗu ulobonu. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Adama i lungusa̱ aciya̱ɗu i yuwaan aciya̱ɗu a̱ma̱li wan, uruma wi ili i ro, ko oroci a vali ko za vu ka wan, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ko oroci a nama ro a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi, ko oroci a manunu ma tsu'yan zuva, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />ko oroci e ili i wuma i na i tsu ka̱ta̱pa̱ e iɗa, ko oroci a magula za̱la̱ mini. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Waru she i 'ya̱sa̱n esu zuva i ka̱lyuwa̱ reve na̱ ye ene urana na̱ woto ni italyo'o, no oɓolo e ili i na a yuwain zuva suru, a̱vu o rono ugbozu u ɗu hali i ka̱ɗa̱to i yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱ wan. Ili i nda suru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa le ta̱ e iɗa uba̱ta̱ wa ama suru a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Amma a̱ɗu A̱sulazuva a tara ɗu ta̱ reve wu uta̱a̱ ɗu diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina o usuɗuwu, diga e iɗa ya Masar, adama yo o'wo ama a̱ yi la̱nga̱ cine i ri gogo.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ upan na̱ a̱mu adama a̱ ɗu. Reve u kucina a na maa pasa mavada ma̱ Urudu n uwa e iɗa i sa'ani i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a casu ɗu wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />N ta̱ kuwa̱ e iɗa i nda maa pasa Urudu shi. Amma a̱ɗu i ta mapasaa mavada i usa iɗa i sa'ani i ndolo woo o'wo za ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />I yuwan ugbozu, she yi icina akucunu a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a na u yuwain na̱ a̱ɗu wan. She i yuwaan aciya̱ɗu a̱ma̱li oroci e ili i ro na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a putsa nɗu wan. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu akina a na a tsu lyuwa a ɗa, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsushu'un a ɗa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:17">Mta̱ 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:3">U.Wl 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:29">M.Ib 12:29</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />&lt;&lt;Nni i ta̱wa̱ i tsura̱ muwun na̱ muwun n tsukaya, a̱vu i jima na̱ nden e iɗa'a, na̱ yo o'woto aciya̱ɗu idaba i yuwan a̱ma̱li oroci e ili i ro, i yuwan iwuya e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu i zuwa yi u yuwan upan, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />ana'an nda n ɗe ta̱ zuva ni iɗa o o'wo esu a̱ va̱ a aci a̱ ɗu, a na ya̱a̱ kuwa̱ babu usa̱n a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yaa pasa Urudu a̱ tyo ɗe wo o'wo za ɗu. Yaa jima ɗe na̱ nden shi amma ili i ro yi lo shi o to kototo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />Reve A̱sulazuva e bete'we ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a ama, waru ama wa'a ɗa aa pasa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa n na A̱sulazuva e bete'we ɗu a̱ tyo. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Ɗe ɗa yaa yuwaan musula̱ n na ama a yuwain vu ɗanga na atali a̱ga̱nda̱, aza a na e tse ene shi, a tsu uwwa shi ko a lyuwa ko gba a̱ i'yuwa̱n shi. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Amma diga ɗe nni i zami A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, i ta̱ tsura̱ yi nni i bunga̱ yi no okolo a̱ ɗu suru suru na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />A mantsa ma na i ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ ni ili i nda suru i cina ɗu, reve na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱vu i yuwaan yi tsutoni. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu A̱sula̱ e isa'ani a ɗa. Waa vari ɗu ko u kototo ɗu ko wi icina na akucunu a̱ yi na̱ nkaya n ɗu, za na u kucinaa nle shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a ɗa A̱sula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />&lt;&lt;Ecei gogo adama a rana va̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, ɗe nu ujumu kafu mantsa ma̱ ɗu, diga mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ a yuwain vaɗilima̱ o uvaɗi, reve ye ece diga o utyo wa zuva u ro a̱ tyo a za ndeɗe. Ili i gbain i ro tsa nda tsa fara ta̱ ɗe, ko a uwwa ta̱ ɗe alabari a̱ cu'un va̱ yi? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Ama o ro a̱ ta̱ lo a na a uwwai ɗe uɗyo u ma̱sula̱ a adanshi diga a akina, cine yu uwwai reve a buwa wuma? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Ko ma̱sula̱ mo ro ma yuwan ta̱ mpolo n na waa taraa aciya̱yi iɗa diga a̱tsuma̱ e memere me iɗa i ro, na̱ ma̱lyungwa̱ na̱ linga va asalama nu uvon, nu ukere wu ucira, waru ni ili gbain i wovon, suru cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwaan nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar e esu a̱ ɗu?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />&lt;&lt;O roco ɗu ta̱ ili i nda adama i reve a na A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱, babu na̱ a̱yi za ro lo shi. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Diga zuva u zuwa ɗu ta̱ yu uwwa uɗyo wa̱ yi adama u ɓara ɗu. O uvaɗi u roco ɗu ta̱ akina a gbain, reve yu uwwa uɗyo wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a akina'a. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Adama a na u cigai nkaya n ɗu, a̱vu u ɗangwa muwun n tsukaya n le ma̱ a̱ca̱pa̱. Wu uta̱a̱ ɗu ta̱ e iɗa ya Masar nu ucira u gbain wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />U gba̱ra̱ ta̱ nɗa n na n la'a nɗu mgbain nu ucira elime a̱ ɗu, waru adama u ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i le u ca ɗu ele o o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu, cine u ri ana'an.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo i reve a̱vu i zuwa o okolo a̱ ɗu ana'an a na A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ ɗe zuva na̱ pa o uvaɗi. Za ro lo shi. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />I kuru ure wa̱ yi ni ili i na u zuwai, aza a na maa casu ɗu ana'an, adama i da̱nu lafiya na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu ma̱ a̱ca̱pa̱. Waru adama i jima e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu hali hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilyuci i mapa'an</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />&lt;&lt;Reve Musa tawa ilyuci i gbagbain i ta'atsu upasu wa asana o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />uba̱ta̱ u na za na suru unai vuma a suma a̱ tyo, nna̱ wu una ta̱ vuma babu ucigu wa̱ yi waru a̱ ri a̱ n'yuwunlai ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ shi. U ta gura suma a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci ta̱ va aza a nda'a, u wawa wuma wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Ilyuci'i ele ɗa: Beza a̱tsumona upasu wa agaɗi vu ugundo wa̱ Roben, na̱ Ramot a̱tsuma̱ a Giliyadu, vu ugundo wa Gadu, na̱ Golan a̱tsuma̱ a Bashan vu ugundo wa Manase.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucuɗuwu u wila̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa wila̱ u na Musa cayi aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Ele nda ele ɗa ure ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru na̱ wila̱ u na Musa dammai aza a Isra'ila a mantsa ma na o uta̱i Masar, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />ele o uka̱ri u na u ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Bet Peyo asana a̱ Urudu, e iɗa ya Sihon mogono ma aza a Amoriya za na yuwain tsugono a Heshibon za na Musa na aza a Isra'ila a lyuwai nu uvon cina o uta̱ diga Masar. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Reve o o'woto iɗa ya̱ yi za le ni iɗa yo Og mogono ma Bashan, ngono n re ma aza a Amoriya mu upasu wa asana a̱ Urudu. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Iɗa'a u reme ta̱ diga Arowa za na ri a̱ nge'en mu Uɗolu wa Anon a̱ tyo Masasan ma Siriyon, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Siriyon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ozo o ro a ɗana yi ta̱ &lt;&lt;Siyon&gt;&gt;</char></note>za na a̱yi ɗa Hamon. <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Reve u ɓolo nu upasu wa Araba suru asana a̱ Urudu, diga a Mala ma Araba, za̱la̱ vu uzuru wa agaɗi a Pisiga.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ kupa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 20:1-17">Mta̱ 20:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Reve Musa ɗe ama a Isra'ila suru wira̱ u ta̱. A̱vu u damma,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:1">&lt;&lt;Zuwai atsuvu ulobonu yu uwwa ili i na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ u na maa dansaa ɗu ana'an. I reve le waru i yuwan tsutoni ne ele ulobonu. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a yuwan ta̱ akucunu na̱ a̱tsu a Masasan ma Horeb. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Na̱ nkaya n tsu n ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain akucunu a nda shi, amma na̱ a̱tsu ɗa, a̱tsu na tsu ri pa wuma ana'an suru. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ a̱ɗu esu ne esu a̱tsuma̱ a akina a masasan. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />A mantsa mo ndolo, mi isawan ta̱ e memere ma̱ ɗu na̱ A̱sulazuva adama n ka̱mbuwa̱ ɗu adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, adama a na i shi ta̱ a uwwusa wovon wa akina'a i gura kumba masasa'an shi. A̱vu u damma,<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, za na uta̱a̱ nɗu e iɗa ya Masar, diga e iɗa i tsugbashi.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />&lt;&lt;Ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ musula̱ n ro shi, she a̱mu.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />&lt;&lt;She i yuwaan aciya̱ɗu ma̱sula̱ mo ro oroci e ili i ro ɗe zuva ko pa o uvaɗi ko a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mini za̱la̱ wan. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />She i ka̱ɗa̱ta̱wa̱ le ko i yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱ wan, adama a na a̱mu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu A̱sula̱ a̱ tsushu'un a ɗa. N tsu ca ta̱ muwun oforo adama o unusu wu mbara hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma ta'atsu na̱ mantsa ma̱ na̱shi wa aza a na a 'yuwan numu. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Amma n tsu roco ta̱ icigi hali mantsa ukpakukupa kupa a̱ tyo e ekere a aza a na a ciga numu, reve a̱ kuru wila̱ u va̱.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />&lt;&lt;She i yuwan ulinga na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu pere m pere wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva aa lyawa za na yuwain ulinga na ala a̱ yi pere m pere fa̱a̱n shi.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />&lt;&lt;I cuwan nu urana wa Ashibi, i tara yi na akiza, cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Rana ta̱li ɗa yaa yuwan ulinga u ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Amma urana we cindere urana wa Ashibi a ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. A̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi yaa yuwan ulinga u ro shi, ko a̱ɗu ko mawun mo ulobo ma̱ ɗu ko usheli u ɗu ko aagbashi a vali ko a ka, ko nan ɗu ko mololi ma̱ ɗu ko iliyamunga i ro i ɗu, ko omocin a na a̱ ri nden e ilyuci i ɗu, adama agbashi a̱ ɗu a ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci e ivuwan fo tsa̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />I cuwan a̱ɗu agbashi a ɗa i shi e iɗa ya Masar. Reve A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o uta̱a̱ ɗu pe nu ukere wu ucira. Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa ɗu ta̱ i guza̱ urana wa Ashibi.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />&lt;&lt;I ca dada na̱ mma ɗu tsugbain, cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa nɗu i yuwan, adama i jima waru i da̱nu lafiya a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />&lt;&lt;She yu una vuma nu ucigu u ɗu wan.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />&lt;&lt;She i yuwan tsipere wan.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />&lt;&lt;She i yuwan wivu wan.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />&lt;&lt;She i damma ili i na i revei shi e ekere o moron ma̱ nden ma̱ ɗu wan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Mta̱ 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:21">Mat 5:21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:4">15:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:18-19">19:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:10">Mak 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19">10:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">Rom 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2-3">Afi 6:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:11">Yak 2:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />&lt;&lt;She i zuwa esu a̱ ɗu a ka moron ma̱ nden ma̱ ɗu wan. Waru she i zuwa okolo a̱ ɗu o u'wa ko e iɗa i moron ma̱ nden ma̱ ɗu ko a aagbashi a̱ yi a vali ko a ka wan, ko a nan ko o mololi ma̱ yi wan, ko e ili i ro i moron ma̱ nden ma̱ ɗu wan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Mta̱ 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 7:7">Rom 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:9">13:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />&lt;&lt;Idanshi i nda i ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai iɓolo i gbain i ɗu ɗe a masasan nu uɗyo u gbain diga a̱ a̱tsuma̱ a akina, ne eleshe ni irumbu pici. Reve u ɗana le a aɓaci a atali e re a̱vu ca mu ele, waru u da̱shi ili i ro ɗe shi.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ana yu uwwai uɗyo'o diga e irumbu'u, a mantsa ma na masasa'an u da̱na̱i a madala na akina, reve azagbain o gundo ɗu na̱ mbara n ɗu suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Reve a damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu o roco tsu ta̱ tsugbain nu ucira wa̱ yi. Waru tsu uwwa ta̱ uɗyo wa̱ yi diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina. Ana'an tsu reve ta̱ A̱sula̱ a ta yuwan adanshi na̱ vuma, reve vuma buwa wuma. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Adama o ndolo nye yaa zuwa tsu kuwa̱ gogo? Akina a gbain a nda o to soɗu tsu. Na̱ tsu da̱shi uwwa uɗyo wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, tsu ta̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Adama a na vaɗilima̱ ne ɗa vu uwwai ɗe uɗyo wa̱ A̱sula̱ a wuma a yuwusan adanshi diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina, cine tsu uwwai, reve u la'a? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Vu 'ya̱wa̱ zuzu reve vu uwwa ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu aa damma. Reve vu ta̱wa̱ vu damma tsu ili i na u damma nuwu suru. Tsu ta uwwa, a̱vu tsu kuru.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Reve gba A̱sulazuva a uwwa adanshi a̱ ɗu a mantsa ma na i yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu. Reve u damma mu, &lt;Mu uwwa ta̱ ili i na ama a nda a damma nuwu. Ili i na a dammai suru u lobono ta̱. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />A damma a̱ ta̱ na̱ cu'un vo okolo a nda, a na aa uwwa wovon u va̱, a̱vu a̱ kuru wila̱ u va̱ kuci, adama ili i wala le mejege ne ele na̱ muwun n le babu ukotu! <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />&lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱, vu damma le, a̱ ka̱mba̱ o ogodo e le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Amma a̱vu vi isawan pa na̱ a̱mu adama n damma wu ili i na n zuwai ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru na̱ wila̱ u na voo rito le, adama a̱ kuru le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na maa casu le wo o'wo za le.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu i yuwan ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa nɗu, she i ɓatsa usa'ani ko ugula̱ wan. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />I kuru ure u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa nɗu suru, adama i da̱na̱ wuma waru i lyuwa elime, waru i yuwan rana va̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yoo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ u na u la'ai mgbain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />&lt;&lt;Ele nda ele ɗa ili i na a zuwai ni ili i na o toni na̱ wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa numu n rito ɗu adama i yuwan tsutoni ne ele e iɗa i na yaa pasa Urudu wo o'wo za ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />adama a̱ɗu, na̱ muwun n ɗu na̱ muwun n tsukaya n ɗu yu uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu waru i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na a zuwai ni ili i na o toni i na maa casu ɗu, adama i jima o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Uwwai, a̱ɗu ama a Isra'ila! I ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu i reve i kuru le ta̱ ulobonu adama ili i wala ɗu mejege, waru adama i bala a̱bunda̱ e iɗa i na yee yeneshe maani ni ishiki, cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n ɗu a yuwaan nɗu nzuwulai.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, ama a Isra'ila! A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ goon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:32">Mak 12:32</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Adama o ndolo, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ta̱, na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru, nu ucira u ɗu suru.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:37">Mat 22:37</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:29-30">Mak 12:29-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:33">12:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luk 10:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Lyawa adanshi a na n yuwaan ɗu ana'an a̱ da̱na̱ o okolo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />I rito muwun n ɗu ele kuci, waru i yuwan adanshi e le nni i ri nden o u'wa, ko ni i ri a mmalu o ure, ko nni i von, ko nni i 'yon. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Yi nla̱ le e ekere a̱ ɗu, reve waru yi nla̱ le e icin i ɗu tsi iroci i macuwayin. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Waru i ɗana le a̱ na̱ntsu vu kobu ɗu na̱ a na̱ntsu vu u'uwata wu ukari u lyuci ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwaan ta̱ nkaya n ɗu Ibrahim na̱ Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu nzuwulai n na waa ca ɗu iɗa i na waa tara ɗu a̱ tyo. Iɗa nda iɗa i ɗa i na i ri ni ilyuci i gbagbain, na̱ saa sa'ani na a̱ɗu i suwai shi. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Waru u ta ca ɗu 'wa na ri ni itana i sa'ani i na i zuwai pe shi. A̱sulazuva a ta ca ɗu oko'o a na i ka̱pa̱i shi, na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ na̱ ɗanga na a tsu yuwan limatan ulobonu a na i shuwa̱i shi. Agba nni i lyuwa hali u rawa ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu, she yi icina na̱ A̱sulazuva za na uta̱a̱ nɗu e iɗa ya Masar, diga e iɗa i tsugbashi wan.<verse eid="DEU 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa yaa uwwa wovon. A̱yi ɗa yaa yuwaan a̱ga̱nda̱ waru na ala a̱ yi a ɗa goon yaa kucinaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:8">Luk 4:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />She i kuru musula̱ n ro, musula̱ ma ama a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱ɗu wan, <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu A̱sula̱ a̱ tsushu'un a ɗa waru upan wa̱ yi u ta̱ puna̱ a̱ tyo a aci a̱ ɗu. A̱vu u kototo ɗu diga o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />She i lyungwa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu cine i yuwain a Masa wan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:7">Mat 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luk 4:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />I reve gba i kuru ta̱ wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa nɗu, ni ili i na ya̱a̱ kuru nu ure u na u zuwaa nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />I yuwan ili i na i ri mejege ni ili i sa'ani e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, adama i da̱nu lafiya. Waru adama i uwa i usa iɗa i sa'ani i na A̱sulazuva a kucinayi nkaya n ɗu wo wo'o za ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />U ta̱ gba̱ra̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu elime a̱ ɗu, cine u yuwain nzuwulai.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />&lt;&lt;Ɗe elime na̱ muwun n ɗu me ece ɗu, &lt;Nye i ɗa urevu wi ili nu ure na̱ wila̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a zuwa nɗu i kuru?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />I usu le, &lt;Agbashi a Firi'awuna a ɗa tsu shi e iɗa ya Masar, agba reve A̱sulazuva o uta̱a̱ tsu diga Masar nu ukere wu ucira. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />E esu a̱ tsu a ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain iroci ya asalama i gbagbain i wovon a aci a aza a Masar na̱ Firi'awuna nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Reve wu uta̱a̱ tsu ɗe, adama u 'ya̱wa̱to tsu pe u ca tsu iɗa i na u yuwayin nkaya n tsu nzuwulai. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Reve u zuwa tsu kuru ili i nda suru, reve tsu uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu adama tsu lyuwa elime kuci waru tsu da̱na̱ wuma, cine tsu ri ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Na̱ tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu tsu kuru wila̱ u nda suru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu cine u zuwa ntsu, u to o'wo tsu ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ tsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">O lo ta̱ nɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:11-16">Mta̱ 34:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />A mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a rawato nɗu e iɗa i na yaa zama i uwa yoo o'woto yi za ɗu, u ta̱ gba̱ra̱ nɗa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, aza a Hitiya na aza a Girigashiya na aza a Amoriya na aza a Ka'ana na aza a Periziya na aza a Hiviya na aza a Jebusiya, nɗa n cindere n na n la'a nɗu a̱bunda̱ nu ucira, <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />reve nna̱ A̱sulazuva a ca ɗu ele, a̱vu i lyuwa le, ni i ciga i 'yuwan i kototo le suru suru. She i yuwan nzuwulai ne ele ko ye ene iliyali i le wan. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />She i zuwulai ne ele wan. She i ca esheli a̱ ɗu olobo le wan, ko i taraa olobo a̱ ɗu esheli e le wan. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Adama a na a ta vadala muwun n ɗu a lyawa itoni i va̱, reve a yuwaan musula̱ n ro tsugbashi. Reve gba upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u puna̱ a aci a̱ ɗu, reve u kototoshi nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Agba apa nda ili i na yaa yuwan ne ele: yi ɓoso musa'a n le, reve yi ɓoso atali a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ e le, yi gasa a̱shuwutsu a nan Ashera e le. Reve i kula̱to a̱ma̱li e le na akina. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Adama a na a̱ɗu ama a na a tawai na akiza a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa. A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗangwa ɗu ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama o uvaɗi suru, yo o'wo ama a̱ yi la̱nga̱.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ciga ɗu a̱vu u ɗangwa ɗu adama a na i la'ai akapi a ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ shi, adama a na a̱ɗu ɗa i la'ai uka̱la̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a ama suru. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Amma adama a na A̱sulazuva a ciga nɗu ɗa, reve waru u shiton nzuwulai n na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu, ɗaɗa wu uta̱a̱ nɗu nu ukere wu ucira. A̱vu u tsupaa ɗu e iɗa i tsugbashi, diga o ukere wa Firi'awuna mogono ma Masar. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Adama o ndolo i reve a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱. A̱sula̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a ɗa, o shitosun akucunu e icigi ya̱ yi hali a̱ tyo mantsa ukpakukupa kupa wa aza a na a ciga niyi waru a̱a̱ kurusu ili i na u zuwai. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Amma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 7:10">&lt;&lt;Aza a na a 'yuwan niyi u tsu tsupa le ta̱ a alanga eteshe, u kototo le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 7:10">U tsu lungusa̱ mantsa ma na waa tsupa aza a na a 'yuwan niyi shi.<verse eid="DEU 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Adama o ndolo i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu i kuru ili i na a zuwai ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru na̱ wila̱ u na maa casu ɗu ana'an.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />&lt;&lt;Nni i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu a̱ wila̱ u nda, reve i kuru le ulobonu, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to shiton akucunu e icigi ya̱ yi a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ ɗu, cine u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />U ta ciga ɗu, u zuwaa ɗu aba'un, a̱vu u da̱shi ɗu a̱bunda̱. Waru u ta zuwaa muwun n ɗu aba'un oɓolo ni ili yi cimba i ɗu, ishina i ɗu na̱ masayan ma sa'avu ma̱ ɗu na̱ mani'in ma̱ ɗu na̱ mudindim mo oɓolo e inan i ɗu na̱ mukyokyon n ɗu, a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu u ta ca ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />I to o'wo aza a aba'un a na a la'ai ama suru. Ko vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu ka ko vali oo o'wo idari shi, ko a̱tsuma̱ e iliyamunga i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />A̱sulazuva a ta yuwaan ɗu mapari na̱ cu'un vu mɓa̱la̱ suru. Wa̱a̱ tsuwa̱n ɗu mɓa̱la̱ n wuya n na i revei a̱tsuma̱ a Masar shi. Amma u ta̱ tsuwa̱a̱n aza a na a 'yuwan ɗu ele. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />I kototo ama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ca ɗu e ekere a̱ ɗu suru. She ye ene iliyali i le wan, waru she i yuwaan musula̱ n le a̱ga̱nda̱ wan, adama a na u to o'wo ɗu maza.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />&lt;&lt;I ta gura jiyan o okolo a̱ ɗu, &lt;Ama a nda a la'a tsu ta̱ a̱bunda̱. Cine tsa ɗa tsaa gura gba̱ra̱ le?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Agba she yu uwwa wovon u le wan, cuwain ni ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwain na̱ Firi'awuna na̱ Masar suru. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Ye ene ta̱ ne esu a̱ ɗu mɓa̱la̱ m gbagbain ni iroci ni ili ya asalama, nu ukere wu ucira, za na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o uta̱a̱ nɗu. Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa yuwan na ama a na yaa uwwusa wovon u le gogo. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Waru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ lyungu ni ili i wovon, hali she na aza a na a la'ai a pa'atoyin aciyele e ekere a̱ ɗu a̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />She yu uwwa wovon u le wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ e memere ma̱ ɗu u ta̱ na̱ tsugbain, a̱yi ɗa yaa uwwa wovon. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ gba̱ra̱ nɗa n nda elime a̱ ɗu ben ben. She i kototo le nu uta̱ wan, adama inama yu una i bala a yuwan ɗu a̱bunda̱ a damaton ɗu wan. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Amma A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta ca ɗu ele, a̱vu u zuwa ugbozu u le u ja̱mba̱ra̱ hali she no o kototo le. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Waru u ta ca ɗu ngono n le e ekere a̱ ɗu, a̱vu i tasa ala ele a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. Ko vuma aa gura isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu shi, i to kototo le. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Reve i kula̱to musula̱ n le na akina. She i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu u ɗu a azurufa na̱ zinariya na a̱ ri ne ele wan. She i tara le adama a aciya̱ɗu wan, adama o o'wo ɗu maza wan, adama a na ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />She i ta̱wa̱ ni ili yi idaba a 'wa ɗu wan, adama yo o'wo ili i na a tawai adama o ukototosu tse le wan. I 'yuwan yi ye ene idaba ya̱ yi, adama a na a tawa le ta̱ adama o ukototosu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">She e icina na̱ A̱sulazuva wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />&lt;&lt;I kuru ili i na maa casu ɗu ana'an, adama i da̱nu wuma i bala, a̱vu i uwa i usa iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a a tarayi nkaya n ɗu akucunu. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />I cuwan na̱ cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ kuruyi na̱ a̱ɗu a mmalu n ɗu a̱ a̱tsumona a̱tsuma̱ a a'wan amunga a nda, adama u ka̱ɗa̱to ɗu reve u lyungwa̱ ɗu tsa̱ra̱ u reve ili i na i ri o okolo a̱ ɗu. Ko i ta̱ kuru ili i na u zuwai ko gba shi. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />U ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ okolo a̱ ɗu ana u lyawa nɗu na ambulu, reve u lyuwato ɗu na̱ mana ili i na ko a̱ɗu ko nkaya n ɗu n revei shi, tsa̱ra̱ u roco ɗu a na ni ilyalya i ɗa goon vuma a̱a̱ da̱na̱ wuma shi. Agba na adanshi a na suru o uta̱i o una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:4">Mat 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:4">Luk 4:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />A̱tsuma̱ a a'wan amunga o ndolo a̱tugu a̱ ɗu a kutsa shi, waru ana a̱ ɗu a tsutsa shi. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />I reve a̱tsuma̱ o okolo a̱ ɗu a na cine vuma tsu ɓara mawun ma̱ yi ne ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɓarasa ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Adama o ndolo i kuru ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a dammai. I yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ e re va̱ yi a uwwusa wovon wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱tosu ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i sa'ani, iɗa i na i ri na̱ ɗolu mini meyene, ne esu a̱ mini a na o utusa̱ o uka̱ri na agaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Iɗa i na i ri na̱ yitabo no oroci a yitabo na ataci a̱ ina̱bi na̱ ɗanga vu ubiri na̱ ɗanga muwun m peme, iɗa yi ɗanga mani'in ma̱ zetun ni ishiki, <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />iɗa i ɗa a na yaa lyuwa ilyalya pere, uba̱ta̱ u na yaa lamba ili shi. Iɗa i na atali a̱ yi irumu i ɗa uba̱ta̱ u na ya̱a̱ ka̱pa̱ rumushili a agaɗi a̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />&lt;&lt;Nni i lyuwa i cuwa̱n, i cuwa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu adama e iɗa i sa'ani i na u ca nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />I ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu she yi icina na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu wan, na ya̱a̱ kuɗa̱ a̱ kuru ili i na u dammai na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi ni ili i na u zuwai a na maa dansaa ɗu ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Adama ta̱wa̱ i lyuwa i cuwa̱n, i suwa 'wa sa'ani a̱vu i da̱nu pe, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />reve a mantsa ma na oɓolo e inan ni ikyon na̱ mgbele n ɗu m balai, a̱vu azurufa na̱ zinariya ɗu yuwan a̱bunda̱, reve ili i na i ri ne ele suru a̱ da̱shi a̱bunda̱, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />reve okolo a̱ ɗu e reme afalu. A̱vu yi icina na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu za na uta̱a̱ nɗu e iɗa ya Masar e iɗa i tsugbashi. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />U kuru ta̱ na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ a̱tsumona a gbain o wovon, iɗa yu u'yewu i babu mini, iɗa yi iyo i wuya na agashi. A̱vu u ca ɗu mini diga a aatali o ugbamu. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />U ca ɗu ta̱ mana i lyuwa a̱tsumona, ili i na nkaya n ɗu koto n shi n revei shi, tsa̱ra̱ u ka̱ɗa̱to ɗu waru u lyungwa̱ ɗu, adama na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ ili i wala ɗu mejege. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />She i damma o okolo a̱ ɗu, &lt;Tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ nu ucira wu ukere u va̱ u ɗa u ta̱wa̱a̱ numu nu utsuru u nda wan.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Amma i cuwan na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, adama a na a̱yi ɗa u ca nɗu ukadu u na ya̱a̱ tsura̱ utsuru, adama u shiton akucunu a̱ yi a na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu, cine u ri ana'an.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />&lt;&lt;Nni yi icina na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, reve i kuru musula̱ n ro a̱vu i yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱ i ka̱ɗa̱ta̱wa̱ le, n to ronuso ɗu atsuvu ana'an na amayun o to kototo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Tsu nɗa n na A̱sulazuva o kototoi elime a̱ ɗu, ne ɗa ya̱a̱ kuwa̱, adama a na i yuwain tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva e ekere aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila. I ta zama i pasa Urudu i uwa i usa nɗa n na n la'a nɗu ucira na̱ a̱bunda̱ waru, aza a na a̱ ri nden e ilyuci i gbagbain i na i ri na̱ kari vu uga'an lon. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Ama'a a̱ tu uga'an nu ucira, ugundo wa aza a Anaku, aza a na i revei ne ele, waru aza a na yu uwwai a yuwain adanshi e le a dammai, &lt;Zane ɗa aa gura isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Anaku?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Amma i reve ana'an a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱yi ɗa za na aa pasasa elime a̱ ɗu tse elentsu a akina a na o tsu soɗu. U ta la'a le ucira a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, reve u soɗu le. Ne ɗa ya̱a̱ gba̱ra̱ le, reve waru i kototo le babu usa̱n, cine A̱sulazuva a yuwaan nɗu nzuwulai.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />&lt;&lt;Nna̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ gba̱ra̱ le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, she i jiyan o okolo a̱ ɗu, &lt;Adama a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ tsu a ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱to ntsu pa adama tso o'wo ni iɗa i nda wan.&gt; Ne ɗa shi, adama e iwuya yi nɗa n nda n ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱a̱ gba̱rusa̱ le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6">Rom 10:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Adama a̱ a̱ɓula̱ ko e isa'ani yo okolo a̱ ɗu a ɗa i zuwai yaa uwa pe i usa iɗa'a shi, amma adama e iwuya yi nɗa n nda i ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱a̱ gba̱ra̱ le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, adama u shiton adanshi a na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu, Ibrahim ni Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Adama o ndolo, i reve a na adama a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu iɗa i sa'ani i nda wo o'wo za ɗu shi, adama a na a̱ɗu ama a aciyogbamu a ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma̱dindim ma zinariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 32:1-35">Mta̱ 32:1-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />I cuwan she yi icina cine i zuwai A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwain upan a̱tsumona wan. Diga a mantsa ma na yu uta̱i e iɗa ya Masar hali i rawa pa nda i yuwusaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva aciyogbamu. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ko a Horeb fo she na i zuwai A̱sulazuva a yuwain upan, hali u shi azama u kototo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Ana n kumbai masasan adama n ushi aɓaci a atali a nzuwulai n na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na̱ a̱ɗu, n yuwan ta̱ ayin amunga na̱ rana amunga ɗe a masasa'an, n lyuwa ilyalya shi agba n sowo mini shi. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a ca mu aɓaci a atali e re a na u yuwain iɗana na aakatsu a̱ yi. Adanshi a na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na̱ a̱ɗu a masasan suru diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina a̱ shi ta̱ ɗe a atali'i o urana wi iɓolo ya ama.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />&lt;&lt;O ukosu wu rana amunga na ayin amunga'a, reve A̱sulazuva a ca mu aɓaci a atali e re'e, atali a nzuwulai'i. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;'Yon vu jika̱ a̱ zura̱ a̱ cipa̱ diga pa, adama a na ama a na vu uta̱yi diga Masar a yuwan ta̱ ili yi idaba. A ɓatsushi ta̱ a lyawa ure u na n zuwa nle, a̱ zuɗa̱a̱ ta̱ aciyele a̱ma̱li a̱ rumu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a dammisa mu, &lt;Me ene ta̱ ama a nda, ama a ɗa aza a aciyogbamu! <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Lyawa mu n kototo le, n tawa ala e le a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. Reve mo o'woto wu iɗa i na i la'a nle ucira na̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa n vadalai n cipa̱i diga a masasa'an a̱yi ubuwu a madala na akina. Aɓaci a atali e re a nzuwulai'i e ekere a̱ va̱. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ana n ka̱lyuwa̱i, a̱vu me ene i yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu unusu. I zuɗa̱a̱ ta̱ aciya̱ɗu a̱a̱ma̱li o uruma u ma̱dindim. I vadalashi ta̱ i lyawa ure u na A̱sulazuva a zuwa nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Reve n tara aɓaci a atali e re'e a̱vu n kpasu'wa le, a̱vu mu ɓoso le miri miri e esu a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />&lt;&lt;Reve n vowison ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva ayin amunga na̱ rana amunga. N lyuwa ilyalya shi agba n sowo mini shi tsu ufaru adama o unusu u na i yuwain suru, na i yuwain ili i iwuya e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu i zuwa yi u yuwan upan. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Mu uwwa ta̱ wovon wu upan nu ulambu wu uyo'o u na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na̱ a̱ɗu, hali u shi u ciga u kototo ɗu. Agba reve A̱sulazuva o polisoo mu atsuvu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">M.Ib 12:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ upan na̱ Haruna lon, hali u shi u ciga u kototo yi. Amma reve n yuwan ipati adama a yi a mantsa'a fo. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Reve n tara ili yu unusu i na i yuwai'in, ma̱dindim ma na i yuwain reve n kula̱to yi na akina. A̱vu mu ɓoso yi, mi ira yi n luɓa̱tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ma̱buta̱. Reve n kusha'wa ma̱buta̱'a̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uɗolu u na we yeneshe diga a masasa'an.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />&lt;&lt;Ne ɗa waru i zuwai A̱sulazuva a yuwain upan a Tabera na̱ a Masa na̱ a Kibirot Hatava.<verse eid="DEU 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />&lt;&lt;Waru ana A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu nɗu diga Kadesh Baniya, a̱vu u damma, &lt;Gawain i 'ya̱wa̱ i usa iɗa i na n ca nɗu.&gt; Agba a̱vu i yuwaan adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aciyogbamu. I usu ili i na u dammai shi agba i yuwan tsutoni na̱ yi shi. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />A̱ɗu aza a aciyogbamu a ɗa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva diga a mantsa ma na n reve nɗu.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa n voyin ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva rana amunga na ayin amunga o ndolo, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ shi ta̱ a damma u to kototo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Reve n yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu n damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva Zagbain, she vu kototo ama a̱ wu, aza a na ele ɗa agadu a̱ wu wan, aza a na vu tsupayi na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ wu, aza a na vu uta̱yi e iɗa ya Masar nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ wu. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Vu cuwan na agbashi a̱ wu Ibrahim ni Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu. She vu dama na aciyogbamu a ama a nda wan, ko ni iwuya i le ko unusu u le wan. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Na̱ ne ɗa shi, iɗa i na vu uta̱a̱ ntsu a ta damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a na A̱sulazuva a gura rawato le e iɗa i na u yuwain nzuwulai shi, waru adama a na u 'yuwan nle ɗaɗa wu uta̱a̱ nle adama wu una le a̱ a̱tsumona.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Agba ele ama a̱ wu a ɗa, agadu a̱ wu a na vu uta̱yi nu ucira u gbain wa̱ wu waru nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ wu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Aɓaci a atali a sa'avu tsa̱ a̱za̱ o ufaru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:1-10">Mta̱ 34:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ndolo reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;She'en aɓaci a atali e re tsa̱ a̱za̱ o ufaru, a̱vu vu gawan ya̱'a̱ va̱ a masasan. A̱vu vu yuwan aakpati a ɗanga. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />N ta ɗana idanshi i na i shi a aɓaci a atali o ufaru aza a na vu ɓosoi. A̱vu vu zuwa le pe a aakpati'i.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa n yuwain aakpati a ɗanga a akashiya. Reve waru n she'en aɓaci a atali e re tsa̱ a̱za̱ o ufaru. Reve n kumba a gawan a masasan na atali e re'e e ekere a̱ va̱. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Reve A̱sulazuva a ɗana ɗe a aɓaci a atali'i tsi iɗana yu ufaru, wila̱ kupa na u yuwaan ɗu adanshi a masasan a̱tsuma̱ a akina o urana wi iɓolo. Reve A̱sulazuva a ca mu ele. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Reve n vadala n ka̱ra̱ a̱ cipa̱ a masasa'an, a̱vu n zuwa aɓaci a atali'i a aakpati a na n yuwain. Pe ɗa a̱ ri cine A̱sulazuva a zuwa numu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila e reme mmalu diga o oko'o a aza a Ya'akan a̱ tyo Mosera. Ɗe ɗa Haruna kuwa̱i reve a̱ ciɗo yi. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Eliyaza reme ulinga u tsuganu o una̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Diga lo reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Gudugoda reve waru a̱ tyo Yotubata iɗa i na i ri na̱ ɗolu. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />A mantsa mo ndolo reve A̱sulazuva a tawa ugundo wa̱ Levi adama o o'wo a̱za̱ e itana ya Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva, e isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱, waru a zuwa aba'un na ala a̱ yi cine u ri hali a̱ tyo ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai nan Levi a̱ ri na akunda ko agadu shi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ e le, A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa agadu e le cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a damma nle.<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />&lt;&lt;N da̱na̱ ta̱ a masasan hali rana amunga na ayin amunga, tsu ufaru. Reve A̱sulazuva a uwwa mu a mantsa ma nda waru. Ifoɓi ya̱ yi i ɗa u kototo ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;'Yon vu walaa ama elime, adama a uwa a tara agadu e iɗa i na n kucinai na maa ca nkaya le.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />&lt;&lt;Gogo gba aza a Isra'ila, nye i ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a cigai ya̱'a̱ ɗu? A̱yi ɗa yu uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, i yuwan mmalu o ure wa̱ yi, i ciga yi, i yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ no okolo a̱ ɗu suru na̱ wuma u ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />Waru i toni ili i na u zuwai nu ure wa̱ yi u na maa casu ana'an adama i da̱nu lafiya.<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, zuva na̱ zuva va zuva nu uvaɗi ni ili i na i ri pe suru, za va̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Suru na̱ ne A̱sulazuva a zuwa ta̱ okolo ya nkaya n ɗu a̱vu u ciga le, a̱vu u ɗangwa ɗu limatan va̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ le diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama suru cine u ri ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Adama o ndolo i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva, i da̱shi o'wo na aciyogbamu wan. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu A̱sula̱ a̱ musula̱ a ɗa na̱ Zagbain va azagbain, A̱sula̱ a gbain za vu ucira, ili i wovon, za na tsu roco aɗangulu shi, agba u tsu ushi utowusu wu una̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />U tsu isawaan ta̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱, waru u ciga ta̱ mocin, u tsu ca yi ta̱ ilyalya na̱ a̱tugu. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />I ciga omocin adama a na a̱ɗu fo omocin a ɗa i shi e iɗa ya Masar. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Yu uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. A̱yi ɗa yaa yuwaan a̱ga̱nda̱ reve i suraa yi, waru na ala a̱ yi a ɗa yaa kucina. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />A̱yi ɗa ili yi ica i ɗu. A̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu za na yuwaan nɗu ili i gbagbain i wovon i na ye enei ne esu a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Nkaya n ɗu n na n cipa̱i a̱ tyo Masar ele ɗa a̱ shi ama kupocindere suru suru, reve gogo nda A̱sulazuva a zuwa i yuwan a̱bunda̱ she damma italyo'o ya zuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">A ciga A̱sulazuva waru a yuwaan yi tsutoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />&lt;&lt;I ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, reve i guza̱ ili i na u cigai ni ili i na u dammai, na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi ni ili i na u zuwai mantsa suru. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Ana'an nda i cuwan muwun n ɗu n ɗa me enei ko a uwwai oforo a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu shi: tsugbain tsa̱ yi, nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ yi nu ukere wa̱ yi wuba̱ruwu, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />ni iroci i na u yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, na̱ linga va asalama na u yuwayin Firi'awuna Mogono ma Masar oɓolo ni iɗa ya̱ yi ma̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />A̱ɗu ɗa ye enei ili i na u yuwain na̱ a̱soja a Masar, oɓolo ni ido i le, ni ikeke yi ido i le, na̱ cine A̱sulazuva a zuwai mini ma Mala ma̱ Shili ma lyuwa nle a mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i e itoni i ɗu, na̱ cine A̱sulazuva o kototo nle suru suru. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Muwun n ɗu me ene cine u yuwaan nɗu a̱tsumona hali i rawa uba̱ta̱ u nda shi. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Waru e ene ili i na u yuwain na̱ Datan na̱ Abiram, olobo a Eliyabu za vu ugundo wa̱ Roben, ana iɗa i kpa̱tu'wa̱i una̱ e memere ma aza a Isra'ila reve u soɗu le, oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun n le ni ili i na a̱ ri ne ele no ogodo ele ni ili i wuma i na a̱ ri ne ele suru shi. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Waru esu a̱ ɗu a ɗa e enei ili i gbagbain i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain biti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo, i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na maa zuwusaa ɗu ana'an suru, tsa̱ra̱ i tsura̱ ucira u na ya̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ i usa iɗa i na yaa pasa Urudu adama wo o'wo za ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />adama i jima a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a kucinayi nkaya n ɗu u ta ca le, oɓolo na̱ muwun mu ugundo n le, iɗa i na yee yeneshe maani ni ishiki. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Adama a na iɗa i na i ri a ma'uwaa adama wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu u ri tsi iɗa ya Masar uba̱ta̱ u na yu uta̱i shi, uba̱ta̱ u na i tsu cu'wa̱n icu'un reve i reme a̱ tsusun mini tsa̱ a̱rumbu. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Amma iɗa i na yaa pasa a̱vu i lyuwa agadu a̱ yi'i, iɗa i ɗa i na i ri na agaɗi na̱ ka̱ri za na iro'i ya zuva yaa casu mini. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Iɗa i ɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱. Esu a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ ya̱'a̱ yi kuci, diga ufaru wa aa'wan a̱ tyo ukosu wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo ni i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na maa zuwusaa ɗu ana'an ulobonu a na, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu reve waru i yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ no okolo a̱ ta̱ na asuvu a̱ ta̱, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />a̱vu gba n lyungu ni iro'i e iɗa i ɗu a mantsa ma̱ yi, mini mo ufaru na̱ za wandari adama i ɓoloto ishina i ɗu, na̱ masayan ma sa'avu ma̱ ɗu na̱ mani'in ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa anlya a kungwa a atsusa a̱ ɗu adama inan i tsura̱ ilyalya, waru i ta lyuwa hali i cuwa̱n.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />&lt;&lt;I yuwan ugbozu, na̱ ne ɗa shi okolo a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ luma̱ ɗu a̱vu i lyawa itoni ya̱ A̱sulazuva a̱vu i yuwaan musula̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱vu waru i ka̱ɗa̱towa̱ le. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Reve gba A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na̱ a̱ɗu lon, reve u kpa̱to una̱ntsu wa zuva adama u ca iro'i wan waru iɗa yaa matsan ili shi, i to koto babu usa̱n e iɗa i sa'ani i na A̱sulazuva aa casu ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />I zuwa idanshi i va̱ i nda o okolo a̱ ɗu na a asuvu a̱ ɗu, yi nla̱ le o o'wo iroci e ekere a̱ ɗu, yi nla̱ le e icin i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />I rito muwun n ɗu ele, i yuwusan adanshi e le ni i ri nden o u'wa ko ni ri a mmalu o ure, ko nni i von ko nni i 'yon. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Waru i ɗana le a̱ na̱ntsu vu kobu ɗu na̱ a̱ na̱ntsu vu u'uwata wu ukari u lyuci u ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />adama wuma u ɗu na̱ wuma u muwun n ɗu u jima a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a yuwayin nkaya n ɗu akucunu, u ta ca le na̱ zuva buwa zuva vu uvaɗi.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />&lt;&lt;Ni i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na n zuwaa nɗu ulobonu suru a na, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, i yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure wa̱ yi suru, reve i suraa yi. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Ni i yuwan tsundolo, A̱sulazuva o to lo n'yuwatan n ɗu suru elime a̱ ɗu, waru i ta gura lo nɗa m gbagbain n na n la'a nɗu a̱bunda̱ nu ucira. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Uba̱ta̱ u na apata a ana a̱ ɗu a dasai suru u to o'wo uba̱ta̱ u ɗu. Utyo u ɗu u to o'wo diga a̱tsumona a̱ tyo Lebanon, waru diga o Uɗolu wa̱ Yufiriti asana a̱ tyo a Mala ma Gbain. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Babu vuma na aa gura isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu. A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwa uba̱ta̱ u na apata a ana a̱ ɗu suru a dasai a da'wan a uwwa wovon u ɗu, cine u yuwaan nɗu akucunu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i, n ta zuwusa aba'un ko una̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />I ta̱ tsura̱ aba'un ni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a na maa casu ɗu ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Una̱ u ta̱ kuru ɗu ni i 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu reve i vadalaa ure wa̱ yi ucina̱ u na maa casu ɗu ana'an reve i toni musula̱ n ro, aza a na koto i revei shi. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱wa̱to ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yaa uwa wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu, i yuwan adanshi a aba'u'un ɗe zuva Masasan ma Gerizim, waru i yuwan adanshi o una̱'a̱ a Masasan ma Eba. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Cine i revei, a̱ba̱jini a̱ba̱jini a nsasan n ndolo a̱ ta̱ mavada ma̱ Urudu, a̱livu o ure a̱ tyo upasu u na urana u tsu riya̱, zuzu na̱ ɗanga gbagbain va More a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya aza a Ka'ana, aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Araba, upasu wa Gilga. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />I ta pasa Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu adama i usa iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu. Mantsa ma na wo o'woi agadu a̱ ɗu a̱vu i da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />i reve, i yuwan ta̱ tsutoni ni ili i na a zuwai suru na̱ wila̱ u na a zuwai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />&lt;&lt;Apa wila̱ ni ili i na ya̱a̱ kuru ni i ciga i 'yuwan i yuwan tsutoni ne ele a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n ɗu u ca nɗu wo o'wo za ɗu, ni i buwa wuma. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />I lungusa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na ama a na yoo lo a yuwusaan a̱ma̱li e le a̱ga̱nda̱ suru suru a nsasan mu uga'an oɓolo na agaɗi na̱ za̱la̱ vu uɗanga u kpa̱la̱m suru. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Yi ɓoso musa'a n le, yi mura atali a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ e le, a̱vu i kula̱to a̱shuwutsu a Ashera e le na akina, a̱vu yi gasa musula̱ n le. Tsundolo tsa ɗa yaa tasa ala e le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ba̱ta̱'a̱.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Yaa yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ cine ele aa yuwusaan musula̱ n le a̱ga̱nda̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Amma i zami uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwaa ɗu a̱tsuma̱ o gundo ɗu, adama u zuwa Ala a̱ yi uba̱ta̱'a̱, adama a̱ nden ma̱ yi. Uba̱ta̱ u ɗaɗa ya̱a̱ tyo. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Ɗe ɗa ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗu na̱ kucci ɗu, na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa nu une'e u la̱nga̱ u ɗu na̱ kucci na i yuwain akucunu a na yaa ca, na̱ kucci vu ucigu wo okolo a̱ ɗu, nu umatsun wu ufaru wo oɓolo e inan i ɗu ni ikyon na̱ mgbele. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Ɗe a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, yaa lyuwa a̱vu i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱ɗu na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun n ɗu, a̱tsuma̱ o ulinga we ekere u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa nɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />&lt;&lt;She i yuwan cine tsu yuwain pa nda ana'an wan, cine vuma suru aa yuwusan cine u cigai, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />adama a na koto i rawa uba̱ta̱ u wivuwun shi, waru koto i tara agadu a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Amma mantsa ma na i pasai Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, reve i da̱nu pe a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu wo o'wo agadu, u ta ca ɗu wivuwun e ekere a n'yuwatan n ɗu suru aza a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱ɗu, hali i tsura̱ nden mu uyo'o. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Reve i tara ili i na n damma nɗu suru a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva aa ɗangula adama Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱, ele ɗa: kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗu na̱ kucci ɗu, za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa ɗu nu une'e u la̱nga̱ u ɗu, oɓolo ni ili i sa'ani la̱nga̱ na i ri ne ele i na i kucinayi A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Uba̱ta̱ u ɗaɗa yaa yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu olobo ne esheli na agbashi a̱ ɗu a ali na̱ va̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ nan Levi a na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, a na a̱ ri na akunda na agadu oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Amma i yuwan ugbozu she i ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu u ɗu uba̱ta̱ e iwa̱u wan. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />I ca le uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva aa ɗangwa goon a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ta̱ vu ugundo u ta̱ vu gundo ɗu, ɗe ɗa yaa yuwan ili i na n damma ɗu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Amma suru na̱ ne, i ta gura paɗa a̱tsuma̱ e iliyamunga i na i ri ne ele a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu a̱vu i tama cine i cigai biti, a̱tsuma̱ a aba'un a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu. Vuma na ri idaba na̱ za na ri cece u ta gura tama tsu utamu wu nama mere'on ko meshon. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Amma she i tama mpasa wan, yoo oco yi e iɗa tsa̱ mini. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />A̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu i ciga i 'yuwan, she i lyuwa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi ishina na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma sa'avu oɓolo na̱ mani'in, ko umatsun wu ufaru wu nama ko nan ko ikyon, ko kucci ɗu vu ushitosun wa akucunu, ko kucci na i cayi nu ucigu wo okolo, ko ne'en la̱nga̱ na i cayi wan. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Amma ele nda i ta tama le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa, na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu olobo ne esheli na agbashi a ali a̱ ɗu na̱ va̱ a̱ma̱ci, na̱ nan Levi a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu. Waru i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a linga na i yuwain ne ekere a̱ ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />I yuwan ugbozu, she yi icina nan Levi wan mantsa ma na i ri pe nden a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ da̱shi iɗa i ɗu mgbain cine u yuwaan ɗu nzuwulai, reve i damma, &lt;N ciga ta̱ n tama inama,&gt; na̱ tsundolo tsa ɗa, i ta gura tama cine i cigai. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Nu uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a cigai u zuwa Ala a̱ yi u ri alanga lon na̱ a̱ɗu, i ta gura paɗa nama ro cine u zuwa nɗu i yuwan, ko a̱tsuma̱ e inan ko a̱giri'i, ko waru nga̱ji aza a na A̱sulazuva a ca nɗu. Cine n damma nɗu, I ta gura tama cine i cigai a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />I ta tama le cine i tsu tama nama mere'on ko nama meshon. Aza a na a̱ ri cece na aza a na a̱ ri idaba suru a ta gura tama inama'a. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Amma she i tama mpasa wan, adama a na mpasa'a wuma u ɗa, adama o ndolo she i tama wuma na̱ nama va̱ yi wan. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />She i tama mpasa wan ko ke'en, yoo oco yi e iɗa tsa̱ mini. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />She i tama mpasa'a wan, adama i da̱nu lafiya na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ n ɗu, adama a na i ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />&lt;&lt;Amma gba ne'e va akiza ɗu na̱ kucci ɗu vu ushitosun wa akucunu i tara i 'ya̱wa̱a̱ uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a ɗangwai. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />I ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗu a masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, mpasa ni inama'a. I ciga i 'yuwan i tsun mpasa n na i yuwayin kucci'i zuzu na̱ masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, agba i ta gura tama nama'a. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />I yuwan ugbozu i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na n zuwai i na maa casu ɗu, adama ili i wala ɗu mejege kuci, oɓolo na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ n ɗu, adama a na i ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan ili i sa'ani ni ili i mejege e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to losoo ɗu nɗa aza a na yaa uwa a̱tsuma̱ e le adama i lo le tsa̱ra̱ i tara nɗa n le wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu i da̱nu pe. <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />Mantsa ma na o kototo nle a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, i yuwan ugbozu, she o o'wo ɗu maza ma na yaa zami adama i reve adama a̱ musula̱ n le wan a dansa, &lt;Cine tsa ɗa nɗa n nda maa yuwusaan musula̱ n le a̱ga̱nda̱? Tsundolo tsa ɗa fo tsaa yuwan.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />I ciga i 'yuwan i yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ tse le wan, adama a na cine ele a tsu yuwusaan musula̱ n le a̱ga̱nda̱, a tsu yuwusan ta̱ ili yi idaba koko'o i na A̱sulazuva a 'yuwain. A̱ tsu kula̱to ta̱ olobo ne esheli na aa yuwusan kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ tyo a̱ musula̱ n le.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />&lt;&lt;I reve i yuwan ta̱ tsutoni ni ili i na n damma nɗu suru, she i da̱shi ɗe wan, agba she i jebe wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s">A putsa ta̱ na̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ musula̱ n ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vumava̱sula̱ ko za na tse ene alavu a̱ 'yon a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱vu u damma ɗu iroci ko ili ya asalama i ro, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />ni iroci ko ili ya asalama'a i shiwan, reve u damma, to, &lt;Tsu toniyi musula̱ n ro, reve tsu yuwaan nle a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt; Musula̱ n na koto i revei shi. <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />She i zuwaa vumava̱sula̱ ndolo na̱ za na ri eneshe alavu o ndolo atsuvu wan. A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu u ta̱ lyungusa̱ ɗu we ene ko i ciga yi ta̱ no okolo a̱ ta̱ na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa yoo toni, a̱yi ɗa waru goon yaa uwwa wovon, i toni ili i na u dammai suru, adanshi a̱ yi a ɗa goon yaa zuwaa atsuvu, a̱yi ɗa goon yaa yuwaan a̱ga̱nda̱, a̱yi ɗa waru goon yaa suraa. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />A̱yi vumava̱sula̱ ndolo ko a̱yi za va alavu o ndolo a ciga a 'yuwan o una yi, adama a na u yuwan ta̱ alajiya o u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, za na uta̱a̱ nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar a̱vu u tsupaa ɗu e iɗa i tsugbashi. U yuwan ta̱ mpolo u vadala ɗu diga o ure u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ciga nɗu i toni. I ciga i 'yuwan yu uta̱a̱ ili i wuya i na i ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ wu ko ulobo wa̱ wu ko usheli wa̱ wu, ko ka va̱ wu na vu cigai, ko i'utsa̱ i na i ri zuzu na̱ a̱vu u yuwan wu ugbozu usokowu, adansa, &lt;Lyawai tsu 'ya̱wa̱i tsu yuwayin musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱,&gt; musula̱ n na a̱ɗu ko nan dada ɗu i revei shi, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />musula̱ ma ama n na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱ɗu, ko zuzu ko alanga, diga o ufaru wu uvaɗi u nda a̱ tyo o ukosu wu uvaɗi u ndeɗe, <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />she i usu yi ko i zuwaa yi atsuvu wan. She ye ene iliyali ya̱ yi wan. She i lyawa yi wuma ko i soko yi wan. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />I ciga i 'yuwan yu una yi. Ekere a̱ ɗu a ɗa a fara ju'wa̱n yi, reve akapi a ama a vuvara yi hali u kuwa̱. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Yi vara yi na atali hali u kuwa̱, adama a na u zami ta̱ ure u na waa zuwa ɗu i lyawa itoni ya̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, za na uta̱a̱ nɗu diga Masar e iɗa i tsugbashi. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa aza a Isra'ila suru aa uwwa, reve aa uwwa wovon, reve a̱ kuɗa̱ a na aa yuwan cu'un vi ili i wuya i ndolo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu waru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ yu uwwa a dansa adama a̱ lyuci ta̱ na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu i da̱nu pe a na, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />ama a wuya o ndolo o uta̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu a̱vu a̱ pusa̱n ugbozu wa ama a̱ lyuci le, a dansa, &lt;Lyawai tsu 'ya̱wa̱i tsu yuwayin musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱,&gt; musula̱ n na koto i revei shi, <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />ni i ciga i 'yuwan i zami, i bingi, i yuwan yeci ya̱ a̱bunda̱. Na amayun a ɗa cu'un vi idaba i ndolo i farai pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />a̱vu gba yu una aza a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i suru ni iliyamunga i na i ri pe na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Ili i na i pura̱i o uvon suru i ɓoloto le a̱tsuma̱ a agalaci a̱ lyuci'i. A̱vu i kula̱to lyuci'i ni ili i na i pura̱i suru, i kula̱to le tse ili i na i cayi kucci va̱ yi vu ukula̱tosu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. Lyuci'i u to o'wo okongo babu ukotu, a̱a̱ da̱shi suwisa yi shi. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />She a̱ tsura̱ ili i ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na a tawai adama o ukototosu u ndolo e ekere a̱ ɗu wan, adama A̱sulazuva a vadala a̱tsuma̱ o upan wu usuɗuwu u na u ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, a̱vu u ka̱lyuwa̱ ɗu ne esu a sa'ani, a̱tsuma̱ e isa'ani ya̱ yi waru u da̱shi ɗu a̱bunda̱ cine u yuwayin nkaya n ɗu nzuwulai oɓolo na akucunu. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />U ta yuwan ne ni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, reve waru i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na u zuwai suru na maa casu ana'an, reve waru i yuwan ili i na i ri mejege e esu a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Ilyalya i cece ni ilyalya yi idaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">N.Gn 11:1-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />A̱ɗu muwun ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa. She i ɗana lipu ɗu wan agba i puna kpana va aci a̱ ɗu a mantsa ma na i ri a̱ nden n wira̱ ma aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i wan, <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />adama a na a̱ɗu ama a akiza a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa. A̱tsuma̱ a ama a na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi u nda suru, A̱sulazuva a ɗangwa ɗu ta̱ ama a̱ yi ili ya agadu a̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />She i tama ili yi idaba wan. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Apa cu'un vi inama i na yaa tama: nan, na̱ kyon, oɓolo na̱ megbele, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />meshon na̱ mere'on na̱ geve na̱ megbele mo una no oroci e geve na̱ kyon masasan. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />I ta gura tama nama vu nama na okotsu a̱ yi a̱ ri uɓatsulai ure na̱ nama na tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ utamisa. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Amma na̱ ne suru, a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ utamisa na aza a na okotsu e le a̱ ri uɓatsulai, yaa tama nama va arakumi shi, na̱ mozomu oɓolo na̱ magima. Ko na a̱ tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ utamisa, a̱ ri no okotsu uɓatsulai shi ele ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Yaa tama ma̱gurusumu shi, ko na okotsu a̱ yi a̱ ri uɓatsulai u tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ utamisa shi. Ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ ɗu, yaa tama nama va̱ yi shi ko i ju'wa̱n a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ yi shi.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />A̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i ri na̱ wuma a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mini suru, i ta gura tama ili i na i ri na̱ muvelu ko a̱ka̱ɓa̱ a̱ lipu. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Amma ili i na i ri na̱ muvelu ko a̱ka̱ɓa̱ shi yaa tama yi shi, ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />I ta gura tama nnunu n cece suru. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Amma ele nda yaa tama shi: a̱a̱kuru na aasala na amikiya, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />na̱ varaɗo na aajimba, ni icu'un i le koko'o, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />na̱ cu'un va aakakan suru, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />na̱ a̱pa̱ma̱ na̱ magapu no oroci a papagula oɓolo na ajimba icu'un icu'un, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />na̱ vori ke'en na̱ a̱ba̱jini o vori na̱ basara uri, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />na̱ vori vu una na aasala no oroci a gbagba mini, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />na aashamuwa no oroci a azamina suru na̱ zogolgomu no oogyon.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Mubumbu n na n ri ne evelu suru aza a na a̱ tsu ka̱ta̱pa̱ e iɗa ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ ɗu, yaa tama le shi. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Ili i na i ri ne evelu suru i na i ri cece i ta gura tama le.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />She i tama ili i na i kuwa̱i ɗe wan. I ta gura ca mocin na ri nden a̱ lyuci ɗu, u ta gura tama yi, ko i winaa mocin. Amma a̱ɗu gba ama a akiza a ɗa i ri e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. &lt;&lt;She i su'wan megbgbele ma na buwai apasa maani wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />&lt;&lt;I reve yu uta̱a̱ ta̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa e itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a na yaa cimbusa aa'wan suru. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />A̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, uba̱ta̱ u na waa ɗangwa adama Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱ ɗa yaa lyuwa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa a̱ kucci vi ishina i ɗu, oɓolo na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma sa'avu, na̱ mani'in ma̱ ɗu oɓolo na̱ kucci vu umatsun wu ufaru vi iliyamunga i ɗu suru, inan ni ikyon na̱ mgbele n ɗu, adama i rito cine yaa uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu babu ukotu. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Amma na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa zuwaa ɗu aba'un, reve gba uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa adama a Ala a̱ yi a yuwan ɗu alanga a na ya̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa, a na yaa gura 'ya̱wa̱a̱ shi, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />i wina za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa'a a̱vu i kita'wan ni ikebe a̱vu i 'ya̱wa̱ ni ikebe'e uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />I yuwan ulinga ni ikebe'e i tsula ili i na i cigai: nan ko kyon, oɓolo na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ko cu'un vi ili yo oso vu ucira ro, ko waru ili i ro ɗe ko'o i na i cigai. A̱vu a̱ɗu na̱ 'wa ɗu suru i lyuwa lo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu reve i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Amma she yi icina na̱ nan Levi a na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu wan, adama a na a̱ ri na akunda ko agadu a aciyele tsa̱ ɗu shi.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />&lt;&lt;O ukosu wa aa'wan a ta'atsu suru, i ta̱ uta̱a̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa suru a̱tsuma̱ e itana yu uɗuma̱ u ɗu za na i gasai a a'wan o ndolo, i zuwa le e ilyuci i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Adama nan Levi a na a̱ ri na akunda ko agadu shi oɓolo no omocin a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu na̱ mkpa'an oɓolo na̱ nruna̱ aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e ilyuci i ɗu a̱ tsura̱ a lyuwa hali a̱ cu'wa̱n. Tsundolo tsa ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a linga ɗu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Aa'wan a̱ mona mo utan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">N.Gn 25:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />&lt;&lt;O ukosu wa a'wan e cindere suru i ciga i 'yuwan yu una atatan. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Apa cine aa yuwan yi: Za na oo tono za va̱ yi za va Isra'ila utan suru wu una atata'an. Wa̱a̱ ushi atsupu e ekere a za va̱ yi za va Isra'ila ko mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi shi, adama a na a yuwan ta̱ yisaali i mona mo utan ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Vu ta gura gbagba mocin tsupa wu, amma ciga 'yuwan vu una utan u na voo tono za va̱ wu. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Amayun, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na waa casu ɗu wo o'wo ɗu ili ya agadu. A̱a̱ tsura̱ za vu ulambu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu shi, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />nna̱ yaa zuwaa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu atsuvu, i yuwan tsutoni waru i yuwan ili i na n damma nɗu suru ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un cine u yuwain nzuwulai, i to kopoo nɗa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ɗu gba ya̱a̱ ushi okopu e ekere a nanza shi. I ta yuwan tsugono tsa nɗa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ amma babu za na aa yuwan tsugono a aci a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱ tsura̱ za vu ulambu a̱tsuma̱ a mmaci n ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu, she i gbama okolo ko i yuwan ukere ugbamu a̱ tyo e ekere a za ɗu za vu ulambu wan. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Amma i kpa̱tu'wa̱a̱ yi ukere, a̱vu i ca yi okopu e ili i na u cigai suru. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />I yuwan ugbozu, she i da̱na̱ na̱ majiyan me iwuya ma nda wan a na, &lt;Aa'wan e cindere, aa'wan a na oo una atatan a yuwan ta̱ zuzu,&gt; hali i rogbodowo za ɗu za vu ulambu urewesu a̱vu i 'yuwan a ca yi ili i ro. Nu u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ mesun a aci a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ ɗu nu unusu. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />I ca yi no okolo a̱ ta̱ babu a̱tsumola̱ngu. Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i yuwain biti ni ili i na i ju'wa̱in suru. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />A kasa na alambi a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ɗu shi, &lt;A̱yi ɗa i zuwai maa dansaa ɗu, i ca a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ta̱, oɓolo na alambi na aza a na a cigai ikambi a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ɗu.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malyawa ma agbashi fa̱a̱n</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:1-11">Mta̱ 21:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ za ɗu imaci ya Ibrahim vali ko ka u winaa ɗu aciya̱yi, a̱vu u yuwaan ɗu ulinga hali a'wan a̱ ta̱li a aa'wan e cindere reve i lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱ fa̱a̱n. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Na̱ yaa lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱, yaa lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱ ekere lya̱nga̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />I ca yi ne'e no okolo a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iliyamunga i na i ri na̱ a̱yi, ikyon na̱ mgbele n ɗu ni ishina i na i fabai, na̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma na i kpokoi. I ca yi a̱tyo a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa nɗu aba'un. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />I cuwan ɗe nu ufaru a̱ɗu agbashi a ɗa i shi e iɗa ya Masar, amma A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a tsupaa ɗu ta̱. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai maa zuwusaa ɗu ili i nda ana'an.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />&lt;&lt;Amma na aagbashi a̱ ɗu a damma ɗu, &lt;N ciga n lyawa ɗu shi,&gt; adama a na u te icigi i ɗu na̱ a̱za̱ o u'wa a̱ ɗu suru, waru u yo'ono yi ta̱ u da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />to, a̱vu i tara yi a̱ tyo o una̱ntsu wu ukobu u ɗu a̱vu i ba̱ma̱ yi utsuvu na̱ bele ma̱ba̱ma̱. U to o'wo aagbashi a̱ ɗu babu ukotu. Tsundolo tsa ɗa yaa yuwan na aagbashi o usheli a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />&lt;&lt;She i tara malyawa ma aagbashi ili yu usa̱n i ɗa wan, adama a na u lingaa ɗu ta̱ a'wan a̱ ta̱li, waru ulinga wa̱ yi u la'a ta̱ ulinga wu za zamalinga toto ure. Ni i yuwan tsunda, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i yuwain biti.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umatsun wu ufaru wi iliyamunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />&lt;&lt;I ta tawaa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu umatsun wu ufaru suru, ogono e inan ni ikyon, oɓolo na̱ mgbele. Yaa yuwan iluma no oogono a nan umatsun wu ufaru shi, waru yaa puna eleme o kyon na̱ megbele umatsun wu ufaru shi. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />A aa'wan suru a̱ɗu na̱ a̱za̱ o u'wa a̱ ɗu i ta tama le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na waa ɗangula. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Amma nu u ri usa̱du, ko a̱kutsuma̱ ko irumba̱ ko cu'un vu mɓa̱la̱ n vama n ro ko'o, yaa ca A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu kucci va̱ yi shi. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />I tama le e ilyuci i ɗu. Vuma na ri idaba na̱ za na ri cece u ta gura tama yi, cine a tsu tama mere'on ko meshon. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Mpasa n ɗaɗa goon yaa tama shi, i to oco yi e iɗa tsa̱ mini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 12:1-20">Mta̱ 12:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">N.Gn 23:5-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Musa lyuwa ta̱ elime na adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;I guza̱ woto wa Abib <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abib </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abib a̱yi ɗa u shi woto wu ufaru wa aa'wan wa aza a Isra'ila za na ri una̱ta̱ na̱ woto wa ta'atsu a̱ tyo za na̱shi wo gogo, a̱ tsu ɗe yi ta̱ waru Nisan</char></note>reve i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, adama a na o woto u ɗaɗa o uta̱a̱ nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar na ayin. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />I ta ca A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu kucci va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tsuma̱ e iliyamunga i na i ri ne ele, ikyon na̱ mgbele ni inan, uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva aa ɗangwa Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />She i tama kucci'i no opopofu a na a yuwain na̱ wolilo wan, amma a̱tsuma̱ a rana cindere i tama opopofu a na a yuwain babu wolilo, opopofu a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, adama a na i lyawai Masar ni ilaɗi, adama a rana wuma ɗu suru i da̱na̱ a cuwusan na̱ mantsa ma na i lyawai Masar. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />She a cina wolilo a̱tsuma̱ e itana i ɗu ko ke'en wan hali rana cindere e iɗa i ɗu. She i lyawa inama i na i paɗai kucci nu ulivu urana wu ufaru waa asa hali she usana u ro wan.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Yaa ca kucci va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Amma i ca kucci'i uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa nɗu adama Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱. Uba̱ta̱ u ɗaɗa goon yaa ca kucci va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa, nu ulivu nu urana u riya̱, tsa mantsa ma na yu uta̱i diga Masar gan. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />I ta su'wan yi reve i tama yi uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa. Nu usana u tawa reve vuma suru ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ o oogodo a̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana ta̱li ɗa yaa tama opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi. O urana we cindere u ɗa yaa yuwan a̱ba̱jini e iɓolo a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo yaa yuwan ulinga u ro shi.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱buki a Ajuma ajuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:22">Mta̱ 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:15">N.Gn 23:15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />&lt;&lt;I kece ajuma e cindere, diga a mantsa ma na i temei kya'an vi ishina i na i ri mishin. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />A̱vu i yuwan A̱buki a Ajuma ajuma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a casu ne'e no okolo a̱ ta̱ a̱tyo a aba'un a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />A̱vu i yuwan mere a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na waa ɗangwa adama Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱, a̱ɗu no olobo ne esheli a̱ ɗu, na agbashi a ali na̱ va̱ a̱ma̱ci, oɓolo na̱ nan Levi a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu, no omocin na̱ mkpa'an oɓolo na̱ nruna̱ n na n ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />I cuwan ɗe nu ufaru a̱ɗu agbashi a ɗa i shi e iɗa ya Masar, reve i toni wila̱ u na a ca nɗu ulobonu.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱buki a̱ Muva̱li</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">N.Gn 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12-38">Mkc 29:12-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />&lt;&lt;I yuwan a̱buki a̱ Muva̱li hali rana cindere ni i koto uɓolotosu wi itana yu uɗuma̱ i na i fabai nu uba̱ta̱ u na i kpokoi masayan ma̱ ina̱bi. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />I yuwan mere a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱buki a̱ ɗu, a̱ɗu, no olobo ne esheli a̱ ɗu na agbashi a ali a̱ ɗu na̱ va̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ nan Levi, oɓolo no omocin a̱ ɗu na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱ n na n ri nden a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Rana cindere ɗa yaa yuwan A̱buki'i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na aa ɗangwa, adama a na u ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un e itana yu uɗuma̱ i ɗu suru oɓolo na̱ linga ve ekere a̱ ɗu, waru i ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ma amayun.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Ali suru a ciga a 'yuwan a̱ ta̱wa̱ o ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva toto uta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangula: a̱yi ɗa A̱buki o Opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi, na̱ A̱buki a Ajuma a ajuma na̱ A̱buki a̱ Muva̱li. She vuma ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva ekere lya̱nga̱ wan. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Vuma suru u ta̱wa̱a̱ ni ili i na waa gura ta̱wa̱a̱, a̱tyo a aba'un a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa nɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱za̱ o uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Reve Musa lyuwa elime na adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;I zuwa a̱za̱ o uge'etosu na azagbain o gundo ɗu suru a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu. A ta yuwaan ama uge'etosu wa amayun. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />She i vadala amayun wan ko i roco ikpa'a wan. She i ushi utowusu wu una̱ wan, adama a na utowusu wu una̱ u tsu rumba̱na̱to ta̱ esu a za vu ugbozu reve u vadala adanshi a za va̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />I toni amayun, waru amayun goon adama i yuwan wuma waru i tsura̱ iɗa i na A̱sulazuva aa casu ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ musula̱ n ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />&lt;&lt;She i shuwa̱ a̱shuwutsu o una̱ wa̱ a̱ma̱li a Ashera zuzu na̱ masa'a ma na yaa yuwan adama a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu wan. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />A̱a̱ shuwa̱ aatali adama a yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a 'yuwan ta̱ ili i ndolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />&lt;&lt;She i ca A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu nan ko kyon na ri na̱ mɓa̱la̱ ko usa̱du wan, adama a na ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />&lt;&lt;Na a cina vali ko ka na ri nden a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i na A̱sulazuva a ca nɗu a yuwusan ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a kuɗusa akucunu a̱ yi, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />e re na a yuwusaan musula̱ n ro tsutoni na̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ o urana ko woto, ko italyo'o ya zuva za na m putsayi, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />waru na̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu ta̱ na aɗa o ndolo, i ciga i 'yuwan yi indana yi ulobonu lon. Nna amayun a ɗa reve a̱ usu a yuwan ta̱ ili i wuya i ndolo a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />i tara vali'i ko ka'a za na yuwain ili i wuya i ndolo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o una̱ntsu u lyuci, reve a vara yi hali o una yi. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Na adanshi o una̱ wa ama e re ko ama a ta'atsu a ta gura una vuma, amma u ri n yuwan o una vuma adama a adanshi o una̱ u vuma ta̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Ekere a ama a na e ene niyi'i ele ɗa aa fara mavara ma̱ yi reve aza a na a buwai o ɓolo ekere adama o una yi. Tsundolo tsa ɗa aa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">1 Kor 5:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uba̱ta̱ o uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />&lt;&lt;Na adanshi o usuɗuwu a̱ ta̱wa̱ o ukobu wu uge'etosu adama vu ge'eto, ko adama o wocosu wu mpasa, ko mawasan o ukobu wu uge'etosu ko wisulusa, vu tara le a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva aa ɗangwa. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />I 'ya̱wa̱ na adanshi'i uba̱ta̱ u nan ganu a na a̱ ri nan Levi, na̱ za na ri za vu uge'etosu a mantsa'a. I damma le ili i na yaa damatosun ɗu, a ta paɗa ugana u na wu ntsayi. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Reve i yuwan cine wila̱ wi ili i na a paɗai u damma nɗu uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwa. I reve i yuwan ta̱ cine a damma nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />I toni wila̱ u na o rito nɗu na afada a na a paɗaa nɗu, she i ɓatsa e ili i na a damma nɗu a̱ tyo ugula̱ ko usa'ani wan. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Vuma na yuwain aciyogbamu na̱ za vu uge'etosu ko na̱ ganu na aa yuwusan ulinga a mantsa'a e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a ciga a 'yuwan o una yi. Tsundolo tsa ɗa aa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Ama'a suru a ta uwwa reve wovon u tsura̱ le, a̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan aciyogbamu waru shi.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ili i na yi ntsayi Mogono ma yuwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />&lt;&lt;Ni i uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a casu ɗu reve i tara yi wo o'wo za ɗu reve waru i da̱nu pe, reve i damma, &lt;Lyawai tsu zamiyi mogono cine akapi a nɗa a na a̱ ri u ka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱tsu a̱ ri,&gt; <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />i reve i zuwa ta̱ mogono ma na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangwaa ɗu. Vuma'a i ciga i 'yuwan wu uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu, she i zuwa mocin za na za va Isra'ila ɗa shi wo o'wo mogono ma̱ ɗu wan. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />She mogono'o u ɓolotowo aciya̱yi ido wan, waru she u lyungu ama a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ da̱shi tsula ido a̱tsuma̱ a Masar wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ ama a̱ yi, &lt;I buwa a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Masar shi.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Waru waa zuwa a̱ma̱ci a̱ a̱bunda̱ shi, ta̱wa̱ a vadala okolo a̱ yi u lyawa A̱sulazuva wan. She u ɓoloto azurufa na̱ zinariya va̱ a̱bunda̱ wan.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Nu u kumba o ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ yi, u ta̱ zuwa a̱ pura̱a̱ yi wila̱ u nda a aatagada o ukutsuluwu, za na ri e ekere a nan ganu, aza a na ele ɗa nan Levi. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Aatagada a̱ wila̱ꞌa̱ u ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, mogono'o u ta̱ da̱na̱ e ɗesu yi nu una̱ hali ukosu u wuma wa̱ yi adama u rito cine waa yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ yi, a yuwusan tsutoni ulobonu ni idanshi i wila̱ i nda ni ili i na a zuwa suru. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Nu u yuwan ne u ta putsa yi a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n avangaci a̱ yi ngashi u la'a ta̱ akapi a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi. Reve u putsa yi a vadalaa wila̱ꞌa̱ ucina̱ a̱ tyo usa'ani ko ugula̱. Reve a̱yi nu ugundo wa̱ yi a jima a yuwusan tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Ucasu adama a nan ganu na̱ nan Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 18:8-32">Mkc 18:8-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Nan ganu aza a na ele ɗa nan Levi, ugundo wa̱ Levi suru, a̱a̱ ushi akunda ko agadu e iɗa oɓolo na akapi a ama a Isra'ila shi. A ta lyuwa kucci na a̱a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva va akina, adama a na a̱yi ɗa agadu e le. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />A̱a̱ tsura̱ agadu e iɗa oɓolo na akapi a ama a̱za̱ e le shi, A̱sulazuva a ɗa agadu e le cine u yuwaan nle nzuwulai.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Apa nda ili i na yoo o'wo agadu a nan ganu a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na ama aa casu kucci, ko nan ko kyon: uvatsu nu ugbaguzu ni iliya̱tsuma̱. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />I ta ca le kucci vu ufaru vi ishina i ɗu, oɓolo na̱ masayan ma sa'avu ma̱ ina̱bi ma̱ ɗu, na̱ mani'in hali ne eleme e ikyon i ɗu aza a na a punai. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗangwa le ta̱ ɗe na̱ muwun n le a̱tsuma̱ o gundo suru e isawan a̱vu a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a ala a̱ A̱sulazuva babu ukotu.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vuma na ri Levi 'yon u lyawa lyuci ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na u ri na̱ nden ko te ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, nu u ta̱wa̱ nu ucigu wa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a ɗangwai, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />u ta gura yuwan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ yi cine a̱za̱ a̱ yi nan Levi a yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ ɗe a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />U ta̱ tsura̱ akunda e ilyalya ya̱ yi una̱ta̱ na akapi a nan Levi, ko na u ushiyi ikebe a̱tsuma̱ a agadu e itana i na a̱za̱ o u'wa e le a winai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuɓari adama a linga vi idaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i uwai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu, she i toni ili yi idaba cine a̱za̱ e iɗa o ndolo aa yuwusan ɗe wan. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />She a̱ tsura̱ ko vuma ta̱ na aa ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu ulobo ko usheli wa̱ yi a akina wan, ko u rito tsuboci ko yindi ko za vu ucuɗuwusa wa alavu ko za vu nkunu, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />ko boci, ko za na a yuwusan ulinga no otoni a̱ lima̱, ko za na tsu zami urevu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Za na suru yuwain ili i ndolo wo o'wo ta̱ idaba e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, waru adama linga vi idaba i nda A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to loso nɗa n ndolo elime a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Ni i ciga i 'yuwan yoo o'wo babu unusu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vumava̱sula̱ ro tsa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Adama a na ama a nɗa n na yoo lo'o a ta zuwusaa a̱za̱ a̱ nkunu no ozo o tsuboci atsuvu, agba a̱ɗu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a lyawa ɗu i yuwan ili i ndolo shi. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ɗu vumava̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ ɗu tsa̱ va̱, i zuwaa yi atsuvu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:37">Ajy 7:37</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Adama a na ili i na i patiyi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa ɗe Horeb o urana wi iɓolo'o ana i dammai, &lt;She vu lyawa tsu da̱shi uwwa uɗyo wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu wan, waru she tsu da̱shi ene akina a gbain a nda wan, na̱ ne ɗa shi tsu ta̱ kuwa̱i.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:22">Ajy 3:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;Ili i na a dammai mejege ma ɗa le. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />N ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n le vumava̱sula̱ tsa̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ e le, n ta zuwa adanshi a̱ va̱ o una̱ wa̱ yi, a̱yi u ta damma le ili i na n zuwai suru. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Vuma na zuwai atsuvu a adanshi a na vumava̱sula̱'a̱ dammai a ala a̱ va̱ shi, a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta ca yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Ajy 3:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Amma vumava̱sula̱ za na a yuwusan majiyan u ta yuwusan adanshi o una̱ u va̱ a dansa ili i na n zuwa niyi u damma shi, ko u yuwan adanshi na ala a̱ ma̱sula̱ mo ro, i ciga i 'yuwan yu una yi.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />&lt;&lt;I ta gura damma o okolo a̱ ɗu, &lt;Cine tsa ɗa tsaa gura reve ikaka i na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai shi?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Ni ili i na vumava̱sula̱ dammai na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva a shiwan shi ko wo o'wo amayun shi, ili i ndolo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa wu uta̱i shi. Vumava̱sula̱'a̱ u damma ta̱ majiyan ma̱ yi. She yu uwwa wovon wa̱ yi wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Ilyuci i mapa'an</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Mkc 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Jos 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o kototo nɗa n na waa ca ɗu, a̱vu ni i lo le o uta̱ reve i da̱nu e ilyuci i le na̱ 'wa le, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />i ne'eshen iɗa'a uta'atsu, a̱vu i tawa ilyuci i ta'atsu aza a na a̱ ri e memere me iɗa'a na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ca ɗu wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />I yuwan re a̱tsuma̱ e le, adama na̱ vuma una vuma ro u tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ u na waa suma a̱ tyo.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />&lt;&lt;Apa cine wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ vuma una vuma babu ucigu, waru a̱ ri a n'yuwunlai ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ shi, u ta gura suma a̱ tyo e ilyuci i ndolo adama u la'ato wuma wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Iroci, a damma nanza 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ magasa ma ɗanga oɓolo ni i'utsa̱ ya̱ yi o ogozo, reve za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a magasa reve rumu va aɓau sa̱nga̱ reve u gasa za ve ire hali wu una yi, a̱yi vuma na unai vuma'a, u ta gura suma a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci ta̱ vi ilyuci i ndolo, adama u wawa aciya̱yi. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Na̱ ne ɗa shi, a̱yi imaci i zuzu yi za na o unai za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi, u ta gura toni vuma ndolo nu upan, reve u cina yi adama a na ure'e u ri alanga, reve wu una yi ko na wu ntsaa o una yi shi, adama a na u yuwan yi ta̱ babu n'yuwunlai ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa n zuwa nɗu i tawaa aciya̱ɗu ilyuci i ta'atsu.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa iɗa i ɗu i yuwan mgbain, cine u yuwayin nkaya n ɗu nzuwulai, reve u ca ɗu iɗa'a suru cine u yuwaan nle nzuwulai, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />nni i toni, a̱vu i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na n zuwaa nɗu ana'an, i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, reve i yuwan mmalu o ure wa̱ yi kuci, to i da̱shi tawa ilyuci i ta'atsu waru. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />A yuwan tsundolo adama she o oco mpasa mu za babu unusu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu wo o'wo ɗu agadu wan, adama mpasa mu za babu unusu u da̱na̱ a aci a̱ ɗu wan.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />&lt;&lt;Amma na̱ za ro 'yuwan za va̱ yi, reve u 'ya̱wa̱ u vawan yi a̱vu u 'yon wu una yi, a̱vu u suma a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ndolo, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />azagbain a̱ lyuci va̱ yi a̱ lyunguwa̱ yi za a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi, reve a ca yi e ekere a za na cigai u tsupaa mpasa mu za va̱ yi na o unai, adama o una yi. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />She ye ene iliyali ya̱ yi wan. Tsundolo tsa ɗa yaa putsa wocosu wu mpasa mu za babu unusu a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, tsa̱ra̱ i tsura̱ asuvu nden.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />&lt;&lt;She i tawa urotsu wu utyo wi iɗa ya agadu o moron ma̱ nden ma̱ ɗu wan za na nkaya n ɗu n zuwai, za na a̱yi ɗa agadu e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila̱ adama a za na oo o'wo esu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />&lt;&lt;Adanshi a vuma ta̱ a rawa a̱ usu a na a ca za ro unusu shi, ko a damma u ta̱ nu unusu shi, shede na a uwwa o una̱ wa ama e re ko ama a ta'atsu kafu wo o'wo amayun.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">2 Kor 13:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ za na ri na̱ majiyan ma wuya u ciga u yuwan adanshi a aci a za ro, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ele ra a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, waru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma nan ganu na̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu aza a na a yuwusan ulinga a mantsa'a. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Ele a̱za̱ o uge'etosu e te petelyuwe adanshi o ndolo ulobonu. Na a cina u yuwan ta̱ epen a aci a vuma ndolo, a casu adanshi e epen a aci a za va̱ yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />a̱vu a yuwan na̱ vuma ndolo ili i na u shi u cigai a yuwaan za va̱ yi. Tsundolo tsa ɗa yaa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Akapi a ama a ta uwwa a̱vu a uwwa wovon, a̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan cu'un vi iwuya ndolo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />She ye ene iliyali wan, u to o'wo wuma o una̱ u wuma, lyusu waru o una̱ u lyusu, anga o una̱ wa anga, ukere waru o una̱ wu ukere, anana o una̱ wa anana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ adama o uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />&lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na i 'ya̱wa̱i i yuwan uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu reve ye ene ido oɓolo ni ikeke yi ido na̱ a̱soja a na a la'ai a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu, she yu uwwa wovon u le wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, za na uta̱a̱ nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, u to oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Kafu i teme uvon, ganu ta uwa elime a̱vu u yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱soja. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Apa ili i na waa damma: &lt;Zuwai atsuvu a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila, ana'an i ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu. She okolo a̱ ɗu a kuɗa wan ko yu uwwa wovon wan, ko lipu ɗu je'en wan ko yi da'wan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le wan. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu u ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu u yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu, waru u ta ca ɗu ulyuwu wa aci.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na azagbain a̱ a̱soja aa damma a̱soja'a, &lt;Za ro ta̱ lo na suwai u'wa u sa'avu agba koto u ca yi e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva shi? Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, ta̱wa̱ u kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uvon reve nanza ca A̱sulazuva a̱yi. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Nanza cu'wa̱n ta̱ ɗe uɗuma̱ wa̱ ina̱bi, agba koto u fara a lyuwusa yi shi? Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, ta̱wa̱ u kuwa̱ o uvon reve nanza uwwa uyo'o wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Nanza ta̱ ne egeɓe a na waa zama u zuwa, agba koto u zuwa yi shi? Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, ta̱wa̱ u kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uvon reve nanza zuwa yi.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Reve azagbain a̱ a̱soja'a a̱ da̱shi damma, &lt;Nanza ta̱ pa aa uwwusa wovon ko ukuɗu wo okolo? Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa tsa̱ra̱ okolo a kuɗa a̱za̱ a̱ yi wan.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Mantsa ma na azagbain a yuwayin a̱soja adanshi o kotoi, reve a ɗangwaa le nan yali ya̱ a̱soja.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />&lt;&lt;Ni i rawa zuzu na̱ lyuci na ya̱a̱ riya̱a̱ nu uvon, i fara lyunguwa̱ le ni ikaka yi izami yi nden ma asuvu. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Na̱ a̱ usu ikaka yi izami yi nden ma asuvu'u a̱vu a ca aciyele e ekere a̱ ɗu, to, ama a̱ lyuci'i suru a ta yuwaan ɗu ulinga, a ta yuwaan ɗu tsugbashi. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Agba na a 'yuwan a̱ usu a yuwan nden ma asuvu na̱ a̱ɗu reve e teme uvon na̱ a̱ɗu, reve i ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci'i nu uvon. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca ɗu lyuci ndolo e ekere a̱ ɗu, ali a na a̱ ri pe suru o una le na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Amma a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun ni iliyamunga oɓolo ni ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i i ta gura pura̱ le. U to o'wo ɗu agadu e ili i na a usai uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. I yuwan ulinga ni itana i na i usai uba̱ta̱ wu uvo'on, itana i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu diga e ekere a n'yuwatan n ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa yaa yuwan ni ilyuci i na i ri alanga na̱ a̱ɗu suru, ilyuci ya ama a na a̱ ri zuzu na̱ nɗa n na n ri zuzu na̱ a̱ɗu shi.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />&lt;&lt;Amma mantsa ma na i remei iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu agadu a̱ yi, she i lyawa ko ili i ro wuma wan. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />I kototo le suru suru, aza a Hitiya na aza a Amoriya na aza a Ka'ana, oɓolo na aza a Periziya na aza a Hiviya na aza a Jebusiya, cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Na̱ ne ɗa shi o to rito ɗu ili yi idaba i na aa yuwusaan musula̱ n le, hali a zuwa ɗu i yuwan unusu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />&lt;&lt;Ni i jima a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwusa̱ lyuci nu uvon, adama i lyuwa yi, yoo una ɗanga lyuci'i na̱ wukoɗu u le na aɓau shi, adama a na i ta gura lyuwa limatan le, yoo koɗo le shi. Ɗanga vu una ama a ɗa shi a na ya̱a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ le nu uvon. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Amma gba, i ta gura koɗo ɗanga na i revei a tsu matsan muwun shi. Ele ndolo i ta gura yuwan ulinga ne ele i yuwan ukumbata adama o uvon hali she na̱ lyuci na ri a yuwusan uvon na̱ a̱ɗu riya̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ adama a̱ mona ma na e revei ufaru wa̱ yi shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ca ɗu za va agadu ni i cina pe za na o unai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a, agba i reve za na una niyi shi, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />mbara n ɗu na̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu a̱ ɗu o uta̱, a̱vu o rito alanga o uba̱ta̱ u na a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱ a̱ ri ni ilyuci i na i ri lo uka̱nda̱ruwu. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />A̱vu mbara n lyuci n na la'ai zuzu na̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱ a tara manan ma na koto a yuwain ulinga na̱ a̱yi shi waru koto a zuwayi a̱gba̱la̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />A̱vu mbara'a a tara yi a̱ tyo o uka̱ri u na koto a lumai ko a̱ cu'wa̱in shi, uba̱ta̱ u na uɗolu u ri e meyene. Ɗe o uka̱ri'i ɗaɗa a kuɗa yinlu i mana'an. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />A̱vu nan ganu, olobo a̱ Levi, a̱ ta̱wa̱ elime, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗangula le ta̱ adama a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱vu a zuwa aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a paɗa una̱ wa adanshi a na a̱ ri a mawasan na̱ wamatowun u na za ro amatoyin za ro. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />A̱vu mbara n lyuci n na n ri zuzu na̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱ a sa'a ekere e le zuva manan ma na a kuɗai yinlu o uka̱ri'i, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />A̱vu a damma, &lt;Ekere a̱ tsu o oco mpasa nda shi, waru esu a̱ tsu e ene ana a yuwain ili i nda shi. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />A̱sulazuva, usu kucci matara mo ume mo unusu ma nda o una̱ wa ama a̱ wu Isra'ila, aza a na vu tsupayi, agba she vu reme ama a̱ wu nu unusu wu mpasa wu za na ri nu unusu wan.&gt; A̱vu a yuwan gafura vu mpasa n na o ocoi'i. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ne ɗa yaa tawaa aciya̱ɗu unusu u wocosu wu mpasa n na n ri nu unusu shi, adama a na i yuwain ili i na i ri mejege e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lolo na̱ ka na e remei uba̱ta̱ wu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i 'ya̱wa̱i na yaa yuwan uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu, a̱vu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca ɗu ele e ekere a̱ ɗu a̱vu i pura̱ le o o'wo agbashi a̱ ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />reve na̱ ve ene ka vu ulobonu ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na i pura̱i'i, reve u uwa o okolo a̱ wu vu ta gura tara yi wo o'wo ka va̱ wu. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Vu tara yi a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ wu a̱vu vu zuwa yi u puna a̱nji a̱ yi, wu koɗo a̱kpa̱ta̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />A̱vu u foɗo a̱tugu a na u da̱na̱i wotowu ne ele a mantsa ma na e reme niyi. Nu u ri nden o u'wa wa̱ wu a̱vu u yuwan nden n wira̱ u ta̱ ma mma va̱ yi na̱ dada va̱ yi woto u ta̱ ma̱ɓula̱, a̱vu vu uwa ya̱'a̱ yi vo o'wo vali va̱ yi a̱yi waru wo o'wo ka va̱ wu. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Na̱ vu uwwa uyo'o wu nden na̱ a̱yi shi, a̱vu vu lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na u cigai biti. Agba vaa wina yi shi ko vu da̱na̱ a yuwusan na̱ a̱yi tsa aagbashi shi, adama a na vu von ta̱ ɗe na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucira u mawun mo ufaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vali ta̱ na̱ a̱ma̱ci e re, a̱vu u la'a ciga za ta̱, a̱vu u 'yuwan za ta̱, agba suru nle a matsaan yi ta̱ muwun ma ali agba ulobo wu ufaru ma ka na u cigai ɗa shi, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />a mantsa ma na wee ne'esheen muwun ma̱ yi agadu a̱ yi, waa ca ucira u mawun mo ufaru ma ka na u la'a cigai o una̱ wu ulobo wu ufaru wa amayun ma̱ yi ma ka na u kuɗa̱i a ciga shi. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Nu u 'yuwan u ciga u usu umatsun wu ulobo wu ufaru ma ka na u cigai shi tsu ulobo wu ufaru wa̱ yi na waa ca yi uɓatsulai ure wi ili i na u ri na̱ a̱yi. Ulobo u ndolo a̱yi ɗa iroci yu ucira yu ufaru wa dada va̱ yi. Ucira u mawun mo ufaru wa̱ yi u ɗa.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila̱ adama a mawun mo ugbawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vuma ta̱ nu ulobo za na ri ugbawu ko za na tsu uwwa adanshi shi, za na tsu ca dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi tsugbain shi waru u tsu uwwa adanshi e le a mantsa ma na aa ɓarasa yi shi, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi e reme yi a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi uba̱ta̱ wu mbara n lyuci n le o una̱ntsu u lyuci. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />A̱vu a damma mbara'a, &lt;Mawun ma̱ tsu ma nda u tu ugbawu waru u tsu uwwa adanshi shi. U tsu yuwaan tsu tsutoni shi. A̱yi za va alya a̱bunda̱ no ososowi a ɗa.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />A̱vu ama a̱ lyuci le suru a vara yi na atali hali u kuwa̱. Ni i ciga i 'yuwan yu uta̱a̱ iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. Isra'ila suru a ta uwwa reve a uwwa wovon.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila̱ icu'un icu'un</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vuma yuwan unusu u na u rawai u kuwa̱, a̱vu o una yi, reve a̱ sa̱ga̱do lipu va̱ yi zuva vu uɗanga, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />yaa lyawa lipu va̱ yi zuva vu uɗanga a cina usana shi. I reve i ciɗo yi ta̱ o urana u ndolo, adama a na za na suru a̱ sa̱ga̱doi zuva vu uɗanga A̱sulazuva a yuwaan yi ta̱ una̱. I ciɗo yi adama i lyungusa̱ iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu agadu wan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:13">Gal 3:13</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ve enei nan ko kyon vu za va̱ wu puwa̱yin she vu tawa esu a̱ wu wan, amma vu reve vu guɓa yi ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wu za vi ili. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Agba na̱ za vi ili'i u ri na̱ nden zuzu na̱ a̱vu shi ko gba vu reve yi shi, vu tara yi a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ wu a̱vu vu ɓana yi a cina mantsa ma na waa zami yi. A̱vu vu ca yi. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Vu yuwan ne a mantsa ma na ve enei mololi ko a̱tugu a za va̱ wu ko ili i na i puwa̱n niyi, she vu tawa esu wan.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ve enei mololi ko nan vu za va̱ wu riya̱i o ure, she vu tawa esu a̱ wu wan. Vu kamba vu 'ya̱sa̱n yi.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />&lt;&lt;She ka vo oto itana ya ali wan, ko vali oto itana ya̱ a̱ma̱ci wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu e te inda idaba yi za na aa yuwusan ne.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ve enei yikinda i manunu a̱ nge'en mu ure, ko zuva vu uɗanga ko e iɗa, agba mma le tu uva̱pu a̱ muwun ma̱ yi ko e ipiri yo okowo a̱ yi, she vu pura̱ mma na̱ muwu'un wan. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Vu ta gura tara muwun, amma a̱vu vu lyawa mma le u ka̱ra̱, adama vu tsura̱ asuvu nden waru vu jima.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na vu suwai u'wa u sa'avu, vu suwaa yi ugeshete adama vu ta̱wa̱ nu unusu u wocosu wu mpasa o u'wa wa̱ wu na̱ vuma ro riya̱ diga o ukwa̱'a̱ wa̱ wu wan.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />&lt;&lt;She vu cu'wa̱n icu'un yi icu'un i re a̱tsuma̱ o uɗuma̱ wa̱ ina̱bi wa̱ wu wan, na̱ vu yuwan ne, icu'un i na vu cu'wa̱in goon ɗa va̱a̱ lungusa̱ shi amma hali oɓolo na̱ muwun mu uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi fo a̱ ta̱ la̱nga̱.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />&lt;&lt;She vu ɓolo nan na̱ mololi iluma wan.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />&lt;&lt;She vo oto a̱tugu na a ɗavai na̱ ulu uja̱mba̱ru no okoro wan.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />&lt;&lt;I yuwaan a̱tugu a na yoo otosu alagba a̱ na̱shi a̱ nge'en n na̱shi.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila̱ a aci a̱ tsipere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na vali zuwai ka a̱vu u von na̱ a̱yi, agba u ciga yi waru shi, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />a̱vu u da̱na̱ a yuwusan adanshi e epen a aci a̱ yi, a̱vu u lungusa̱ ala a̱ yi, a dansa, &lt;N zuwa ta̱ ka nda, a mantsa ma na n voyin na̱ a̱yi, agba n tsura̱ ta̱ iroci i na u revei ɗe vali.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />A̱vu dada na̱ mma vu usheli'i a̱ ta̱wa̱ ni iroci i na yoo roco a na koto u shi u revei vali shi uba̱ta̱ wu mbara o una̱ntsutsu u lyuci. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />A̱vu dada vu usheli'i u damma mbara'a, &lt;N ca ta̱ vuma nda usheli u va̱ lolo, agba u 'yuwan yi ta̱.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Agba gogo u lyungusa̱ yi ta̱ ala, u damma, &lt;N cina usheli u ɗu a na koto u revei vali shi.&gt; Amma n ta̱ ni iroci i na moo roco usheli u va̱ koto u reve vali shi. Adama o ndolo a̱vu nan dada vu usheli'i a̱ ba̱ruwa̱ umuna wi iroci'i elime a mbara n lyuci'i. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />A̱vu mbara'a n tara vuma'a a faba yi. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />A̱vu a lyuwa yi ugana u tsupa ukunzuwu u azurufa ukpaku (100) u ca nan dada vu usheli'i, adama a na vuma nda ca ta̱ za va Isra'ila za na koto revei vali shi ala a vama. Agba u ta buwa ka va̱ yi, waa kasa na̱ a̱yi shi, hali ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />&lt;&lt;Amma na adanshi o ndolo amayun a ɗa, waru e ene iroci i na usheli'i u kuɗa̱i e reve vali shi, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />a̱vu a tara yi o uta̱ o una̱ntsu wu u'wa wa dada va̱ yi, a̱vu ama a̱ lyuci le a vara yi na atali hali o una yi. Adama a na u yuwan ta̱ ili i wono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila a na wo o'woi ashakala a̱yi ubuwu a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi. Ne ɗa yaa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />&lt;&lt;Ne e reme vali ro a yuwusan tsipere na̱ ka vu za ro, vali'i na̱ ka ndolo suru a̱ ta̱ o una le. Ne ɗa yaa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci vali cina usheli u na koto u revei vali shi, agba u ta̱ ne egeɓe a na woo lo a̱vu u von na̱ a̱yi, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />a̱vu i tara le ra a̱ tyo o una̱ntsutsu u lyuci u ndolo adama a vara le na atali hali a̱ kuwa̱ adama a na usheli'i u da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci agba u saala adama a wawa yi shi, waru adama a na vuma ndolo lungusa̱ ta̱ egeɓe a nanza. Ne ɗa yaa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />&lt;&lt;Amma na a atsusa a ɗa vuma cinai usheli u na u ri ne egeɓe a na oo olo, a̱vu u von na̱ a̱yi nu ucira, vuma na yuwain ne ɗa goon oo una. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />She i yuwan ili nu usheli'i wan, adama a na u yuwan unusu u na u rawai a na wa̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi. Adama a na addama a nda una̱ta̱ u ɗa u ri na̱ za vuma na cinai moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi reve u reme wu una yi. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Adama a na vuma'a u cina ta̱ usheli'i a atsusa, amma ko na usheli'i wo oruwoi babu za na aa wawa yi.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vuma cina usheli u na koto u revei vali shi za na koto a yuwain adanshi o lolo va̱ yi shi, reve u von na̱ a̱yi nu ucira reve e reme le, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />u ta tsupa dada vu usheli'i ukunzuwu u azurufa kupoton. Waru u ta zuwa usheli'i, adama a na u lyungusa̱ yi ta̱. Agba waa kakasa lolo na̱ a̱yi shi she ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />&lt;&lt;Vuma aa zuwa ka va dada va̱ yi shi, she u zuwa dada va̱ yi o wono wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Za na aa uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />&lt;&lt;Vuma na suru o foɗoi arawa a̱ yi ko o koɗoi lipu tsali tsa̱ yi waa uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sulazuva shi.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />&lt;&lt;A̱girutu suru ko limatan vu ugundo wa̱ yi, waa uwwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sulazuva shi, hali a cina mantsa ma kupa.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />&lt;&lt;Babu za va Amon ko vuma va̱ Mowa ko limatan vu gundo le na aa uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sulazuva, hali a cina mantsa ma kupa. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Adama a na a ga'aton ɗu no opopofu na̱ mini o ure a mantsa ma na yu uta̱i Masar shi, adama a na a tsupa ta̱ Balam ulobo wa̱ Beyo diga Peto a̱tsuma̱ a Mesopotamiya adama u yuwaan ɗu una̱. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Amma gba A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa Balam atsuvu shi, amma a̱vu u vadala una̱ u na waa yuwusaan ɗu a̱ ka̱mba̱ aba'un, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ciga ɗu ta̱. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />She i zami nden m muwwulai ne ele ko ulyuwu we elime u le wan a̱tsuma̱ a mantsa ma rana wuma ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />&lt;&lt;She ye yene idaba ya aza a Edom wan, adama a na imaci i ɗu i ɗa. She ye ene idaba ya aza a Masar wan, adama a na ɗe nu ufaru i yuwan ta̱ nden n tsumocin a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i le. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Muwun n na a matsaan nle a mantsa ma ta'atsu a ta gura uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɓolo ya ama a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idaba a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i va̱la̱i na yaa yuwan uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n ɗu i suma ili i na suru i rotsoi idaba. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu na̱ nanza oco ta̱ tsali tsa̱ yi na ayin, u to uta̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ a̱vu wi isawan a alanga. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Ulivu a mayuwaan reve u sumba̱, a̱vu nu urana u riya̱ u ka̱mba̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />&lt;&lt;I tawa uba̱ta̱ u ro ko'o a̱ca̱pa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ u ɗu adama i tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ u na ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ aa yuwusan rulu. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />A̱tsuma̱ e itana yu ulinga u ɗu reve i zami ili i na ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱pusa̱ iɗa na̱ a̱yi, a mantsa ma na i yuwain rulu, a̱vu i ka̱pa̱ a̱ka̱ri reve i ciɗo rulu na i yuwain. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a tsu burusa ɗu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ u ɗu adama u geshe ɗu, a̱vu u ca n'yuwatan n ɗu e ekere a̱ ɗu. Uba̱ta̱ wu nden n ɗu u da̱na̱ na akiza, adama ta̱wa̱ we ene ili i ro i na i ri idaba a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱vu u vadalaa ɗu ucina̱ wan.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila̱ u ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />&lt;&lt;Na aagbashi a suma u pa'an ya̱'a̱ wu she vu ka̱mbuwa̱ yi e ekere a zagbain va̱ yi wan. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />I lyawa yi u da̱nu na̱ a̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na u cigai biti ko a̱ lyuci na u ɗangulai suru. She i ɓongi yi wan.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />&lt;&lt;Babu vali va Isra'ila ko ka na voo o'wo ashakala a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Agba she i ta̱wa̱ ni ikebe i na aashakala a vali ko a ka a̱ tsura̱i a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu adama aa tsupa akucunu wan, adama a na ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />&lt;&lt;She vu ushi uda̱shiyi a̱tsuma̱ o okopu a na vu cayi za va̱ wu wan, uda̱shiyi wi ikebe, uda̱shiyi wi ilyalya, uda̱shiyi wi ili i na o kopoi suru a na wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu uda̱shiyi. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />I ta gura ushi uda̱shiyi e ekere o mocin, babu na̱ za va̱ wu za va Isra'ila, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i zuwai ekere a̱ ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na i cigai i uwwa wo o'wo agadu a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i yuwain akucunu na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, she i jima babu tsupa wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu e te ece ɗu, e te reme ɗu nu unusu. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Amma ni i suma matara ma akucunu, woo o'wo ɗu unusu shi. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Suru ili i na una̱ u ɗu u dammai i yuwan ne, adama a na i yuwan ta̱ akucunu nu ucigu u ɗu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu nu una̱ u ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na vu uwai a̱tsuma̱ o uɗuma̱ wa̱ ina̱bi u moron ma̱ nden ma̱ wu, vu ta gura lyuwa muwun n ina̱bi cine vu cigai suru, amma she vu zuwa ko ili a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsa̱n va̱ wu wan. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Na̱ vu uwa a̱tsuma̱ o uɗuma̱ wi ishina u moron ma̱ nden ma̱ wu, a̱vu vu cina ishina ya̱ yi mishin vu ta̱ gura kuɗa ne ekere a̱ wu, amma she vu kyu'wan ishina i mishin ya̱ yi na̱ matsun wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s">Wila̱ u wukasu u lolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vuma zuwa ka reve u ta̱wa̱ wu uwwisa uyo'o wa̱ yi shi adama a na u cina yi ta̱ ni ili i na i lobono niyi shi, a̱vu u ɗanaa yi aatagada a wukasu u lolo, a̱vu u ca yi adama u lyawaa yi u'wa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mak 10:4</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Reve na̱ wu uta̱ u lyawa u'wa wa̱ yi, a̱vu wo olo vali ro, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />a̱vu vali ire'e waru u 'yuwan yi hali u ɗanaa yi aatagada a wukasu u lolo, a̱vu u ca yi u gba̱ra̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa yi, ko waru gba na̱ vali'i u kuwa̱, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />agba vali vu ufaru va̱ yi, za na ca niyi aatagada a wukasu u lolo wa̱a̱ da̱shi zuwa yi a na woo o'wo ka va̱ yi waru shi adama a na u lyungusa̱ ta̱ ɗe aciya̱yi nu ufaru. Ili yi idaba i ɗa e ekere A̱sulazuva. She i ta̱wa̱ ni ili yi idaba a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ca ɗu agadu wan.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Vuma na yuwain lolo usa'avu, she i lyungu yi uvon wan ko i ca yi ulinga u ro wan. U ta̱ da̱na̱ fa̱a̱n wi isawan o u'wa hali aa'wan a̱ ta̱ adama u yo'onoto ka va̱ yi okolo.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />&lt;&lt;She vu ushi aatali a yira o una̱ wu utan wan ko aatali e ke'en ko za gbain, adama a na u to o'wo she damma a tara ta̱ wuma u vuma'a o una̱ wi ili i na oo tono.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />&lt;&lt;Vuma na e remei wi iva̱i za va̱ yi za va Isra'ila, a̱vu u ka̱mbuwa̱ yi tsa aagbashi ko u wina yi, vivu ndolo a̱ to una yi. Ne ɗa yaa tawa iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />&lt;&lt;Adama a̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu, i yuwan ugbozu, i yuwan cine nan ganu, aza a na ele ɗa nan Levi a damma nɗu foo. I kuru ili i na n zuwaa nle ulobonu. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Cuwain ni ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwain na̱ Maryamu o ure a mantsa ma na yu uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Masar.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ vu ca moron ma̱ nden ma̱ wu utan vu cu'un vi ili suru, she vu 'ya̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi adama vu tara yi itana o una̱ wi ili i na voo tono yi wan. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Vi isawan a alanga reve vu lyawa vuma na vu cayi uta'an u ta̱wa̱a̱ wu ni ili'i. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Na̱ vuma'a alambi a ɗa, she vaa asa ni ili i na u ca nuwu e ekere a̱ wu wan. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />I ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ yi aapalutsu a̱ yi nu ulivu adama wa asaa. A̱vu u godyo ɗu, u to o'wo ɗu ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />&lt;&lt;She i paala za zamalinga za na ri nu ulambu wan, ko za ɗu za va Isra'ila ko mocin ɗa na ri nden a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />I tsupa yi ikebe ya̱ yi kafu urana u riya̱, adama a na u ta̱ nu ulambu waru u ta zuwusaa yi ucira. Adama ta̱wa̱ u showen A̱sulazuva a aci a̱ wu, reve wo o'wo wu unusu wan.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />&lt;&lt;She o una nan dada adama o unusu u muwun n le wan, ko o una muwun adama o unusu u nan dada le wan. Za suru ta̱ kuwa̱ adama o unusu wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />&lt;&lt;She i putsa mocin ko makpa'an nu uge'etosu u mejege wan, ko i tara aapalutsu a̱ ma̱runa̱ o una̱ wi ili i na yoo tono yi wan. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />I cuwan agbashi a ɗa i shi a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, reve A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a tsupaa ɗu diga ɗe. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai maa dansa ɗu i yuwan ili i nda.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na vu ri o ugasa wu uɗuma̱ wa̱ wu a̱vu vi icina aakatalu, she vu ka̱mba̱ vu tanu yi wan. Lyawa yi pe adama o omocin na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱, adama A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwaa wu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ o ulinga wu ukere wa̱ wu biti. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />A mantsa ma na vu za̱ka̱tsa̱i ɗanga zetun va̱ wu, she vu ka̱mbisa̱ e ete'en ute'esan wan. Vu lyawa ili i na i buwai adama o omocin na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />A mantsa ma na vu ri o uta'an wa̱ ina̱bi a̱tsuma̱ o uɗuma̱ wa̱ ina̱bi wa̱ wu, she vu ka̱mbisa̱ u'yanlu a ataci'i wan. Vu lyawa ili i na i buwai adama o omocin na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Cuwain a na agbashi a ɗa i shi e iɗa ya Masar. Adama o ndolo ɗa n damma nɗu i yuwan ili i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ama e re a yuwain mawasan, a ta tara adanshi'i a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o ukobu wu uge'etosu, reve a̱za̱ o uge'etosu e ge'eto adanshi'i, a ca za na ri mejege mejege, za vu unusu waru a ca yi unusu. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Na̱ wu ntsaa ta̱ a faba za vu unusu, za vu uge'etosu ta zuwa yi u von, reve u zuwa a faba yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi a̱bunda̱ a wufabu u na unusu wa̱ yi wu ntsayi. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />A ta faba yi amunga agba she u la'a ne wan. Na a faba yi a na u la'ai amunga, za va̱ wu to o'wo ili yi izo'oshi e esu a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />&lt;&lt;She vu ɓa̱ru nan vi iluma una̱ a mantsa ma na waa dasasa ishina a faba wan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:9">1 Kor 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosotso ma ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun n ri nden oɓolo reve za ta̱ kuwa̱ babu mawun, she ma̱runa̱ ma̱ yi mo olo a alanga wan. Mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma vali va̱ yi mo sotso yi adama u yuwaan yi ili i na yi ntsayi mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma vali'i ma yuwan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23-24">Mat 22:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-19">Mak 12:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-28">Luk 20:27-28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Mawun mo ulobo mo ufaru ma na waa matsan a ta ca yi ala a za na kuwa̱i'i, adama e icina na ala a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila wan.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />&lt;&lt;Amma na̱ vuma ciga u sotso ka mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi shi, ka'a u ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu mbara o una̱ntsu u lyuci reve u damma, &lt;Mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma vali va̱ ma 'yuwan ta̱ a lyuwato ala a mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi elime a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. U 'yuwan ta̱ a yuwan ili i na yi ntsayi mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma vali ma yuwan a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u va̱.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />A̱vu mbara n lyuci'i e ɗe yi a yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱yi. Agba nu usu shi a̱vu u damma, &lt;N ciga n sotso yi shi.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />Reve ma̱runa̱ ma mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi'i u 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma mbara'a, a̱vu u foɗo yi atan a̱ ta̱, a̱vu tsuwa̱a̱n yi ma̱tsa̱n o urewesu, a̱vu u damma, &lt;Ne ɗa a tsu yuwan na̱ vali na 'yuwain a lyuwato u'wa u mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi elime.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />A̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila e te reve nu u'wa u vuma'a a na, &lt;U'wa wu Za na o foɗoi Atan.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />&lt;&lt;Nna ama e re a̱ ri a̱ nla̱ngi, reve ka vu za ta̱ ta̱wa̱ adama a na waa kamba vali va̱ yi e ekere a za na a lapusa yi, a̱vu u canana ukere wa̱ yi a̱vu u reme yi tsali tsa̱ yi, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />i koɗo yi ukere'e. She ye ene iliyali ya̱ yi wan.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />&lt;&lt;She vu da̱na̱ na̱ nkundatsu mi ili yu ume n re koko'o a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsa̱n va̱ wu wan, za gbain na̱ za ke'en wan. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />She vu da̱na̱ na̱ nkundatsu n re koko'o a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ wu za gbain na̱ za ke'en wan. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Vu da̱na̱ na̱ nkundatsu mi ili yu mu ume na̱ nkundatsu n na mu ntsayi n sa'ani, adama wuma wa̱ wu u jima a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu aa casu ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu e te inda idaba yi za na aa yuwusan ili i nda, za na suru aa yuwusan ili i na i ri mejege shi.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />&lt;&lt;Cuwain ni ili i na aza a Amaleka a yuwain na̱ a̱ɗu o ure mantsa ma na yu uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ Masar. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Mantsa ma na i kuna̱i a̱vu i ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱, reve a vawan ɗu o ure a̱vu una aza a na suru a̱ kuna̱i a̱ ri a̱ca̱pa̱. Agba a uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />A mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu wivuwun e ekere a n'yuwatan n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱ɗu suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na waa casu ɗu wo o'wo za ɗu, i tasa ala a aza a Amaleka a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. She yi icina wan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Umatsun wu ufaru na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i uwai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu ya agadu, a̱vu i tara yi wo o'wo za ɗu, a̱vu i da̱nu pe, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />i tara umatsun wu ufaru wi ili i na i cimbai e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu suru i zuwa le a aasaka. Reve i 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa ɗangula adama Ala a̱ yi a̱a̱ da̱na̱. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />A̱vu i damma ganu na ri o ulinga a mantsa'a, &lt;N damma ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu ana'an a na n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a kucinayi nkaya n tsu na waa ca tsu.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />A̱vu ganu ushi aasaka'a e ekere a̱ ɗu reve u zuwa yi e iɗa elime a masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />A̱vu i damma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, &lt;Dada va̱ za va Aram va agara a ɗa a̱ shi, reve u cipa̱ a̱ tyo Masar na ama wa'a reve u da̱nu ɗe, a̱vu wo o'wo iɗa i gbain yu ucira na̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Amma a̱vu ama a Masar o ɓongi tsu a̱vu a ca tsu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a zuwa tsu ulinga wu usa̱n. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />A̱vu tsu showen A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya n tsu, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a uwwa mesun ma̱ tsu a̱vu we ene a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ tsu, nu ulinga wu usa̱n u tsu ni iɓongi i na tsoo sowuso. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva o uta̱a̱ ntsu nu ukere wu ucira a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, ni ili i wovon yu ucira, ni iroci ni ili ya asalama. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱to tsu uba̱ta̱ u nda, a̱vu u ca tsu iɗa i nda, iɗa i na ye yeneshe maani ni ishiki. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Agba gogo tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ nu umatsun wu ufaru wi iɗa i na a̱vu A̱sulazuva vu ca ntsu.&gt; A̱vu i zuwa aasaka'a a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱vu i ka̱ɗa̱to a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />A̱vu a̱ɗu na̱ nan Levi no omocin a na a̱ ri nden oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama e ili i sa'ani i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu na̱ 'wa ɗu suru.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i kotoi wuta̱su wu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa a aa'wan a ta'atsu, aa'wan a̱ wuta̱su wu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa i ca nan Levi ele, no omocin na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱, adama a lyuwa a̱ lyuci ɗu a̱ cuwa̱n. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />A̱vu i damma A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, &lt;Mu uta̱a̱ ta̱ upasu wa akiza o u'wa u va̱ a̱vu n ca nan Levi a̱yi, no omocin na̱ mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱, cine vu zuwai suru. M ɓatsa ko za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na vu zuwai ko mi icina za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le shi. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />N lyuwa ko ili a̱tsuma̱ e ili ya akiza a mantsa ma na n da̱na̱i a̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu shi, ko mu uta̱a̱ ili diga a̱tsuma̱ e le a mantsa ma na n da̱na̱i idaba shi, ko n ca a̱kwa̱kwa̱ ili i ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le shi. N yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱. N yuwan ta̱ ili i na vu zuwa numu suru. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Ka̱lyuwa̱ diga zuva uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa akiza wa̱ wu, a̱ tyo e iɗa, a̱vu vu zuwaa ama a̱ wu Isra'ila aba'un, ni iɗa i na vu ca ntsu cine vu tarayi nkaya n tsu akucunu, iɗa i na yee yeneshe maani ni ishiki.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ kuru ili i na A̱sulazuva a zuwai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwa ɗu ta̱ ana'an i toni ili i na a zuwai na̱ wila̱ nda, i kuru le ulobonu no okolo a̱ ɗu suru na̱ wuma u ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />I damma ta̱ ana'an a na A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, waru i ta yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ e re va̱ yi, tsa̱ra̱ i guza̱ ili i na u zuwai ni ili i na u dammai na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi, waru i ta yuwaan yi tsutoni. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Waru A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ ana'an a na a̱ɗu ama a̱ yi a ɗa, ama a̱ la̱nga̱ a̱ yi cine u yuwaan nɗu nzuwulai, a̱ɗu waru i ta̱ kuru ili i na u dammai. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />A̱yi waru u ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ɗu yo o'wo ili yi ica aza a ala na̱ tsugbain, upasu na akapi a ama o uvaɗi a na u yuwain. I to o'wo ama a akiza a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu cine u yuwain nzuwulai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Masa'a a Masasan ma Eba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Musa na̱ mbara ma Isra'ila a damma ta̱ ama, &lt;&lt;Yuwain tsutoni ni ili i na n damma nɗu ana'an nda suru. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />A mantsa ma na i pasai Urudu a uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu, i shuwa̱ atali a gbagbain a̱vu i sura le nu uruku. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />A̱vu i ɗana ɗe idanshi i wila̱ i nda suru mantsa ma na i pasai a uwa a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu aa casu ɗu, iɗa i na yee yeneshe maani ni ishiki, cine A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwayin nkaya nɗu nzuwulai. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Reve mantsa ma na i pasai Urudu, i shuwa̱ atali a nda zuva Masasan ma Eba, cine n zuwa nɗu ana'an, a̱vu i sura le nu uruku. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />I suwaa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu masa'a ɗe, masa'a ma atali. Agba she i yuwan ulinga na atali a na e she'ein na̱ rumu wan. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />I suwaa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu masa'a na atali a na e she'ein shi, reve i yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗe. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />I casu kucci muwwulai ɗe, i tamasa le ni i yuwin ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />A̱vu i ɗana idanshi i wila̱ i nda o uta̱ gbaru a atali a na i shuwa̱i'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Una̱ zuva Masasan ma Eba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />A̱vu Musa na̱ nan ganu, aza a na ele ɗa nan Levi, a damma aza a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;Poloi atsuvu, a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila! Ana'an yo o'wo ta̱ ama a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Yuwain tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱vu i toni ili i na u zuwai ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru i na maa casu ɗu ana'an.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />O urana u ndolo u ɗa Musa dammai ama, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />A mantsa ma na i pasai Urudu, gundo nda e te isawan zuva Masasan ma Gerizim a zuwaa ama aba'un: ugundo wa Saminu na̱ za va Levi na Yahuza na̱ Isaka na̱ Isuhu na̱ Banyami. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Gundo nda waru ele ɗa ee isawan zuva Masasan ma Eba a yuwan una̱: Ugundo wa̱ Roben na̱ za va Gadu na̱ Asha na̱ Zebulun na̱ Dan na̱ Nafutali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Nan Levi a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u le a damma ama a Isra'ila suru nu uɗyo wu ucira:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru she'ein ko u zuɗa̱i a̱ma̱li ili yi idaba e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva ulinga wu za yirumishi, a̱vu u shuwa̱ yi usokowu. A̱vu ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru cayi dada va̱ yi ko mma va̱ yi tsugbain shi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru tawai urotsu wu utyo wi iɗa u moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru pusa̱yin irumba̱ ure. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru putsayi mocin ko makpa'an ko ma̱runa̱ uge'etosu wa amayun. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru voyin na̱ ka va dada va̱ yi, adama a na u lyungusa̱ ta̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a dada va̱ yi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru voyin na̱ cu'un vu nama suru. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru voyin na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi mo usheli, usheli wa dada va̱ yi ko usheli wa mma va̱ yi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru voyin na̱ a̱na̱wa̱ e le. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru unai moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi usokowu. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru ushiyi utowusu wu una̱ adama wu una vuma na ri nu unusu shi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="DEU 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme vuma na suru usuyi idanshi i wila̱ u nda na waa yuwan ulinga ne ele shi. Reve ama suru a̱ usu,&lt;Ami!&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>.</char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Aba'un adama o tsutoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:3-13">N.Gn 26:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">U.Wl 7:12-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Ni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu reve i kuru ili i na u zuwai a na maa casu ɗu ana'an suru ulobonu, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwa ɗu yoo o'wo elime a akapi a nɗa mu uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Aba'un a nda suru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ɗu a̱vu o toni ɗu nni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu: <verse eid="DEU 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />I to o'wo na aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci na aba'un waru a̱ a̱ɗuma̱. <verse eid="DEU 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Muwun ma̱ a̱tsuma̱ n ɗu n ta̱ da̱na̱ na aba'un, ne ɗa waru itana yu uɗuma̱ i ɗu nu umatsun wi iliyamunga i ɗu, mudindim mo oɓolo e inan i ɗu ni ikyon na̱ mgbele n ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />&lt;&lt;Apara a̱ ɗu na̱ meretsu n ɗu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ na aba'un.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />&lt;&lt;I ta̱ da̱na̱ na aba'un a mantsa ma na yaa uwa na̱ mantsa ma na yoo uta̱.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa i lyuwa n'yuwatan n ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu aza a na a̱a̱ riya̱a̱ ɗu nu uvon. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ɗu nu ure u ta̱, agba a ta suma na̱ re cindere.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ lyungu na aba'un a̱tsuma̱ o mpon n ɗu nu ulinga we ekere a̱ ɗu suru. A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na waa casu ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ zuwa ɗu yo o'wo ama a akiza a̱ yi, cine u yuwaan nɗu nzuwulai ma akucunu, ni i kuru ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwai, a̱vu i yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />A̱vu ama o uvaɗi suru e ene a na e te ɗesu ɗu na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a uwwa wovon u ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa ɗu i bala a̱bunda̱ lon, a̱tsuma̱ a limatan ɗu na̱ nu umatsun wi iliyamunga n ɗu na̱ a̱tsuma̱ e itana yu uɗuma̱ yi iɗa i ɗu, a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu a na waa ca ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ zuva, uba̱ta̱ wi izuwa wa̱ a̱bunda̱ ya̱ yi, u lyunguwa̱ ɗu ni iro'i a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a a̱tsuma̱ a mantsa a̱vu waru u zuwaa ulinga wu ukere u ɗu aba'un. I ta ca nɗa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ okopu agba a̱ɗu yoo kopo shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa ɗu yo o'wo aci agba a̱ca̱pa̱ shi. Ni i yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a zuwai a na maa casu ɗu ana'an reve i kuru le ulobonu, i ta̱ da̱na̱ zuva kuci, amma za̱la̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />She i ɓatsa usa'ani ko ugula̱ i lyawa ko za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na maa dansaa ɗu ana'an i toni musula̱ n ro a yuwusaan le a̱ga̱nda̱ wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o ulambu u tsutoni u wila̱</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 26:14-46">N.Gn 26:14-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />&lt;&lt;Amma, ni i 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu waru i toni ili i na u zuwai ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru ulobonu aza a na maa casu ɗu ana'an shi, una̱ u nda suru o to toni ɗu reve e reme ɗu:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci na̱ a̱ a̱ɗuma̱.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme apara a̱ ɗu na̱ meretsu n ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme muwun ma̱ a̱tsuma̱ n ɗu, ni itana yu uɗuma̱ i ɗu nu umatsun wi iliyamunga i ɗu, mudindim mo oɓolo e inan i ɗu ni ikyon na̱ mgbele n ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u te reme ɗu a mantsa ma na yaa uwwa, na̱ mantsa ma na yoo uta̱. <verse eid="DEU 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />A̱sulazuva a ta yuwaan ɗu una̱, reve u zuwa ɗu i ra̱pula̱, waru u ta ɓara ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i zuwai ekere a̱ ɗu suru, she no o kototo ɗu reve i la̱nga̱ babu usa̱n adama e iwuya i na i yuwain na i lyawa niyi. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ tsuwa̱n ɗu mɓa̱la̱ hali u kototo ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yaa zama i uwa wo o'wo ɗu agadu. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />A̱sulazuva a ta faba ɗu na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukelu nu uta̱nu na̱ mɓa̱la̱ ma atsutsa nu usuɗuwu u lipu wu usa̱n nu ulambu wi iro'i, na̱ ma̱lyo nu upa̱luwusa̱, za na ee reme ɗu she ni i koto. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Zuva ɗu u to o'wo tsa̱ rumushili iɗa za̱la̱ ɗu waru u to o'wo tsa̱ rumu. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱to iro'i yi iɗa i ɗu ma̱buta̱ na̱ yira, u ta̱ cipa̱ diga zuva hali she no o kototo ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa n'yuwatan n ɗu n lyuwa ɗu. I ta̱ riya̱a̱ le nu ure u ta̱, agba i ta sumaa le na̱ re cindere. I to o'wo ili i ma'yuwatan e ekere o tsugono tsu uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />A̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ ɗu o to o'wo ilyalya yi nnunu n tsu'yan ni inama yu uvaɗi suru, agba babu za na oo loso le. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />A̱sulazuva a ta lapa ɗu na amicin a Masar no oboto na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mi iciri ni ikavuru, aza a na ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ gbaga shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />A̱sulazuva a ta lapa ɗu nu ujaaru na̱ tsurumba̱ nu ura̱pulu wo okolo. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nu urana a aci i ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan mmalu tse irumba̱ a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu. Yaa lyuwa aci shi a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na suru yaa yuwan. Urana suru o to ɓongi ɗu, reve a yuwusaan ɗu a'usa, agba a̱a̱ tsura̱ za na aa wawa ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />&lt;&lt;I te geɓe usheli, agba vuma ro ta tara yi u von na̱ a̱yi. I ta suwa u'wa, agba ya̱a̱ da̱nu pe shi. I ta̱ cu'wa̱n uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi, agba yaa ta'an umatsun wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />A ta paɗa nan ɗu e esu a̱ ɗu, agba yaa tama ili a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi shi. A ta usa mololi ma̱ ɗu nu ucira agba a̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi shi. A ta tara kyon ɗu a ca n'yuwatan n ɗu, agba ko za a̱a̱ da̱na̱ lo na waa kamba ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />A ta ca nɗa n ro muwun mo olobo n ɗu ne esheli a̱ ɗu, reve esu a̱ ɗu a̱ kuna̱ a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ o ure u le usana suru, agba ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira u na yaa gura yuwan ili adama e le shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Ama a na i revei shi a ta lyuwa ili i na iɗa i ɗu i matsain na̱ melen ma̱ ɗu. Agba ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ ni ili i ro shi she iɓongi i iwuya a wuma u ɗu suru. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Ili i na esu a̱ ɗu ee ene a ta̱ zuwa ɗu i jaara. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />A̱sulazuva a ta faba a̱lu na ana a̱ ɗu na amicin a̱ mɓa̱la̱ a na ee ina shi, a bazasa diga a apata a ana a̱ ɗu a gawan zuva va aci a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva o to loso ɗu oɓolo na̱ mogono ma na i ɗangulayi aciya̱ɗu a̱ tyo e iɗa i na a̱ɗu na̱ nkaya n ɗu i revei shi. Ɗe ɗa yaa yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱, musula̱ mu ɗanga na̱ va atali. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />I to o'wo ili i ma'yuwatan ni ili yi izo'oshi, ni ili ya avandaru e ekere a nɗa n na A̱sulazuva oo loso ɗu a̱ tyo suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />&lt;&lt;I ta̱ cu'wa̱n icu'un ya̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu, agba wa'a ɗa yaa gasa, adama a na apapari a ta tama le. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />I ta̱ cu'wa̱n a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi, a̱vu i cimba le, agba yoo sowo masayan me le ko i ɓoloto umatsun u le shi, adama a na azun a ta tama le. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />I ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ ɗanga zetun uba̱ta̱ suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ɗu, agba a yuwan ulinga na̱ mani'in me le shi, adama a na limatan le ta̱ za̱ka̱tsa̱. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />I ta̱ tsura̱ muwun mo olobo ne esheli agba i ta lamba le, adama a na a̱ ta̱ pura̱ le a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Apapari a ta tama ɗanga ɗu suru ni itana yu uɗuma̱ i ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />&lt;&lt;Omocin a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a lyuwusa elime elime amma a̱ɗu gba i ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱sa̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ca̱pa̱. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />A ta ca ɗu okopu, a̱ɗu gba yoo kopoo le shi. O to o'wo aci, amma a̱ɗu i to o'wo a̱ca̱pa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />&lt;&lt;Una̱ u nda suru u te reme ɗu. A ta gbagba ɗu a̱vu a cina ɗu hali she no o kototo ɗu, adama a na i 'yuwain a yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, waru i toni ili i na u zuwai ni ili i na u damma nɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />O to o'wo iroci ni ili ya asalama e ekere a̱ ɗu na̱ limatan ɗu babu ukotu. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Adama a na i yuwayin A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere a mantsa mo ulyuwu we elime shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Adama o ndolo, a̱tsuma̱ a ambulu na akuli na ataɓu nu ulambu suru suru, i ta yuwaan n'yuwatan n na A̱sulazuva a̱a̱ lyunguwa̱ ɗu tsugbashi. U ta̱ kuru a̱a̱gba̱la̱ a̱ rumu a̱ yinlu i ɗu, hali she nu u kototo ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu ni iɗa diga alanga diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi tsa̱ a̱a̱kuru a̱ za̱luwusa̱ a̱ cipa̱ za na a yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱ɗu, iɗa i na yaa gura reve elentsu e le shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Iɗa i na ama a̱ yi a̱ ri usuɗuwu i na yee ene tsugbain tsa abara ko e ene iliyali i mawun shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />A ta tama umatsun wi iliyamunga i ɗu ni itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu, hali she na̱ o kototo ɗu. Aa lyawaa ɗu ishina shi, ko masayan ma sa'avu shi, ko mani'in ko ma̱dindim mo oɓolo mi inan i ɗu ko vi ikyon ko vu mgbele vo oɓolo a̱ ɗu shi, hali she no o kototo ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />&lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ iɗa suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ɗu hali she na̱ ɓaɓu vu uga'an vu ucira na yaa zuwusaa ucira a̱ riya̱. A̱ ta̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ iɗa i ɗu suru i na A̱sulazuva aa casu ɗu nu uvon.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />&lt;&lt;Adama a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na n'yuwatan n ɗu maa ca ɗu a mantsa ma na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i'i i ta tama muwun n ɗu n na i matsain, inama i muwun mo olobo n ɗu ne esheli a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ca nɗu. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Ko vuma va̱ a̱ɓula̱ na la'ai uvotowun wu ugbozu na ankuri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu wee ene iliyali yi za va̱ yi ko ka va̱ yi na u cigai ko muwun ma̱ yi n na n ri wuma shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Agba waa ca nanza a̱tsuma̱ e le nama muwun ma̱ yi na waa tamusa shi. Adama ana a̱yi ɗa ili i na wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱yi goon a mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na n'yuwatan n ɗu maa ca ɗu mantsa ma na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i ilyuci i ɗu nu uvon suru. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ka va̱ a̱ɓula̱ na la'ai uvotowun wu ugbozu na ankuri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu, za na aa zuwa anana a̱ yi e iɗa shi adama ankuri a̱ yi nu uvotowun wu ugbozu, u ta 'yuwan vali va̱ yi na u cigai na̱ mawun ma̱ yi mo ulobo nu usheli, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />nu umatsutsun na̱ muwun n na u matsain waru. Adama a na u ta ciga u tama le usokowu mantsa mo uka̱nda̱ruwu wu uvo'on na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na n'yuwatan n ɗu maa ca ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci'i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />&lt;&lt;Ni i yuwan tsutoni ni idanshi i wila̱ u nda suru ulobonu shi, aza a na a ɗanai a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada nda shi, adama yu uwwa wovon wa Ala a tsugbain o ndolo ili i wovon, ala a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu shi, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ lyunguwa̱ ɗu na̱ limatan ɗu mɓa̱la̱ n wovon, mu usuɗuwu na̱ meleshe ma babu ukotu na̱ banakun vu usuɗuwu na voo koto shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu na̱ mɓa̱la̱ m Masar suru aza a na yaa uwwusa wovon, a̱vu e reme ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu na̱ cu'un vu mɓa̱la̱ suru na̱ meleshe ma na a ɗanai a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a̱ wila̱ a nda shi, hali she no o kototo ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />A̱ɗu na i da̱na̱i a̱bunda̱ tse italyo'o ya zuva i to o'wo ke'en, adama a na i yuwain tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Cine A̱sulazuva a uwwai uyo'o u zuwa ɗu i lyuwa elime reve waru i yuwan a̱bunda̱, ne ɗa waru woo yo'ono yi u lungusa̱ ɗu a̱vu u kototo ɗu. A ta tawa ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na i cigai i uwa wo o'wo ɗu agadu.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva e bete'we ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa suru, diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi u nda a̱ tyo o ukosu u ndeɗe. Ɗe ɗa yaa yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱, musula̱ mu ɗanga na̱ va atali aza a na a̱ɗu ko nkaya n ɗu n revei shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />A̱tsuma̱ a nɗa n ndolo ya̱a̱ tsura̱ wivuwun shi, ko uba̱ta̱ u na anana a̱ ɗu aa dasa. Ɗe ɗa A̱sulazuva aa ca ɗu wuda'un wo okolo, yo o'wo na̱ a̱da̱mba̱lya̱ e esu nu ukuɗu wo okolo. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />I ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a addama kuci tapu na̱ wovon ayin nu usana, yee reve ko i ta rawa nfa'an shi. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Nu usana i ta damma, &lt;A̱ shi de a damma ulivu u ɗa!&gt; Nu ulivu waru a̱vu i damma,&lt;A̱ shi de a damma usana u ɗa!&gt; Adama o wovon u na woo shiton okolo a̱ ɗu ni ili i na esu a̱ ɗu ee eneshe. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ɗu Masar a̱tsuma̱ a antsun ko na n dammai ya̱a̱ da̱shi 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe shi. Ɗe ɗa yaa ciga i wina aciya̱ɗu e ekere a n'yuwatan n ɗu yo o'wo agbashi e le ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci, agba ko za aa tsula ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Uka̱mbisa̱ wa akucunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Ele nda ele ɗa idanshi ya akucunu a na A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa a na waa damma aza a Isra'ila a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa, babu na akucunu a na u yuwain ne ele a Masasan ma Horeb.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Musa ɗe ta̱ ama a Isra'ila suru a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Esu a̱ ɗu e ene ta̱ ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na̱ Firi'awuna a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, na azagbain a̱ yi suru ni iɗa ya̱ yi suru. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Ne esu a̱ ɗu a ɗa ye enei a̱tsuma̱lima̱ o ndolo, iroci yi ili ya asalama i ndolo ni ili ya asalama i gbagbain. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Amma hali a cina ana'an A̱sulazuva a ca ɗu okolo o urevu ko esu e yeni shi, ko atsuvu a na a tsu uwwa shi. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />A̱tsuma̱ a a'wan amunga a na n rono nɗu aɗanga o uta̱la̱i a̱tsumona, a̱tugu a̱ ɗu ko atan a ana a̱ ɗu a kutsa shi. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />I tama opopofu shi agba i sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi shi ko ili i na i tsu tsura̱to shi. N yuwan ta̱ ili i nda adama i reve a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na i rawai uba̱ta̱ u nda, Sihon mogono ma Heshibon na̱ Og mogono ma Bashan o uta̱ ta̱ adama a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu, agba tsu lyuwa le ta̱. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />A̱vu tsu usa iɗa i le a̱vu tsu ca a̱za̱ o ugundo wa̱ Roben na aza a Gadu nu uɓatsulai wu ugundo wa Manase a̱yi wo o'wo agadu e le.<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />&lt;&lt;I toni idanshi ya akucunu a nda ulobonu adama i lyuwa elime a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na yaa yuwan suru. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Suru nɗu i ta̱ mishin ana'an a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu, na azagbain o gundo ɗu na̱ mbara n ɗu na azagbain a̱ a̱soja a̱ ɗu, na ali a Isra'ila, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />oɓolo na̱ muwun n ɗu na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ ɗu, no omocin a na a̱ ri na̱ nden o uva̱la̱ta̱ u ɗu aza a na aa yuwusaan ɗu a̱ɗiva̱ na̱ melepe ma̱ mini. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />I ta̱ pa ana'an adama i uwa a̱tsuma̱ a akucunu na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, akucunu a na A̱sulazuva aa yuwusan na̱ a̱ɗu ana'an a̱vu u sura yi na̱ nzuwulai, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />adama u ushi ɗu ana'an yo o'wo ama a̱ yi, a̱yi waru wo o'wo A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu cine u yuwaan nɗu nzuwulai na̱ cine u yuwayin nkaya n ɗu Ibrahim ni Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu akucunu. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Maa yuwusan akucunu a nda na̱ nzuwulai ma̱ yi na̱ a̱ɗu goon shi, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />agba na̱ a̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri mishin oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu ana'an a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, waru oɓolo na aza a na a̱ ri pa ana'an shi.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu na aciya̱ɗu i reve ta̱ cine tsu da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Masar na̱ cine tsu utula̱i a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱ pa. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Ye ene ta̱ ruma vi idaba na̱ musula̱ mu ɗanga na̱ va atali, na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya na a̱ ri ne ele. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />She a̱ tsura̱ vali ko ka umatsun ko ugundo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu ana'an za na okolo a̱ yi a vadalai u lyawai A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu adama u 'ya̱wa̱ u yuwaan musula̱ mu nɗa ndolo a̱ga̱nda̱ wan. She a̱ tsura̱ nanza a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu za na oo o'wo tsa aralu a na a̱ ri na̱ tsukono tso okono wan.<verse eid="DEU 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na cu'un vuma ndolo uwwai idanshi ya akucunu a nda, a̱vu u zuwaa aciya̱yi aba'un a̱vu u yuwan majiyan,&lt;Babu ili i na ya cina mu, ko na̱ n zuwa okolo a̱ va̱ n kuru ure u va̱.&gt; A̱yi nda u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ meleshe e ekere a̱ a̱ɓula̱ ne ekere a̱za̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />A̱sulazuva aa yuwaan yi gafura shi, upan wa̱ yi na̱ tsushu'un tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ta̱ puna̱ a aci a vuma ndolo. Una̱ u na a ɗanai a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda suru a̱ ta̱ cipa̱ a aci a̱ yi, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a tawa ala a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />A̱sulazuva a ta tawa vuma ndolo a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila adama o uge'etosu, cine una̱ u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a akucunu a Aatagada a̱ Wila̱.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />&lt;&lt;Muwun n ɗu n na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ ɗu a mantsa ma na ma̱ ta̱wa̱ no omocin a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i diga e iɗa ya alanga, e te ene mɓa̱la̱ n na ma̱a̱ cipa̱a̱ iɗa'a na̱ yibanakishin i na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n niyi. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Iɗa'a suru u to o'wo a̱kuli a akpaɗi na̱ farinwuta, ko ili a̱a̱ cu'wa̱n shi ko ili yoo uta̱ shi, babu anlya a na oo uta̱. U to o'wo tsu ukototosu wo Sodom na̱ Gomora, na̱ Aduma na̱ Zibiyon aza a na A̱sulazuva o kototoi a̱tsuma̱ o upan wu usuɗuwu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Nɗa suru n te ece, &lt;Adama a̱ nye A̱sulazuva a yuwain cu'un vi ili nda ni iɗa nda? Nye i ɗa i ta̱wa̱i nu upan wu usuɗuwu u nda?&gt;<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />&lt;&lt;Waru u'ususu u ta̱ da̱na̱, &lt;Adama a na ama a nda a variyi akucunu a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa A̱sula̱ a nkaya n le, akucunu a na u yuwain na̱ nkaya n le a mantsa na wu uta̱ nle a̱tsuma̱ a Masar. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwusaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱, reve a̱ ka̱ɗa̱ta̱wa̱ le, musula̱ n na e revei shi, musula̱ n na A̱sulazuva a ca nle shi. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain upan ni iɗa i nda, ɗaɗa u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi na̱ cu'un vu una̱ na ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda suru. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />A̱tsuma̱ o upan wu usuɗuwu wa̱ a̱bunda̱ A̱sulazuva a tawa nle diga e iɗa i le a̱vu u bete'we le a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i ro cine u ri gogo.&gt;<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />&lt;&lt;Ili yu usokowu za va̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ɗa, amma ili i na i ri a alanga eteshe za tsu ɗa na̱ muwun n tsu babu ukotu, adama tsu kuruyi idanshi i wila̱ u nda suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Ɗewu a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />&lt;&lt;Yashi i na ili i nda suru i cina nɗu na n zuwai elime a̱ ɗu aba'un nu una̱, ni i zuwa le o okolo a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na i ri suru a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa n na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu e bete'we nɗu a̱ tyo, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱vu i yuwan tsutoni na̱ a̱yi no okolo a̱ ta̱ na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru cine n damma nɗu ana'an, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ ɗu aba'un a̱ ɗu, a̱vu we ene iliyali i ɗu. Reve u ɓolotowiso ɗu diga a nɗa n na u shi u bete'we nɗu a̱ tyo. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Ko na̱ a̱ shi e bete'we ɗu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi o ukosu wu uvaɗi, diga ɗe A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to ɓoloto ɗu a̱vu u ka̱mba̱to ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />U ta̱ ka̱mba̱to ɗu e iɗa yi nkaya n ɗu, u to o'wo ɗu agadu. U ta zuwa ɗu i yuwan aba'un waru i bala a̱bunda̱ i la'a nkaya n ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwa okolo a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ muwun n ɗu a̱ ka̱mba̱ pete, tsa̱ra̱ i ciga yi no okolo a̱ ɗu suru na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru, a̱vu i da̱na̱ wuma. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta yuwaan n'yuwatan n ɗu aza a na a 'yuwan nɗu waru a ca nɗu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ una̱ u nda suru. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Waru i ta yuwaan A̱sulazuva tsutoni a̱vu i toni ili i na u dammai suru i na maa casu ɗu ana'an. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwa ɗu i yuwan aba'un a̱bunda̱ lon a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na yaa yuwan suru. I ta̱ tsura̱ muwun ma̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, mudindim, ni itana yu uɗuma̱. A̱sulazuva a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ u ca ɗu utsuru cine wu uwwai uyo'o wu nkaya n ɗu, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />ni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱vu i toni wila̱ wa̱ yi i yuwan ili i na u dammai i na i ri uɗanu a Aatagada a̱ Wila̱, a̱vu i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu no okolo a̱ ɗu suru na asuvu a̱ ɗu suru.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aɗangulu a wuma ko ukwa̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />&lt;&lt;Ili i na maa zuwusa ɗu ana'an u la'a ucira u ɗu shi, ko na ya̱a̱ kuɗa̱ a yuwan tsutoni na̱ a̱yi shi. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Wila̱'a̱ zuva ɗa a̱ ri shi, adama o ndolo yaa damma, &lt;Zane ɗa aa kumba zuva u ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu ne ele, adama tsu uwwa reve tsu yuwan tsutoni ne ele?&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6">Rom 10:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Waru a̱ ri upasalai u mala shi, na yee ece, &lt;Zane ɗa aa pasa mala'a u ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu ne ele adama tsu uwwa reve tsu yuwan tsutoni ne ele?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />I reve wila̱'a̱ a̱ ta̱ lo zuzu na̱ a̱ɗu, u ta̱ o una̱ u ɗu waru no o okolo a̱ ɗu adama i yuwan tsutoni ne ele.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:8">Rom 10:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda ana'an n zuwa ta̱ wuma nu ulyuwu we elime a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu, ukwa̱ nu ukototosu. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ana'an n ta dansaa ɗu i ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, waru i wala e re va̱ yi, reve i kuru ili i na u zuwai ni ili i na a̱a̱ kuru na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi. Ɗaɗa yaa da̱na̱ wuma reve i bala, waru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta zuwaa ɗu aba'un a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na yaa zama i uwa wo o'wo ɗu agadu.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />&lt;&lt;Agba nno okolo a̱ ɗu a vadala, a̱vu i 'yuwan a yuwaan yi tsutoni, waru nna a vadala ɗu i kingyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ musula̱ n ro waru i yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />n dansaa ɗu ana'an, o to kototo ɗu suru. Waru yaa yuwan wuma wa̱ a̱bunda̱ e iɗa i na yaa zama i pasa Urudu i na woo o'wo za ɗu shi.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />&lt;&lt;Ana'an n ɗe ta̱ zuva ni iɗa yo o'wo esu a aci a̱ ɗu, a na n zuwa ta̱ wuma nu ukwa̱ elime a̱ ɗu, nu una̱ na aba'un. Gogo i ɗangwa wuma adama a̱ɗu na̱ muwun n ɗu i da̱na̱ wuma. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />I ciga A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, yu uwwa uɗyo wa̱ yi, reve i guza̱ yi ugbamu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa wuma u ɗu, waru u ta lyawa ɗu i yuwan wuma lon e iɗa i na u kucinayi nkaya n ɗu Ibrahim na̱ Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu nzuwulai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Josuwa ushiya̱ ta̱ Musa tsugbain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Mkc 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />A̱vu Musa uta̱ u yuwaan aza a Isra'ila adanshi e ili i ndolo suru, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu gogo n ta̱ na a'wan ukpaku nu ushin (120), agba maa gura ɓa̱na̱ ɗu waru shi. A̱sulazuva a damma mu ta̱, &lt;Vaa pasa Urudu shi.&gt; <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />Agba A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ta fara pasaa ɗu na aciya̱yi. U to kototo nɗa n na n ri elime a̱ ɗu, reve a̱ɗu yoo o'wo ni iɗa i le. Josuwa waru u ta uwaa ɗu elime u fara pasaa ɗu cine A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />A̱sulazuva a ta yuwan ne ele cine u yuwain na̱ Sihon na̱ Og, ngono ma aza a Amoriya, aza na u kototoi oɓolo ni iɗa i le. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />A̱sulazuva a ta ca ɗu ele e ekere a̱ ɗu, i reve gba i yuwan ta̱ ne ele ili i na n zuwa nɗu i yuwan ne ele. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />I kapanu yi isawan nu ucira, she yi uwwa wovon ko yi da'wan adama e le wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu o to oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu. Waa lyawa ɗu shi, waru waa vari ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Reve Musa ɗe Josuwa reve u damma yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma ama a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;Vu kapanu vi isawan nu ucira, adama a na a̱vu ɗa vaa tara ama a nda a̱ tyo e iɗa i na A̱sulazuva a kucinai a na waa ca nkaya n le. A̱vu vu ne'esheen le iɗa'a adama wo o'wo agadu e le. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />A̱sulazuva na aciya̱yi u ta uwa elime a̱ wu, waru u ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu. Waa lyawa wu shi, waru waa vari wu shi. She vu uwwa wovon wan, waru she okolo a kuɗa wu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">E ɗe wila̱'a̱ nu una̱ a a'wan e cindere biti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 27:12-23">Mkc 27:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Reve Musa ɗana wila̱ u nda a̱vu u ca nan ganu olobo a̱ Levi aza a na a tsu tanu Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo na̱ mbara ma aza a Isra'ila biti. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Reve Musa damma le, &lt;&lt;O ukosu wa a'wan e cindere suru, a mantsa ma na za uwai adama a̱ mona mo utan, a mantsa ma̱ A̱buki o Ogodo o Ucuwusan, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila suru o tsu ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ u na waa ɗangwa, a̱vu e ɗenuna̱ wila̱ u nda a atsuvu e le. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />I ɓoloto ama'a, ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun hali no omocin a na a̱ ri nden e ilyuci i ɗu, adama a uwwa reve o rito cine a uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, a̱vu a̱ kuru idanshi i wila̱ i nda suru ulobonu. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Reve muwun n le n na koto n revei wila̱ u nda shi a uwwa yi reve o rito cine aa uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu mantsa ma n i ri nden e iɗa i na yaa pasa mavada ma̱ Urudu wo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">A damma ta̱ aciyogbamu a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Uwwa nda, mantsa mo ukwisa̱ ma̱ wu ma yuwan ta̱ zuzu. Vu ɗe Josuwa reve i ta̱wa̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, uba̱ta̱ u na maa ca yi ucira u tsugbain.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Musa na̱ Josuwa a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i na aciyele o Oogodo o Uga'asusan.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo e eleshe. Reve eleshe'e e isawan o una̱ntsu wo Oogodoꞌo. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Musa, &lt;&lt;Uwwa nda, vu ta̱ kuwa̱ vu cina nkaya ma̱ wu, waru a jima shi ama a nda a̱ ta̱ 'yon a yuwan tsushakala na̱ musula̱ mo omocin mi iɗa i na aa uwa. Reve a lyawa mu a kuɗa akucunu a na n yuwain ne ele. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Reve upan u va̱ u suɗuwa a aci e le o urana u ndolo. Reve n lyawa le, a̱vu n sokoo le urewesu u va̱, reve o kototo le. Meleshe ma̱ a̱bunda̱ na addama a̱ ta̱ reme le. O urana u ndolo e te ece, &lt;Meleshe ma nda ma̱ cipa̱a̱ tsu ta̱ o una̱ u na A̱sulazuva a̱ ri e memere ma̱ tsu shi?&gt; <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />O urana u ndolo na amayun n to soko urewesu u va̱ adama e iwuya i na a yuwain suru, a na a vadalai a̱ kuruyi musula̱ n ro.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />&lt;&lt;Gogo nda vu ɗana ishipa i nda adama a̱ ɗu, a̱vu vu rito aza a Isra'ila a̱yi. Vu zuwa le a cana yi adama wo o'wo mu urotsu e ekere a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Adama a na na̱ n ta̱wa̱ ne ele e iɗa i na yee yenishe maani ni ishiki, za na n yuwain nzuwulai n na maa ca nkaya n le, reve na a lyuwa a̱ cuwa̱n a yuwan mgbain, a ta vadala a̱ tyo a̱ musula̱ n ro a̱vu a yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱, a 'yuwan mu. A̱vu a kuɗa akucunu a̱ va̱. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Reve a mantsa ma na meleshe ma̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a cina nle, ishipa i nda i ta yuwan adanshi a aci e le, adama a na limatan le ve icina na̱ a̱yi shi. N reve ta̱ ifoɓi yi ili i na aa gura yuwan, ko kafu n ta̱wa̱ ne ele e iɗa i na n yuwaan nle zuwulai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ɗaɗa Musa ɗanai ishipa'a o urana u ndolo reve u roco aza a Isra'ila a̱yi.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, &lt;&lt;Vu kapanu vi isawan nu ucira, adama a na vu ta̱ tara aza a Isra'ila a uwa e iɗa i na n yuwain nzuwulai n na maa ca le. Waru a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Ana Musa ɗanai idanshi i wila̱ i nda aa aatagada kpa̱ra̱, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />reve u ca nan Levi aza a na a tsu tanu Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva wila̱ u nda, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />&lt;&lt;I tara Aatagada a̱ Wila̱ a nda reve i zuwa yi e eɓele a Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, tsura̱ wo o'wo lo tsu urotsu a aci a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Adama a na n reve ta̱ cine i ri nu u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci na aciyogbamu. Uwwai nda, ko gogo a na m buwai wuma oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu i ta̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n A̱sulazuva aci. Cine woo o'wo na̱ n kuwa̱! <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Ɓolotowo numu mbara mu gundo ɗu suru na azagbain a̱ ɗu suru, tsura̱ n yuwan adanshi a nda a atsuvu e le. Reve n ɗe zuva ni iɗa yo o'wo urotsu a aci e le. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Adama a na n reve ta̱ na̱ n kuwa̱, ili i ro yi lo shi i ta yuwan ili yi idaba, a̱vu i ɓatsa i lyawa ure u na n zuwa nɗu. A̱vu a rana ve elime meleshe ma cina ɗu, adama a na i ta yuwan ili i vama e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve i zuwa yi u yuwan upan adama o ulinga we ekere a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishipa ya Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Reve Musa ɗe idanshi yi ishipa i nda diga o ufaru a̱ tyo o ukosu a atsuvu e iɓolo ya aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />&lt;&lt;Poloi atsuvu a̱ɗu zuva, n ta yuwan adanshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">A̱vu iɗa vu uwwa adanshi o una̱ a̱ va̱.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Lyawa uritosu u va̱ wu ɗa̱wa̱ tsi iro'i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">adanshi a̱ va̱ a̱ cipa̱ tsa a'iza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">tsa̱ yiji'in a anlya a sa'avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">waru tsi iro'i a̱ a̱vu'un a sa'avu.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Adama a na n te ɗe ala a̱ A̱sulazuva.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">Cuwai tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />A̱yi Aatali a ɗa. Ulinga wa̱ yi u shiwan ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">adama a na re va̱ yi suru amayun a ɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">A̱sula̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ za na tsu nusan shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">a̱yi za va amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱ a ɗa.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />&lt;&lt;A yuwan ta̱ ili yi idaba a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">a̱za̱ o unusu a ɗa a buwa muwun ma̱ yi shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">amma ama e iwuya a na a lyawai ure.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Ne ɗa yaa tsupa A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">a̱ɗu a̱za̱ o ulambu wu urevu a na a̱ ri nu ugbozu shi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">A̱yi dada ɗu ɗa shi, za na ruma nɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">za na yuwan nɗu a̱vu u shuwa̱ ɗu shi?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />&lt;&lt;I cuwan na̱ rana va̱ a̱ca̱pa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">i yuwan majiyan mantsa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ ma na ma̱ ka̱ra̱i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Ecei dada ɗu, u ta damma ɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">Ecei mbara n ɗu a ta damma ɗu.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Ana Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma cayi nɗa agadu e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">a mantsa ma na u ne'eshen ama suru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">a̱vu u zuwaa gundo a̱tyoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ wa aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Adama a na akunda a̱ A̱sulazuva ele ɗa ama a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakubu akunda a agadu a̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />&lt;&lt;U tsura̱ yi ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">o ogozo a na vuma ri shi iɗa i na i kuwa̱i.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Reve u yuwaan yi a̱ra̱ga̱ u ka̱lyuwa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">u geshe yi tsa mawun ma̱ lyusu ma̱ yi,<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />tsa̱ a̱kuru a na a tsu zuwa yikinda ya̱ yi zuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">za na tsu 'yawan zuva muwun ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">za na tsu bece evelu a̱ yi a̱vu u keɗe le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">a̱vu u sheɗe le e evelu a̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />A̱sulazuva a ɗa goon o rono niyi aɗanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">ko mocin ma̱sula̱ ma̱ shi oɓolo na̱ a̱yi shi.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />&lt;&lt;Reve u zuwa yi u kumba a agaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">a̱vu u lyuwato yi ni itana yu uɗuma̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Reve u kungwato yi ni ishiki diga a aatali</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun diga a aatali o ugbamu,<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />na̱ maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱ na̱ maani me inan ni ikyon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">na abaji a mani'in me ikyon na̱ mukyokyon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">no ogono e inan na̱ nga̱ji diga Bashan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">oɓolo ni yitabo i na i la'ai ulobonu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Reve vu sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ma sa'ani ma̱ shili.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />&lt;&lt;Reve Jeshurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeshurun </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeshuran ala o ro a ɗa a Isra'ila</char></note> yuwan mgbain u ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱susa̱n aci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">u cuwa̱n, u yuwan ugba̱mu u yuwan shembu shembu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Reve u lyawa A̱sula̱ za na yuwan niyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">u cuwa na Aatali Za vi Iwawi ya̱ yi shi.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Reve a zuwa yi tsushu'un na̱ musula̱ n le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">reve a zuwa yi upan adama a̱ a̱ma̱li e idaba e le.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Reve a ca otoni a̱ lima̱ aza a na A̱sula̱ a ɗa shi kucci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">musula̱ n na e revei shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">na̱ musula̱ n sa'avu n na a̱ ta̱wa̱ yi na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">aza a na nkaya n ɗu mu uwwai wovon u le shi.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />A vari Aatali a na a matsan nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">e icina na̱ A̱sula̱ a na a ca nle wuma.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva e ene ta̱ ili i nda reve u 'yuwan le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">adama a na olobo a̱ yi ne esheli a̱ yi a zuwa yi ta̱ u yuwan upan.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Reve u damma, &lt;N to sokoo le urewesu u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">a̱vu me ene cine ukosu u le woo o'wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">adama a na ele mantsa ma vama ma ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">muwun mu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />A zuwa mu ta̱ tsushu'un na̱ musula̱ me epen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">A̱vu a zuwa mu upan na̱ a̱ma̱li e pere e le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Adama o ndolo n ta zuwa le tsushu'un tsa aza a na ama a ɗa shi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">N ta zuwa le upan ni iɗa i na i ri nu ugbozu shi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom 10:19</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Adama a na upan u va̱ u ta madala tsa akina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">u ta̱ ma̱kula̱ a̱ cipa̱ hali a̱ tyo a̱ a̱ru'un o ukwisa̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">U ta lyuwusa uvaɗi nu utsuru wa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">reve u lyuwa hali a̱ tyo a̱ nkyun mu nsasan.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />&lt;&lt; &lt;N to ɓolotowo le mɓa̱la̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">reve n kotoo le aya a̱ va̱.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Ambulu a̱ ta̱ lungusa̱ le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">ubanakun na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu usuɗuwu n to soɗu le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">N ta̱ lyunguwa̱ le na anga e inama yu una</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">na̱ tsukono tsi ili yi ika̱ta̱pu yu una le.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Aza a na a̱ ri a alanga matsun me pe'eni ma̱ to una le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">a 'wa le wovon u te reme le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Olobo ne esheli a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">na̱ muwun n na maa apusa maani no ozo o yono fo.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />N damma ta̱, n te bete'we le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">n zuwa e icina ne ele a̱tsuma̱ a ama.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Amma n ta sumusa izami yi nla̱ngi yi n'yuwatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">ta̱wa̱ nda a yuwan majiyan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Nu ukere u tsu u ɗa tsu lyuwai aci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwain ili i nda suru shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />&lt;&lt;Isra'ila iɗa i ɗa i babu ugbozu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">urevu wu pe a̱tsuma̱ e le shi.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Nna̱ a̱ shi nu ugbozu, a̱ shi te e reve ili nda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">a̱vu e reve cine ukosu u le woo o'wo!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Cine tsa ɗa vuma ta̱ a̱a̱ gba̱ra̱ ama ukpakukupa (1,000),</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">ko ama e re a zuwa ama ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) a suma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">she na Aatali e le a wina le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">ko na̱ A̱sulazuva a wina le?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Adama a na aatali e le a̱ ri tsa Aatali a̱ tsu shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">ko n'yuwatan n tsu n reve ta̱ ne ɗa.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Ataci a̱ ina̱bi e le o uta̱ ta̱ diga a ataci a̱ ina̱bi o Sodom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a Gomora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Muwun n ina̱bi n le n ta̱ tapu na̱ tsukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">waru okono.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Masayan me le tsukono tso yo tsa ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">tsukono tsa wuya vu ruku.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />&lt;&lt; &lt;N soko ili i nda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">a̱vu m ɓa̱ru le o uzuwata u va̱ shi?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Atsupu za va̱ ɗa, waru n ta tsupa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Mantsa ma̱ ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ ana ana e le ee derece,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ me le ma yuwan ta̱ zuzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">meleshe me le ma̱ zura̱ ta̱ a rawa le.&gt;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12:19</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa ama a̱ yi o'wo fa̱a̱n,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">a̱vu we ene iliyali ya agbashi a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">na̱ we ene ucira u le u koto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">waru ko vuma ta̱ pasa shi ko aagbashi ko umatsun wu u'wa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:30">M.Ib 10:30</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Reve u damma, &lt;Te ɗa gba musula̱ n le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">aatali a na a tarai upa'atan,<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />musula̱ n na n tamai mani'in ma̱ kucci le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">reve o sowo masayan ma̱ kucci vi ili yo oso i le?&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Lyawa le a̱ 'yon a kamba ɗu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Lyawa le a ca ɗu upa'atan!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i nda gogo a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ a̱mu ɗa a̱yi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">A̱sula̱ o ro o lo shi she a̱mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">N tsu una ta̱ waru n tsu ka̱mba̱to ta̱ wuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">n tsa amaton ta̱ reve waru n ka̱mbuwa̱ gbaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ko za aa gura papa za ro o ukere u va̱ shi.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />N 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ukere u va̱ zuva reve n damma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">nna̱ n ri wuma babu ukotu,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />nna̱ n tewen matsun me pe'eni ma madala ma̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">a̱vu n guza̱ yi o ukere u va̱ adama o uge'etosu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">n ta tsupa n'yuwatan n va̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">A̱vu waru n tsupa aza a na a 'yuwan numu.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />N ta zuwa aya a̱ va̱ o o'wo usowu na̱ mpasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">waru matsun me pe'eni ma̱ va̱ ma ta tama inama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">na̱ mpasa ma aza a na a paɗai na aza a na e remei uba̱ta̱ wu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">na aci a azagbain a n'yuwatan.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Yuwain ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ɗu nɗa oɓolo na ama a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">adama a na u ta tsupaa mpasa ma agbashi a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">U ta tsupa n'yuwatan ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">reve u lapula iɗa ya ama a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Reve Musa ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun, reve u damma idanshi yi ishipa i nda suru a atsuva a ama. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Ana Musa kotoi a dansaa aza a Isra'ila idanshi i nda suru, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;I guza̱ idanshi i na maa ɓarasa ɗu ana'an o okolo, tsura̱ i zuwa muwun n ɗu n kuru idanshi i wila̱ u nda suru mejege. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Adanshi e pere a ɗa a̱ ri a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ ɗu shi, amma wuma u ɗu u ɗa. Waru idanshi i nda a ta zuwa ɗu i yuwan wuma a̱bunda̱ e iɗa i na yaa pasa Urudu wo o'wo za ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ta̱ kuwa̱ a Masasan ma Nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />O urana u ndolo gan A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ Musa, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />&lt;&lt;Kumba a gawan upasu wa Abarim a̱ tyo a Masasan ma Nebo a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko, vu ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa ya Ka'ana, iɗa i na maa ca aza a Isra'ila wo o'wo za le. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Ɗe a masasan ma na vaa kumba ɗe ɗa va̱a̱ kuwa̱ a̱vu vu cina nkaya ma̱ wu, cine Haruna mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ wu ma̱ kuwa̱i a masasan ma Hor reve u cina nkaya ma̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Adama a na a̱ɗu ra i yuwaan mu ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila uba̱ta̱ u mini wa Meriba a Kadesh a̱ A̱tsumona a Zin, waru adama a na i kuɗa̱i o roco akiza a̱ va̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Adama o ndolo, vu te ene iɗa'a diga alanga, agba vaa uwa pe e iɗa i na maa ca aza a Isra'ila'a shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Musa zuwaa ta̱ gundo va Isra'ila aba'un</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa aba'un a na Musa vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ zuwayi aza a Isra'ila kafu ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />U damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ diga Sinai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">reve u roco le aciya̱yi a Seyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Reve wi ikana diga a Masasan ma Faran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">A̱vu u ta̱wa̱ oɓolo nu ukpakukupa kupa wa aza a akiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ne elentsu a akina a madala o ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Amayun u ciga ta̱ ama a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">aza a akiza suru a̱ ta̱ o ukere wa̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Elime a ana a̱ wu a ɗa a̱a̱ kingyosu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">waru diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu u ɗa a̱ ushishi ili i na aa yuwan.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Wila̱ u na Musa ca ntsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">ili ya agadu o oɓolo a ama a Yakubu.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />A̱sulazuva o'wo ta̱ mogono ma Jeshurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeshurun ala o ro a ɗa a Isra'ila</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">a mantsa ma na azagbain a ama o ɓolotoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">oɓolo na̱ gundo va aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Reve Musa damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa Roben da̱na̱ wuma u kuwa̱ wan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">amma ama a̱ yi o o'wo wa'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Reve u damma ili i nda adama a Yahuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva vu uwwa mesun ma Yahuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Vu yuwan uvon nu ukere wa̱ wu adama e le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Vo o'wo ikambi ya̱ yi e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Adama a̱ Levi a̱vu u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">&lt;&lt;Tumim na̱ Urim va̱ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">aza a vuma na vu rocoi isa'ani i ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">za na vu lyungwa̱i a Masa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">za na vu yuwain mpolo na̱ a̱yi uba̱ta̱ u mini ma Meriba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Za na dammai dada na̱ mma va̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">&lt;N tara ɗu ili i ro shi.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Reve u wasan a̱za̱ a̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">na̱ muwun ma̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Amma u kuru ta̱ adanshi a̱ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">reve u guza̱ akucunu a̱ wu.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />O to roco Yakubu ure wa̱ wu, Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">waru wila̱ wa̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">A̱ ta̱ tsun ili i ma̱guru a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu suru a masa'a ma̱ wu.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />A̱sulazuva vu zuwaa ili i na u ri na̱ a̱yi aba'un,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">reve vu ushi ulinga we ekere a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Vu minjira ucira wa aza a na a̱ 'yoyin nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">na aza a na a 'yuwan niyi, hali aa gura 'yon waru shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Adama a Banyami a̱vu u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">&lt;&lt;Lyawa macigata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ da̱nu lafiya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">adama na u tu uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ yi urana ma̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">waru macigata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ da̱na̱ nden e memere ma̱ nlingu ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Adama a̱ Isuhu waru reve u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">&lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a zuwaa iɗa ya̱ yi aba'un</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">nu une'e u sa'ani diga zuva na a'iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">na̱ za mini ma̱ a̱ru'un ma na ma̱ ri za̱la̱,<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />ni ili i na i la'ai ulobonu i na urana u tsu ca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">ni ili i na i la'ai ulobonu i na woto u tsu ca,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />ni ili i na i la'ai ulobonu i na akuci a nsasan mu ufaru n tsu ca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">na aba'un a agaɗi a na a̱ ri nu ukotu shi,<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />ni ili i na i la'ai ulobonu yu uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱ ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ni isa'ani yi za na cipa̱i o molopu ma madala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Lyawa ele nda suru a̱ da̱nu a aaci a̱ Isuhu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">a̱ cin vu za na a tawai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ta̱ tsa limatan vu ufaru vo ogono a nan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">avana a̱ yi waru tsa avana a yacin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ne ele ɗa wa̱a̱ zuma̱ nɗa, suru nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">hali a̱ tyo ukosu wu uvaɗi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ne ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupa wa Ifiramu a̱ ri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Ne ɗa ama ukpakukupa kupa wa Manase a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Reve adama a Zebulun u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">&lt;&lt;Yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ Zebulun, a̱ mota̱a̱ ma̱ wu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ufaru 49:13</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Isaka waru o ogodo a̱ wu.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />E te ɗe ama a̱ ta̱wa̱ a masasan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">Ɗe ɗa aa ca kucci na ri mejege,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">adama a na o to rono diga a aba'un a mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">nu utsuru wu usokowu u wuyun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Adama a Gadu u damma ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">&lt;&lt;Za va aba'un a ɗa za na da̱shiyi upasu wa Gadu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gadu tsu von ta̱ tsu kamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">reve wu kara ekere hali na̱ mokkoto ma aaci.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />U ɗangulaa ta̱ aciya̱yi iɗa i na i la'ai ulobonu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Ɗe ɗa akunda a zagbain a̱ ri uzuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">A mantsa ma na azagbain a ama o ɓolotoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">u yuwan ta̱ ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ ya̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">u kuru ta̱ wila̱ u na a cayi aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Adama a Dan reve u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">&lt;&lt;Dan mawun ma kamu ma ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">za na aa 'yawusan diga Bashan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Adama a Nafutali a̱vu u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">&lt;&lt;Nafutali ta̱ tapu ni isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">waru u ta̱ tapu na aba'un a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">u ta tara agadu o upasu wu uyagi u mala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Adama a Asha waru reve u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">&lt;&lt;Asha ɗa la'ai aba'un a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">lyawa u tsura̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">Waru lyawa u tsupu ana a̱ yi a mani'in.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Lyawa na̱ntsu lyuci va̱ wu vo o'wo vi irumu na̱ rumushili.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">Ucira wa̱ wu wo koto shi hali she na̱ vu kuwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />&lt;&lt;Za ro lo tsa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ Jeshurun shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">za na aa walasa zuva tsa̱ra̱ u kamba wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">za na cipa̱i diga zuva a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsa̱ yi.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />A̱sula̱ a na a̱ ri nu ufaru shi a̱yi ɗa uda̱na̱ta̱ wa̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">waru za̱la̱ va̱ wu ekere o ucira a̱ yi e te keɗe wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Reve u gba̱ra̱ n'yuwatan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">a̱vu u damma, &lt;Kototo le!&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa Isra'ila ri nden lafiya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Ugundo wa Yakubu u ta̱ nden gbaga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">e iɗa i na i ri ni ishina na̱ masayan ma sa'avu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">waru zuva va̱ yi ta̱ ɗa̱wusa̱ a'iza.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Za va aba'un a ɗa vu ri Isra'ila!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Zane ɗa ri tsa̱ ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ama a na A̱sulazuva a wawai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">A̱yi ɗa a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ ɗu ni ikambi i ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma tsugbain ma̱ ɗu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">N'yuwatan n ɗu n ta̱ kingyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">A̱ɗu gba i ta dasa cina̱ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Reve Musa 'yon diga a agalaci a̱ Mowa, reve u kumba a gawan Masasan ma Nebo a̱ tyo a̱ ncilecile ma Pisiga za na ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jeriko. Reve A̱sulazuva o roco yi iɗa'a suru diga Giliyadu hali a̱ tyo Dan, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />nu upasu wa Nafutali suru, ni iɗa ya Ifiramu na̱ Manase ni iɗa ya Yahuza suru hali a̱ tyo a̱livu a Mala ma Gbain, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />na̱ Nege nu upasu'u suru diga o Uka̱ri wa̱ Jeriko, Lyuci Gbain vu Shuwa hali a̱ tyo Zowa. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa iɗa i na n kucinayi Ibrahim ni Ishiyaku na̱ Yakubu, na n dammai, &lt;N ta ca limatan le.&gt; N lyawa wu ta̱ ve ene yi ne esu a̱ wu amma vaa pasa vu uwa pe shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Reve Musa aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ kuwa̱ ɗe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa cine A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ ciɗo yi pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa, o uka̱ri a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Bet Peyo, hali na ana'an ko za lo na revei uba̱ta̱ u na aaso'on u ri shi. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Musa da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ukpaku nu ushin (120) ana u kuwa̱i, suru na̱ ne, esu a̱ yi a̱ ɗa̱mba̱ shi, a̱yi waru gba ubuwu nu ucira. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwan nden n wirota̱ adama a Musa a agalaci a̱ Mowa, hali rana mata'atsu, hali she na mantsa ma̱ mesun mo kotoi.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Josuwa ulobo wa̱ Nun u ta̱ tapu na̱ ruhu vu urevu adama a na Musa kuruwa̱ yi ta̱ ekere. Reve aza a Isra'ila a yuwaan yi tsutoni, a̱vu a yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a dammai Musa.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Diga a mantsa'a koto a̱ da̱shi tsura̱ vumava̱sula̱ tsa Musa waru shi za na A̱sulazuva e revei esu ne esu, <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />za na yuwain iroci ya asalama ni ili ya asalama suru i na A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu niyi u yuwan a̱tsuma̱ a Masar ya Firi'awuna na̱ ya azagbain a̱ yi suru ne e iɗa ya̱ yi suru. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Adama a na babu vuma na rocoi linga vu ucira ko u yuwain cu'un vu linga gbagbain wovon na Musa yuwain e esu a aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>